(473394, 45627, 3317, '<td valign="top">the strongest part is the tricolor in the middle, or maybe i''m just exited because it matches the steel pulse t-shirt i''m wearing. whatever the case, i''d''ve ditched most everything else and concentrated on that burst of sweet color. but don''t get me wrong, this is a nice picture.</td>', 'the strongest part is the tricolor in the middle, or maybe i''m just exited because it matches the steel pulse t-shirt i''m wearing. whatever the case, i''d''ve ditched most everything else and concentrated on that burst of sweet color. but don''t get me wrong, this is a nice picture.', '2003-11-05 09:38:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(473397, 45299, 772, '<td valign="top">The image would probably work better for me if there was some more light on the ball.  The ball is probably suffering from motion blur here due to a slower shutter speed under these lighting conditions.  That does not really support the ''still life'' idea when you think about it...</td>', 'The image would probably work better for me if there was some more light on the ball.  The ball is probably suffering from motion blur here due to a slower shutter speed under these lighting conditions.  That does not really support the ''still life'' idea when you think about it...', '2003-11-05 09:39:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(473398, 45236, 3317, '<td valign="top">you picked the right depth of field, with the important detail up front, the shapes in the back still understandable. good job. looks tasty, better than the bland whatever brew they serve here at the office.</td>', 'you picked the right depth of field, with the important detail up front, the shapes in the back still understandable. good job. looks tasty, better than the bland whatever brew they serve here at the office.', '2003-11-05 09:39:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(473400, 45248, 3317, '<td valign="top">impressive macro lens on that camera of yours, can almost read the text.</td>', 'impressive macro lens on that camera of yours, can almost read the text.', '2003-11-05 09:40:14.000000', NULL, 1),
