(473410, 45568, 3317, '<td valign="top">kinda more of a portrait, but it''s impressive, i''d''ve entered it too ''cause it''s pretty and a rare shot, though it kinda stretches the theme of the challenge.</td>', 'kinda more of a portrait, but it''s impressive, i''d''ve entered it too ''cause it''s pretty and a rare shot, though it kinda stretches the theme of the challenge.', '2003-11-05 09:44:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(473411, 45620, 772, '<td valign="top">Very nice job with the lighting on this image. One thing you may want to consider on an image like this is the visibility of the surface.  Your dolls appear to be floating in space.  Personally, I enjoy a bit of anchoring on an image like this with some visible surface :)</td>', 'Very nice job with the lighting on this image. One thing you may want to consider on an image like this is the visibility of the surface.  Your dolls appear to be floating in space.  Personally, I enjoy a bit of anchoring on an image like this with some visible surface :)', '2003-11-05 09:44:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(473412, 45058, 3317, '<td valign="top">very very nice. way to preserve the detail and textures of both foreground and background, great natural light.</td>', 'very very nice. way to preserve the detail and textures of both foreground and background, great natural light.', '2003-11-05 09:44:43.000000', NULL, 1),
