(473432, 45053, 3317, '<td valign="top">from Wishbone, by Clutch:<br/>(Fallon, Gaster, Maines, Sult)<br/>For Thanksgiving we had ''tatas, succotash, and rudebagas.<br/>Then came turkey from the oven.<br/>Broke the wishbone. Covenants were sealed and set.<br/>On the losing end of a wishbone and I won''t pretend not to mind.<br/>Christmas Eve we ate at Aunty''s. We had some ham glazed with honey.<br/>Rolled the Yule log on the fire. Threw the hambone to the dogs and went to<br/>bed.<br/>On the losing end of a wishbone and I won''t pretend not to mind.<br/>On the losing end of a wishbone and I won''t pretend not to mind.</td>', 'from Wishbone, by Clutch:(Fallon, Gaster, Maines, Sult)For Thanksgiving we had ''tatas, succotash, and rudebagas.Then came turkey from the oven.Broke the wishbone. Covenants were sealed and set.On the losing end of a wishbone and I won''t pretend not to mind.Christmas Eve we ate at Aunty''s. We had some ham glazed with honey.Rolled the Yule log on the fire. Threw the hambone to the dogs and went tobed.On the losing end of a wishbone and I won''t pretend not to mind.On the losing end of a wishbone and I won''t pretend not to mind.', '2003-11-05 09:54:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(473434, 44883, 772, '<td valign="top">very nice work :)  I love the color...</td>', 'very nice work :)  I love the color...', '2003-11-05 09:55:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(473438, 44830, 772, '<td valign="top">excellent contrast, light, and shadow :)</td>', 'excellent contrast, light, and shadow :)', '2003-11-05 09:55:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(473439, 44902, 772, '<td valign="top">This is a nice photo.  I like the blue tone and the overall composition quite a bit.  I don''t vote based on the challenge topic, but if I did, you would lose point for this photo as a ''still life''.  A still life photo should not convey motion, and this one does :)</td>', 'This is a nice photo.  I like the blue tone and the overall composition quite a bit.  I don''t vote based on the challenge topic, but if I did, you would lose point for this photo as a ''still life''.  A still life photo should not convey motion, and this one does :)', '2003-11-05 09:57:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(473441, 45507, 772, '<td valign="top">I think this makes a nice black and white :)</td>', 'I think this makes a nice black and white :)', '2003-11-05 09:57:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(473443, 44903, 3317, '<td valign="top">more of a portrait, eh? the 3d look on the border makes it look like he''s about to pop out of the rectangle, into the room.</td>', 'more of a portrait, eh? the 3d look on the border makes it look like he''s about to pop out of the rectangle, into the room.', '2003-11-05 09:58:29.000000', NULL, 1),
