(473477, 44955, 327, '<td valign="top">Just a little soft on the focus, but the idea is so so good. Wow. Not sure I''d of thought of this in 100 years. Great idea, and composition.The backgroud could of been improved (red) a bit. Your lighting is very nice and adds to the over all shot. Creative and good eye.</td>', 'Just a little soft on the focus, but the idea is so so good. Wow. Not sure I''d of thought of this in 100 years. Great idea, and composition.The backgroud could of been improved (red) a bit. Your lighting is very nice and adds to the over all shot. Creative and good eye.', '2003-11-05 10:27:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(473481, 45100, 327, '<td valign="top">I like this but find the lighting to be detrimental to the over all shot. The bottom crop is also a bit of a distraction. Still I think the set up is very nicely done.</td>', 'I like this but find the lighting to be detrimental to the over all shot. The bottom crop is also a bit of a distraction. Still I think the set up is very nicely done.', '2003-11-05 10:29:54.000000', NULL, 1),
