(473512, 44694, 327, '<td valign="top">LOL I live in Beaverton, Oregon. Home of Nike .....They would love your shot for an add. It''s very nice. And the crop is good too. Way to go ..you should send it to them. p.s. the lighting is very nice.</td>', 'LOL I live in Beaverton, Oregon. Home of Nike .....They would love your shot for an add. It''s very nice. And the crop is good too. Way to go ..you should send it to them. p.s. the lighting is very nice.', '2003-11-05 10:46:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(473515, 45112, 13833, '<td valign="top">Very true to heart.</td>', 'Very true to heart.', '2003-11-05 10:47:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(473516, 45607, 327, '<td valign="top">Hard loss to N.E. Monday night. I like the subject and I like the composition and focus. Good job.</td>', 'Hard loss to N.E. Monday night. I like the subject and I like the composition and focus. Good job.', '2003-11-05 10:47:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(473519, 45399, 327, '<td valign="top">Hum, yummy shot. You''ve got a good eye. Interesting capture of shadows/light with texture. Nice going.</td>', 'Hum, yummy shot. You''ve got a good eye. Interesting capture of shadows/light with texture. Nice going.', '2003-11-05 10:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(473520, 45048, 6845, '<td valign="top">I like the light but the subject looks a little blurry. Good composition and the colors are pleasing.</td>', 'I like the light but the subject looks a little blurry. Good composition and the colors are pleasing.', '2003-11-05 10:49:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(473522, 44964, 13074, '<td valign="top">Wow! Did you actually paint the fruit???  The lack of light on the banana in the middle and the piece of fruit above the apple, along with the paint on the pineapple leaves are the only things stopping me giving this a 10. Brilliant. 9/10</td>', 'Wow! Did you actually paint the fruit???  The lack of light on the banana in the middle and the piece of fruit above the apple, along with the paint on the pineapple leaves are the only things stopping me giving this a 10. Brilliant. 9/10', '2003-11-05 10:51:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(473523, 45303, 6845, '<td valign="top">My wife cross-stitches alot. I can do it but I don''t. Good idea, the composition could use a little work though. Maybe a different angle or somthing like that. The light is a little harsh, but that being said you did a good job of keeping your whites from being hot or blown out.</td>', 'My wife cross-stitches alot. I can do it but I don''t. Good idea, the composition could use a little work though. Maybe a different angle or somthing like that. The light is a little harsh, but that being said you did a good job of keeping your whites from being hot or blown out.', '2003-11-05 10:52:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(473524, 45324, 327, '<td valign="top">Good shot.....very appealing to the eye. The dof is yummy.</td>', 'Good shot.....very appealing to the eye. The dof is yummy.', '2003-11-05 10:52:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(473525, 45353, 6845, '<td valign="top">Good idea. Good composition. The image looks a little tilted but other than that this is a nice shot. I like the soft light.</td>', 'Good idea. Good composition. The image looks a little tilted but other than that this is a nice shot. I like the soft light.', '2003-11-05 10:53:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(473527, 44552, 6845, '<td valign="top">Interesting take on the challenge. I like the composition but with the colors being so dull it doesn''t really pop out at me.</td>', 'Interesting take on the challenge. I like the composition but with the colors being so dull it doesn''t really pop out at me.', '2003-11-05 10:54:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(473528, 45376, 327, '<td valign="top">lol Great collection.....I love aliens, ufo\''s and all these guys JarJar!!</td>', 'lol Great collection.....I love aliens, ufo\''s and all these guys JarJar!!', '2003-11-05 10:54:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(473529, 45272, 327, '<td valign="top">lol, made me laugh.</td>', 'lol, made me laugh.', '2003-11-05 10:55:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(473530, 44863, 327, '<td valign="top">lol good humor.</td>', 'lol good humor.', '2003-11-05 10:55:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(473533, 44510, 6845, '<td valign="top">Interesting vignette effect. I think I would have liked the image better if the crop was tighter and the image was posted larger. I like the subject but the partial tree on the right is a little distracting.</td>', 'Interesting vignette effect. I think I would have liked the image better if the crop was tighter and the image was posted larger. I like the subject but the partial tree on the right is a little distracting.', '2003-11-05 10:57:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(473535, 45389, 327, '<td valign="top">Winner......really good. I love this one! How exciting this is to see. Good find. I like this one...9</td>', 'Winner......really good. I love this one! How exciting this is to see. Good find. I like this one...9', '2003-11-05 10:57:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(473536, 45564, 6845, '<td valign="top">Good subject matter. I personally would like to have seen this cropped in tighter though. The light is a little harsh for such a reflective matterial and created a few hot spots. But other than that I like the idea.</td>', 'Good subject matter. I personally would like to have seen this cropped in tighter though. The light is a little harsh for such a reflective matterial and created a few hot spots. But other than that I like the idea.', '2003-11-05 10:59:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(473540, 44814, 6845, '<td valign="top">Very nice landscape image. I really like the color, it makes the image seem peaceful and surreal. The light and composition are very pleasing as well.</td>', 'Very nice landscape image. I really like the color, it makes the image seem peaceful and surreal. The light and composition are very pleasing as well.', '2003-11-05 11:00:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(473542, 44498, 10673, '<td valign="top">Very beautifully done!  10</td>', 'Very beautifully done!  10', '2003-11-05 11:01:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(473546, 44722, 6845, '<td valign="top">I really like the subject and the composition. The light however is to harsh. In my opinion this image would have benefited from some softer, more dramatic light.</td>', 'I really like the subject and the composition. The light however is to harsh. In my opinion this image would have benefited from some softer, more dramatic light.', '2003-11-05 11:02:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(473548, 44814, 10673, '<td valign="top">Wonderfully captured &amp; composed!  Great use of lighting!  10</td>', 'Wonderfully captured & composed!  Great use of lighting!  10', '2003-11-05 11:03:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(473551, 45286, 11738, '<td valign="top">Nice colour, but sort of a bizarre set up.  The vertical stance of the glass does not seem to work with the horizontal stance of the pitcher.  An awful dark background for the title, even if that is OJ in the glass.</td>', 'Nice colour, but sort of a bizarre set up.  The vertical stance of the glass does not seem to work with the horizontal stance of the pitcher.  An awful dark background for the title, even if that is OJ in the glass.', '2003-11-05 11:04:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(473552, 45420, 6845, '<td valign="top">I like the composition and the light used. Personally I feel that the image could have benefited from more subject matter around and in front of the bowl. Maybe some orange slices or some nicely peeled peel. Or even some more kinds of fruit.</td>', 'I like the composition and the light used. Personally I feel that the image could have benefited from more subject matter around and in front of the bowl. Maybe some orange slices or some nicely peeled peel. Or even some more kinds of fruit.', '2003-11-05 11:05:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(473555, 45450, 6845, '<td valign="top">For me, the reflection in the water is too hot and distracts from the rest of the image. I like the composition and the light in the rest of the image is very pleasing.</td>', 'For me, the reflection in the water is too hot and distracts from the rest of the image. I like the composition and the light in the rest of the image is very pleasing.', '2003-11-05 11:06:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(473557, 45633, 10673, '<td valign="top">Beautiful!  Lovely composition!  10</td>', 'Beautiful!  Lovely composition!  10', '2003-11-05 11:07:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(473563, 45111, 6845, '<td valign="top">I like the set up and the composition. The light is also nice. Normally I am a big fan of shallow depth of field, but in this case I would have liked to have seen all of the pot in the back in focus. The sharp front with the blurred handel and spot, I find to be distracting.</td>', 'I like the set up and the composition. The light is also nice. Normally I am a big fan of shallow depth of field, but in this case I would have liked to have seen all of the pot in the back in focus. The sharp front with the blurred handel and spot, I find to be distracting.', '2003-11-05 11:09:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(473567, 45422, 6845, '<td valign="top">I like the idea, but the composition seems to be lacking. I think part of it is the window being right in the middle of the image. I like the effect the light makes and I like the shadows, however.</td>', 'I like the idea, but the composition seems to be lacking. I think part of it is the window being right in the middle of the image. I like the effect the light makes and I like the shadows, however.', '2003-11-05 11:10:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(473570, 45640, 675, '<td valign="top">i really like this concept a lot.  my only gripe is that the fracture isn''t striking enough.  great job...8</td>', 'i really like this concept a lot.  my only gripe is that the fracture isn''t striking enough.  great job...8', '2003-11-05 11:12:19.000000', NULL, 1),
