(473731, 45167, 6845, '<td valign="top">Ireally like the soft, warm light used. I personally would have liked to have seen a different angle used or maybe looking up at or down on the subject. The composition just seems a little boring to me.</td>', 'Ireally like the soft, warm light used. I personally would have liked to have seen a different angle used or maybe looking up at or down on the subject. The composition just seems a little boring to me.', '2003-11-05 12:10:15.000000', NULL, 1),
