(473854, 44902, 10959, '<td valign="top">Neat shot--cool lighting.  I''m not sure it meets the classic definition of a still life, especially with the running water, but I like it anyway. 6</td>', 'Neat shot--cool lighting.  I''m not sure it meets the classic definition of a still life, especially with the running water, but I like it anyway. 6', '2003-11-05 13:14:35.000000', NULL, 1),
