(473889, 44493, 11486, '<td valign="top">Looks lonley, the background is very overexpoced, but I like it anyway.</td>', 'Looks lonley, the background is very overexpoced, but I like it anyway.', '2003-11-05 13:32:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(473891, 45208, 5082, '<td valign="top">Looks like you needed to use a different WB setting, there is a definite blue cast from the shade under the tree.  If you opened up the Channel Mixer in PS, and set the "Blue" channel from +100 to +50, you''d get an idea of just how better the colors for this shot could have been... perhaps closer to what you saw with your eyes in the first place.</td>', 'Looks like you needed to use a different WB setting, there is a definite blue cast from the shade under the tree.  If you opened up the Channel Mixer in PS, and set the "Blue" channel from +100 to +50, you''d get an idea of just how better the colors for this shot could have been... perhaps closer to what you saw with your eyes in the first place.', '2003-11-05 13:33:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(473893, 45630, 12448, '<td valign="top">I''m guessing you were going for a dream like mood here?  It doesn''t work for me because the lighting looks to bright to pull that off.  Also the rock on the left is distracting.  And is that really a Coyote skull?  It''s looks so big next to the deer skull but then again it''s been ages since I''ve really seen either.  A 3</td>', 'I''m guessing you were going for a dream like mood here?  It doesn''t work for me because the lighting looks to bright to pull that off.  Also the rock on the left is distracting.  And is that really a Coyote skull?  It''s looks so big next to the deer skull but then again it''s been ages since I''ve really seen either.  A 3', '2003-11-05 13:33:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(473894, 45058, 9907, '<td valign="top">excellent..10</td>', 'excellent..10', '2003-11-05 13:33:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(473898, 44853, 13759, '<td valign="top">Argh... She kiss a dog! Dogs, don´t brush the tooths.</td>', 'Argh... She kiss a dog! Dogs, don´t brush the tooths.', '2003-11-05 13:35:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(473899, 44863, 12448, '<td valign="top">A cute idea and it has great potential but the plant should have been behind the dog, the one stem cuts his face and eye in half.  Also the angle of the shot is a bit disorienting, not in a good way and the overall size is wanting.  Could also be a tad brighter.  A 3</td>', 'A cute idea and it has great potential but the plant should have been behind the dog, the one stem cuts his face and eye in half.  Also the angle of the shot is a bit disorienting, not in a good way and the overall size is wanting.  Could also be a tad brighter.  A 3', '2003-11-05 13:35:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(473906, 45571, 3569, '<td valign="top">Focus appears off, to my score is too.</td>', 'Focus appears off, to my score is too.', '2003-11-05 13:37:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(473907, 45571, 12448, '<td valign="top">Been there, done that, chain smoking when I was really, REALLY, <b>REALLY</b> angry!    Good set up but the shot is still wanting.  The focus needs to be sharper and the cropping is off.  The cutting off the the filter and the corner of the crumpled pack is distracting.  I had a 3 on tis but will go to a 4 since the lighting is well done and the colors look really good.</td>', 'Been there, done that, chain smoking when I was really, REALLY, REALLY angry!    Good set up but the shot is still wanting.  The focus needs to be sharper and the cropping is off.  The cutting off the the filter and the corner of the crumpled pack is distracting.  I had a 3 on tis but will go to a 4 since the lighting is well done and the colors look really good.', '2003-11-05 13:37:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(473909, 45058, 13759, '<td valign="top">This is not still life, like mine.</td>', 'This is not still life, like mine.', '2003-11-05 13:38:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(473911, 45375, 3569, '<td valign="top">a bit of contrast would help.</td>', 'a bit of contrast would help.', '2003-11-05 13:39:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(473912, 45399, 12448, '<td valign="top">I''m guessing you were going for a prison cell shot?  I didn''t really get it at first but that is what comes across.  Not sure this really meets the challenge subject and the lighting and coloration really don''t appeal to me personally.  The angle of the shot is decent and the shadows are nice but the focus is also wanting.  a 3</td>', 'I''m guessing you were going for a prison cell shot?  I didn''t really get it at first but that is what comes across.  Not sure this really meets the challenge subject and the lighting and coloration really don''t appeal to me personally.  The angle of the shot is decent and the shadows are nice but the focus is also wanting.  a 3', '2003-11-05 13:40:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(473916, 45253, 12448, '<td valign="top">A unique idea and you get a point for that.  But the shot itself is wanting, the angle, the color, the lack of light or contrast and the panel in the back is very distracting.  A 3</td>', 'A unique idea and you get a point for that.  But the shot itself is wanting, the angle, the color, the lack of light or contrast and the panel in the back is very distracting.  A 3', '2003-11-05 13:45:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(473917, 45291, 12448, '<td valign="top">Not sure what this had to do with Still life as it''s live people and they are moving! The shot is not very appealing overall, the cropping or lack, her head getting cut off doesn''t work for me and the blurring lights on the bottom are very distracting.  A 1</td>', 'Not sure what this had to do with Still life as it''s live people and they are moving! The shot is not very appealing overall, the cropping or lack, her head getting cut off doesn''t work for me and the blurring lights on the bottom are very distracting.  A 1', '2003-11-05 13:47:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(473918, 45450, 12448, '<td valign="top">A different take but not really working with the challenge.  The power or phone line across the top is very distracting and the sun or moon is overexposed and there is no focus or focal point in the shot.  A 3</td>', 'A different take but not really working with the challenge.  The power or phone line across the top is very distracting and the sun or moon is overexposed and there is no focus or focal point in the shot.  A 3', '2003-11-05 13:48:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(473920, 45609, 12448, '<td valign="top">In the thumbnail this looked very interesting but when I clicked the link I was brought into chaos! :)  The focus is wanting, the lighting is sparatic and there is no sense of order, a bit disorienting.  A 3</td>', 'In the thumbnail this looked very interesting but when I clicked the link I was brought into chaos! :)  The focus is wanting, the lighting is sparatic and there is no sense of order, a bit disorienting.  A 3', '2003-11-05 13:49:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(473923, 45527, 4008, '<td valign="top">I like the blue glow created in this image. I would have cropped closer to avoid the edge of the table in the bottom right corner. And maybe try a lower viewpoint so as not the emphase so much it is on a table.</td>', 'I like the blue glow created in this image. I would have cropped closer to avoid the edge of the table in the bottom right corner. And maybe try a lower viewpoint so as not the emphase so much it is on a table.', '2003-11-05 13:51:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(473924, 45079, 12448, '<td valign="top">A persian kitten!  You get a point for that alone because I love persians! :)  But sadly that is all that qualifies for this challenge, the subject is alive and moving as seen by the blurriness in the shot and the tongue action.  The cropping is wanting, the one ear getting cut off really hurts the shot and the black wavy line on the right is very distracting.  A 3</td>', 'A persian kitten!  You get a point for that alone because I love persians! :)  But sadly that is all that qualifies for this challenge, the subject is alive and moving as seen by the blurriness in the shot and the tongue action.  The cropping is wanting, the one ear getting cut off really hurts the shot and the black wavy line on the right is very distracting.  A 3', '2003-11-05 13:51:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(473926, 45429, 12448, '<td valign="top">Some are going to question if this really fits the challenge but I''ll leave that to them.  The shot itself is slightly off kilter and the noise in the shot is distracting.  The light and contrast are also wanting and the color seems dull.  A 3</td>', 'Some are going to question if this really fits the challenge but I''ll leave that to them.  The shot itself is slightly off kilter and the noise in the shot is distracting.  The light and contrast are also wanting and the color seems dull.  A 3', '2003-11-05 13:52:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(473928, 44923, 11486, '<td valign="top">interesting composition that i like, but i feel the rose is a bit soft... 7 points</td>', 'interesting composition that i like, but i feel the rose is a bit soft... 7 points', '2003-11-05 13:54:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(473929, 45428, 12448, '<td valign="top">Not sure how this meets the challenge but I''ll give you the benifit of the doubt on that one.  The shot is out of focus overall except for the very top of the broom bristles.  The brightness of the shot is wanting and the contrast, or lack of causes the picture to look dull.  A 3</td>', 'Not sure how this meets the challenge but I''ll give you the benifit of the doubt on that one.  The shot is out of focus overall except for the very top of the broom bristles.  The brightness of the shot is wanting and the contrast, or lack of causes the picture to look dull.  A 3', '2003-11-05 13:54:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(473930, 45083, 4008, '<td valign="top">A good combination of warm colors in this traditional setup. A bit too many reflections, especially the one in the glass. Some black sheets could have prevented this.</td>', 'A good combination of warm colors in this traditional setup. A bit too many reflections, especially the one in the glass. Some black sheets could have prevented this.', '2003-11-05 13:55:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(473931, 45434, 12448, '<td valign="top">A different idea no doubt but the flourescent lights really hurt you on this one.  If you had been able to get higher so they would be a factor.  Also the focus is just off and the lack of color or contrast really makes the picture a bit dull.  A 3</td>', 'A different idea no doubt but the flourescent lights really hurt you on this one.  If you had been able to get higher so they would be a factor.  Also the focus is just off and the lack of color or contrast really makes the picture a bit dull.  A 3', '2003-11-05 13:55:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(473932, 45374, 12448, '<td valign="top">A good idea but not done very well.  The shot is fuzzy, not cropped very well, the lighting is wanting, the sun in the middle of the pond looks too bright while the rest is too dark.  There isn''t enough contrast to make this picture really pop out.  A 3</td>', 'A good idea but not done very well.  The shot is fuzzy, not cropped very well, the lighting is wanting, the sun in the middle of the pond looks too bright while the rest is too dark.  There isn''t enough contrast to make this picture really pop out.  A 3', '2003-11-05 13:56:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(473934, 44998, 4008, '<td valign="top">Great lighting inthis product shot, good combination of colors, love how the light accentuates the edges.</td>', 'Great lighting inthis product shot, good combination of colors, love how the light accentuates the edges.', '2003-11-05 13:57:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(473935, 44713, 11486, '<td valign="top">Poor little thing! And a photo that realy gives an alone feeling!</td>', 'Poor little thing! And a photo that realy gives an alone feeling!', '2003-11-05 13:58:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(473937, 44833, 12448, '<td valign="top">A nice shot overall but a bit too much for a still life to me.  If you had focuses in on the little church on the chair or just the chair I think it would have worked much better for this challenge.  As is, there is too much going on, to many things are distracting me and I can''t see what you might have wanted the main focus of the shot to be.  Also the lighting is a bit off, a bit more brightness in the post processing perhaps?  A 3</td>', 'A nice shot overall but a bit too much for a still life to me.  If you had focuses in on the little church on the chair or just the chair I think it would have worked much better for this challenge.  As is, there is too much going on, to many things are distracting me and I can''t see what you might have wanted the main focus of the shot to be.  Also the lighting is a bit off, a bit more brightness in the post processing perhaps?  A 3', '2003-11-05 13:58:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(473940, 45532, 8759, '<td valign="top">Too much contrast and lightness. Spoils the natural light.</td>', 'Too much contrast and lightness. Spoils the natural light.', '2003-11-05 13:59:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(473942, 45021, 12448, '<td valign="top">Oy!  The post processing on this ruined this shot for me.  :(  I think if you had left it alone and gone with something closer to the original I would have gone much higher, as is, a 3</td>', 'Oy!  The post processing on this ruined this shot for me.  :(  I think if you had left it alone and gone with something closer to the original I would have gone much higher, as is, a 3', '2003-11-05 13:59:19.000000', NULL, 1),
