(474246, 45620, 13336, '<td valign="top">i think there is a bit too much negative space here.  interesting choice of subject.  i don''t know if the all black backround is helping entirely either.  the closer and longer i look, the more i am able to barely make out that there are folds in the velvet cloth they are standing on.  until i saw this, which is not really apparant, it looked as though these dolls were just floating.  i gave it a 7</td>', 'i think there is a bit too much negative space here.  interesting choice of subject.  i don''t know if the all black backround is helping entirely either.  the closer and longer i look, the more i am able to barely make out that there are folds in the velvet cloth they are standing on.  until i saw this, which is not really apparant, it looked as though these dolls were just floating.  i gave it a 7', '2003-11-05 17:01:39.000000', NULL, 1),
