(474382, 44949, 1143, '<td valign="top">too dark  ;P  just kidding! i love the drama. cool way to compose the shot. good use of negative space. i''d like to see a little more light on the top part of the bottle. technically this is a really good shot but it actually doesn''t have a lot of emotion for me personally. it does fit the challenge well though which is more than can be said about a lot of these pics.</td>', 'too dark  ;P  just kidding! i love the drama. cool way to compose the shot. good use of negative space. i''d like to see a little more light on the top part of the bottle. technically this is a really good shot but it actually doesn''t have a lot of emotion for me personally. it does fit the challenge well though which is more than can be said about a lot of these pics.', '2003-11-05 18:10:55.000000', NULL, 1),
