(474386, 44506, 1143, '<td valign="top">weird apples. i like the forms and lines. even the uniform color scheme is nice. although the vase blends in almost a little too well with the wall... maybe you could use shadows to separate the vase, table, and wall a little more. actually i think the vase and flower alone would make a nice shot... or a different shot using the apples without the flower.. focusing more on the folds in the fabric and the texture on the apples.</td>', 'weird apples. i like the forms and lines. even the uniform color scheme is nice. although the vase blends in almost a little too well with the wall... maybe you could use shadows to separate the vase, table, and wall a little more. actually i think the vase and flower alone would make a nice shot... or a different shot using the apples without the flower.. focusing more on the folds in the fabric and the texture on the apples.', '2003-11-05 18:13:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(474391, 45552, 1143, '<td valign="top">helicopters! i''d love to do a shot of one of these falling against a black background.. slow shutter with a flash at the end to freeze it at the bottom of the fall. interesting texture but this looks more like a found nature shot than a traditional set up still life.might also do with a tad more contrast</td>', 'helicopters! i''d love to do a shot of one of these falling against a black background.. slow shutter with a flash at the end to freeze it at the bottom of the fall. interesting texture but this looks more like a found nature shot than a traditional set up still life.might also do with a tad more contrast', '2003-11-05 18:15:06.000000', NULL, 1),
