(474583, 45383, 12448, '<td valign="top">But by regular definition not an actual still life shot per say so a point or two off for that.  As for the shot, nice looking dog, I love little bulldogs.  The lighting is basically good  but the size and the cropping is wanting for me.  The floor would be a great background for other shots, the lines leading you in and around.  A 4</td>', 'But by regular definition not an actual still life shot per say so a point or two off for that.  As for the shot, nice looking dog, I love little bulldogs.  The lighting is basically good  but the size and the cropping is wanting for me.  The floor would be a great background for other shots, the lines leading you in and around.  A 4', '2003-11-05 19:47:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(474586, 45588, 12448, '<td valign="top">Outside the norn but very well within the boundries ;)  I like the idea but the cropping seems off to me.  The line is leading me in but maybe if it was closer to the corner, more of an angular shot.  The big black border hurts this shot, either thinner or maybe a little lighter color.  A 4</td>', 'Outside the norn but very well within the boundries ;)  I like the idea but the cropping seems off to me.  The line is leading me in but maybe if it was closer to the corner, more of an angular shot.  The big black border hurts this shot, either thinner or maybe a little lighter color.  A 4', '2003-11-05 19:50:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(474589, 45139, 12448, '<td valign="top">Wow, what a dog, it is a dog right? ;)  Very interesting choice for the shot, the background does help add to the shot a bit but the lighting and the shadow on the left are a bit distracting.  The white and gold is very bright and a bit overpowering in the shot.  It just doesn''t appeal to me on a personal basis either, not my style per say.  A 4</td>', 'Wow, what a dog, it is a dog right? ;)  Very interesting choice for the shot, the background does help add to the shot a bit but the lighting and the shadow on the left are a bit distracting.  The white and gold is very bright and a bit overpowering in the shot.  It just doesn''t appeal to me on a personal basis either, not my style per say.  A 4', '2003-11-05 19:55:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(474591, 45558, 11005, '<td valign="top">Get a haircut, hippy!  ;)</td>', 'Get a haircut, hippy!  ;)', '2003-11-05 20:01:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(474593, 45405, 12448, '<td valign="top">This looks very yummy, I love salmon :)  As for the shot, the cropping is off to me, if you had had more even parts in the corners, they are distracting being all different.  The colors are good but for some reason I think they could pop just a bit more.    I had started this at a 4 but after re=examining it I''m going to a 6</td>', 'This looks very yummy, I love salmon :)  As for the shot, the cropping is off to me, if you had had more even parts in the corners, they are distracting being all different.  The colors are good but for some reason I think they could pop just a bit more.    I had started this at a 4 but after re=examining it I''m going to a 6', '2003-11-05 20:03:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(474595, 44791, 12327, '<td valign="top">this image really cracks me up... talk about "moist"...</td>', 'this image really cracks me up... talk about "moist"...', '2003-11-05 20:06:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(474596, 45291, 9581, '<td valign="top">Darn that is wild! How did you do that?????? I really like how it jumps out at you it also reminds me of how a camera takes pictures using film and it is exposed? Is that possibly a answer, there is a feature on your camera to overlap? Anyways really like......</td>', 'Darn that is wild! How did you do that?????? I really like how it jumps out at you it also reminds me of how a camera takes pictures using film and it is exposed? Is that possibly a answer, there is a feature on your camera to overlap? Anyways really like......', '2003-11-05 20:07:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(474598, 45575, 12448, '<td valign="top">Perfect interpitation of still life, wine, cheese, cracker, really, really bit caviar ;)  The shot seems a bit noisy to me and the DOF is wanting on this one.  The cutting off of the trya on the bottom is distracting and the while lace cloth, if it was in the whole shot would have worked very nicely.  Also a bit more light would really help this shot, maybe a left to right light?  A 4</td>', 'Perfect interpitation of still life, wine, cheese, cracker, really, really bit caviar ;)  The shot seems a bit noisy to me and the DOF is wanting on this one.  The cutting off of the trya on the bottom is distracting and the while lace cloth, if it was in the whole shot would have worked very nicely.  Also a bit more light would really help this shot, maybe a left to right light?  A 4', '2003-11-05 20:10:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(474601, 45605, 12327, '<td valign="top">For me, "still life" should not have any human or animal elements in it, but as far as this image goes, it''s excellent.  perfect ligthing.</td>', 'For me, "still life" should not have any human or animal elements in it, but as far as this image goes, it''s excellent.  perfect ligthing.', '2003-11-05 20:12:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(474602, 45354, 6504, '<td valign="top">For me, this is the winner!  The textures, shapes, light, shadows..  all excellent.<br/>Very unusual items and pleasing to look at.    Beautiful shot.</td>', 'For me, this is the winner!  The textures, shapes, light, shadows..  all excellent.Very unusual items and pleasing to look at.    Beautiful shot.', '2003-11-05 20:13:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(474603, 45442, 6504, '<td valign="top">Clarity is great.  Sure to finish on top.  The green apples against the steel is a nice contrast.  Very good.</td>', 'Clarity is great.  Sure to finish on top.  The green apples against the steel is a nice contrast.  Very good.', '2003-11-05 20:14:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(474604, 44962, 11096, '<td valign="top">Great picture but I don''t think it meets the challenge.</td>', 'Great picture but I don''t think it meets the challenge.', '2003-11-05 20:14:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(474606, 45348, 6504, '<td valign="top">Beautiful composition, colors, lighting, subject.  All --- excellent.  Could not criticize anything about it.    And all very creative on top of it.</td>', 'Beautiful composition, colors, lighting, subject.  All --- excellent.  Could not criticize anything about it.    And all very creative on top of it.', '2003-11-05 20:15:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(474607, 45530, 6504, '<td valign="top">Macintosh are my favorites, besides that, the lighting, color and compostion is very good.   Should finish in the top.</td>', 'Macintosh are my favorites, besides that, the lighting, color and compostion is very good.   Should finish in the top.', '2003-11-05 20:16:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(474608, 45397, 806, '<td valign="top">beautiful color, good composition, good definition/clarity. interest level = moderate.</td>', 'beautiful color, good composition, good definition/clarity. interest level = moderate.', '2003-11-05 20:17:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(474610, 45430, 806, '<td valign="top">moderately interesting subject/composition. I am not so fond of the spotlight. I also believe the image could have a vertical framing/crop to emphasize the height of the arrangement.</td>', 'moderately interesting subject/composition. I am not so fond of the spotlight. I also believe the image could have a vertical framing/crop to emphasize the height of the arrangement.', '2003-11-05 20:19:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(474611, 45290, 806, '<td valign="top">nostalgic, nice to view. I like the items incorporated, but feel the pocket watch could be a bit closer to the cup to hold the composition together.</td>', 'nostalgic, nice to view. I like the items incorporated, but feel the pocket watch could be a bit closer to the cup to hold the composition together.', '2003-11-05 20:20:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(474615, 44711, 806, '<td valign="top">this needs a third level to create a geometric. the apples or grapes on the floor, the bottle is tall.. something in the middle.. maybe elevate one of the groups or some of the fruit. Also, the bottle seems a bit tilted to me (to the right).<br/>I like the lighting.. gives a warm and inviting feeling.</td>', 'this needs a third level to create a geometric. the apples or grapes on the floor, the bottle is tall.. something in the middle.. maybe elevate one of the groups or some of the fruit. Also, the bottle seems a bit tilted to me (to the right).I like the lighting.. gives a warm and inviting feeling.', '2003-11-05 20:22:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(474617, 44584, 806, '<td valign="top">nice lighting.. interesting composition... like the curve of the set up.<br/>moderate interest level.</td>', 'nice lighting.. interesting composition... like the curve of the set up.moderate interest level.', '2003-11-05 20:24:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(474619, 44985, 806, '<td valign="top">I think this could use a slight contrast boost. Interesting scene.</td>', 'I think this could use a slight contrast boost. Interesting scene.', '2003-11-05 20:25:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(474620, 44482, 13136, '<td valign="top">Was that intentional?</td>', 'Was that intentional?', '2003-11-05 20:25:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(474622, 44526, 806, '<td valign="top">nice lighting, colors, textures. moderate to fair interest level.</td>', 'nice lighting, colors, textures. moderate to fair interest level.', '2003-11-05 20:26:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(474624, 45477, 806, '<td valign="top">this feels too spread out. I''d like to see the items grouped closer together, and forming a familiar geometric shape. I like the tones and lighting very much.</td>', 'this feels too spread out. I''d like to see the items grouped closer together, and forming a familiar geometric shape. I like the tones and lighting very much.', '2003-11-05 20:28:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(474626, 45452, 806, '<td valign="top">wonderful use of light... great textures and tones. makes me wonder about the story behind it.</td>', 'wonderful use of light... great textures and tones. makes me wonder about the story behind it.', '2003-11-05 20:29:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(474628, 45307, 806, '<td valign="top">interesting idea.. lighting a bit bright.. would like to see early morning quality light here. whipped cream or thicker shaving cream would really add to this too.</td>', 'interesting idea.. lighting a bit bright.. would like to see early morning quality light here. whipped cream or thicker shaving cream would really add to this too.', '2003-11-05 20:31:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(474629, 44966, 9581, '<td valign="top">Very Nice! All the colors and shadows! Makes for a picture to hang in the house ! <br/>I like the title too!</td>', 'Very Nice! All the colors and shadows! Makes for a picture to hang in the house ! I like the title too!', '2003-11-05 20:31:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(474651, 45430, 7810, '<td valign="top">wicked colours...a little bit oversharpened</td>', 'wicked colours...a little bit oversharpened', '2003-11-05 21:01:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(474652, 44998, 7810, '<td valign="top">i like the colours...cruel what some people do to potatoes!!</td>', 'i like the colours...cruel what some people do to potatoes!!', '2003-11-05 21:03:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(474654, 45384, 10634, '<td valign="top">A larger shot with the coins more in focus would have been better in my eyes. Otherwise a nice shot.</td>', 'A larger shot with the coins more in focus would have been better in my eyes. Otherwise a nice shot.', '2003-11-05 21:09:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(474656, 45112, 4482, '<td valign="top">Brilliant idea! Unfortunately,.... A backdrop would solve many problems and I would choose black to highlight the items! 6</td>', 'Brilliant idea! Unfortunately,.... A backdrop would solve many problems and I would choose black to highlight the items! 6', '2003-11-05 21:09:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(474657, 45086, 4482, '<td valign="top">hehehehehe 6</td>', 'hehehehehe 6', '2003-11-05 21:10:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(474661, 44722, 7969, '<td valign="top">This is a gorgeous flower, and a good shot of it, I am just wishing the background were a different color so the flower really ''pops'', I am thinking black would be good.</td>', 'This is a gorgeous flower, and a good shot of it, I am just wishing the background were a different color so the flower really ''pops'', I am thinking black would be good.', '2003-11-05 21:15:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(474666, 44552, 10634, '<td valign="top">I think if at least one tire was complete this would look better. otherwise, I really like this shot.</td>', 'I think if at least one tire was complete this would look better. otherwise, I really like this shot.', '2003-11-05 21:30:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(474667, 45462, 10634, '<td valign="top">DOF would have helped a bit. If the front keys were in better focus, they would have drawn the eye into the picture better. wonderful idea... I just love the piano.</td>', 'DOF would have helped a bit. If the front keys were in better focus, they would have drawn the eye into the picture better. wonderful idea... I just love the piano.', '2003-11-05 21:33:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(474668, 44854, 10634, '<td valign="top">the flower on the table was a bit distracting. My eye followed the vase up and then was yanked back down to that flower.</td>', 'the flower on the table was a bit distracting. My eye followed the vase up and then was yanked back down to that flower.', '2003-11-05 21:34:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(474669, 45255, 10634, '<td valign="top">Missing the bottle tops, it feels cut off.</td>', 'Missing the bottle tops, it feels cut off.', '2003-11-05 21:37:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(474670, 45594, 10634, '<td valign="top">Very nice shot. Different.</td>', 'Very nice shot. Different.', '2003-11-05 21:38:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(474671, 44883, 10634, '<td valign="top">I think the chest was interesting enough without the beads. It has so much detail itself.</td>', 'I think the chest was interesting enough without the beads. It has so much detail itself.', '2003-11-05 21:39:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(474673, 44987, 10959, '<td valign="top">LOL...bored at the office?  That is so dumb, I think I have to give you a 7. :-)</td>', 'LOL...bored at the office?  That is so dumb, I think I have to give you a 7. :-)', '2003-11-05 21:42:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(474675, 45550, 10959, '<td valign="top">Wow--a classic still life, well executed.  Every item in the frame is there for a reason.  The crystal bowl echos the glasses, and the gold ribbon echos the color in the bottle\''s label very nicely.  Supurb.  10.</td>', 'Wow--a classic still life, well executed.  Every item in the frame is there for a reason.  The crystal bowl echos the glasses, and the gold ribbon echos the color in the bottle\''s label very nicely.  Supurb.  10.', '2003-11-05 21:44:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(474676, 45008, 327, '<td valign="top">I hope this makes the top three. I really like it. The color is yummy and it''s good to look at. Good luck.</td>', 'I hope this makes the top three. I really like it. The color is yummy and it''s good to look at. Good luck.', '2003-11-05 21:49:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(474677, 45452, 327, '<td valign="top">I like this shot. It''s hard to add anything constructive in my comment. I just wanted you to know that I love this and the feeling it gives.</td>', 'I like this shot. It''s hard to add anything constructive in my comment. I just wanted you to know that I love this and the feeling it gives.', '2003-11-05 21:50:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(474678, 44505, 327, '<td valign="top">Nice shooting. Nothing negative to say, just compliments to you! Good luck.</td>', 'Nice shooting. Nothing negative to say, just compliments to you! Good luck.', '2003-11-05 21:51:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(474679, 45442, 327, '<td valign="top">Little fried on the left.....still I like this shot. The texture of the knife handle the basket weave...all good. The whole shot is very pleasing. Good luck I hope this does well. I sure like it.</td>', 'Little fried on the left.....still I like this shot. The texture of the knife handle the basket weave...all good. The whole shot is very pleasing. Good luck I hope this does well. I sure like it.', '2003-11-05 21:52:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(474680, 45243, 327, '<td valign="top">Love it....<br/>Hope that is not too short of a comment. I really do like it. Creative, wonderful depth of color. Awesome shooting.</td>', 'Love it....Hope that is not too short of a comment. I really do like it. Creative, wonderful depth of color. Awesome shooting.', '2003-11-05 21:52:53.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(474681, 44553, 327, '<td valign="top">One word "Awesome".</td>', 'One word "Awesome".', '2003-11-05 21:53:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(474682, 44962, 327, '<td valign="top">Wonderful feeling and mood. Painting. Stunning color. Wow from me.</td>', 'Wonderful feeling and mood. Painting. Stunning color. Wow from me.', '2003-11-05 21:53:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(474683, 45312, 11508, '<td valign="top">It would have been nice to get a sharper focus. Nice layout, and colors too.</td>', 'It would have been nice to get a sharper focus. Nice layout, and colors too.', '2003-11-05 21:54:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(474685, 45053, 327, '<td valign="top">Super. You have a great eye for the understated. Poster for a food drive....?Hunger. Neat shot. Good luck.</td>', 'Super. You have a great eye for the understated. Poster for a food drive....?Hunger. Neat shot. Good luck.', '2003-11-05 21:54:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(474687, 44467, 327, '<td valign="top">Really a special shot, I hope others will take the time to see this shot. It''s good, very good. The light, the empty feeling.....all special.</td>', 'Really a special shot, I hope others will take the time to see this shot. It''s good, very good. The light, the empty feeling.....all special.', '2003-11-05 21:55:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(474689, 45016, 327, '<td valign="top">This has such a nice feeling....not sure if the color is doing it or the light? It feel Asian. &lt;Not sure that makes a lot of sense, just the feeling it gives me. I very much admire this photo. Good going. Best of luck to you.</td>', 'This has such a nice feeling....not sure if the color is doing it or the light? It feel Asian. <Not sure that makes a lot of sense, just the feeling it gives me. I very much admire this photo. Good going. Best of luck to you.', '2003-11-05 21:56:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(474690, 45507, 11508, '<td valign="top">This is Fabulous! I like your choice to make it a dark sepia. The focus is very pleasing, it is very sharp, I like the blury books in the backgroud. The book are an interesting choice for background with the flowers. The lighting is cool too, how the flowers cast there own shadow on themselves. Very good setup and composion, good job 7 :)</td>', 'This is Fabulous! I like your choice to make it a dark sepia. The focus is very pleasing, it is very sharp, I like the blury books in the backgroud. The book are an interesting choice for background with the flowers. The lighting is cool too, how the flowers cast there own shadow on themselves. Very good setup and composion, good job 7 :)', '2003-11-05 21:57:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(474691, 45451, 327, '<td valign="top">Very pretty shot. Not a lot to add. I like this. Top 10 easy. Colors are so rich and pure. Good work, and good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Very pretty shot. Not a lot to add. I like this. Top 10 easy. Colors are so rich and pure. Good work, and good luck in the challenge.', '2003-11-05 21:57:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(474693, 45208, 327, '<td valign="top">Bounty of colors and light. Stunning. I really like this shot. Best of luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Bounty of colors and light. Stunning. I really like this shot. Best of luck in the challenge.', '2003-11-05 21:58:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(474694, 45462, 11508, '<td valign="top">I think you could have gone very far with this photograph. Though it may be intentional on your part, I wish that the nearest black key was in focus, or more of it was in focus, a higher apeture. The blue and pinks in the back ground are distracting,  I would even considering going black and white with this photograph.</td>', 'I think you could have gone very far with this photograph. Though it may be intentional on your part, I wish that the nearest black key was in focus, or more of it was in focus, a higher apeture. The blue and pinks in the back ground are distracting,  I would even considering going black and white with this photograph.', '2003-11-05 21:59:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(474695, 44713, 327, '<td valign="top">Poor Pooh Bear. Lovely light on his face.....stunning shot. It''s sad and empy feeling. Really moving, and the tilt of his head is awesome. Great work. You''ll do well!! Good luck.</td>', 'Poor Pooh Bear. Lovely light on his face.....stunning shot. It''s sad and empy feeling. Really moving, and the tilt of his head is awesome. Great work. You''ll do well!! Good luck.', '2003-11-05 21:59:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(474696, 45236, 327, '<td valign="top">I would love to try some. Love coffee of any kind, darker the better! This is a nice clean, clear shot. Simple with a lot of interest. Well done.</td>', 'I would love to try some. Love coffee of any kind, darker the better! This is a nice clean, clear shot. Simple with a lot of interest. Well done.', '2003-11-05 22:00:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(474699, 45348, 11508, '<td valign="top">Wow! It is so vibrant!  The lighting is great, and various reflections on the spout is pleasing.  This is a neat interpetation of still life. 9</td>', 'Wow! It is so vibrant!  The lighting is great, and various reflections on the spout is pleasing.  This is a neat interpetation of still life. 9', '2003-11-05 22:01:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(474700, 45079, 327, '<td valign="top">Such a face.....can''t help but love this kitty. Wow cute one.</td>', 'Such a face.....can''t help but love this kitty. Wow cute one.', '2003-11-05 22:01:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(474701, 45259, 11508, '<td valign="top">Youv''e done a great job arranging the colors and heights. So blue and icy, and then the electric reds and oranges and yellows. The shadows are great too. Now all you''ve failed to do is magicly transport that little collection to my house. a 10, and a favorite of the challenge.</td>', 'Youv''e done a great job arranging the colors and heights. So blue and icy, and then the electric reds and oranges and yellows. The shadows are great too. Now all you''ve failed to do is magicly transport that little collection to my house. a 10, and a favorite of the challenge.', '2003-11-05 22:04:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(474702, 44635, 10918, '<td valign="top">I lke the offset- style composition.</td>', 'I lke the offset- style composition.', '2003-11-05 22:04:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(474704, 45291, 10634, '<td valign="top">This just doesn''t say still Life to me in any way shape or form. It''s a very interesting shot, and I can usually find some way that an image fits the challenge, but I have to admit that I am stumped here.</td>', 'This just doesn''t say still Life to me in any way shape or form. It''s a very interesting shot, and I can usually find some way that an image fits the challenge, but I have to admit that I am stumped here.', '2003-11-05 22:05:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(474706, 45595, 10918, '<td valign="top">Clever concept.</td>', 'Clever concept.', '2003-11-05 22:06:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(474708, 45404, 11508, '<td valign="top">The colors and lighting is so delicate, the angle is a little confusing, nice little shadows in the flower petals.</td>', 'The colors and lighting is so delicate, the angle is a little confusing, nice little shadows in the flower petals.', '2003-11-05 22:06:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(474709, 44504, 327, '<td valign="top">The photo is not bad, I can''t fault you for that. I could suggest a better composition. [messy backgroud]  I do fault the attitude in the title. I will guess you felt the title fit the shot. I will give you that. What I don''t know is, is this against the brand of beer, the beer, the beach?? I don''t get it. Sorry. Please correct me if I reading too much into this shot.</td>', 'The photo is not bad, I can''t fault you for that. I could suggest a better composition. [messy backgroud]  I do fault the attitude in the title. I will guess you felt the title fit the shot. I will give you that. What I don''t know is, is this against the brand of beer, the beer, the beach?? I don''t get it. Sorry. Please correct me if I reading too much into this shot.', '2003-11-05 22:07:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(474711, 45641, 327, '<td valign="top">Everything is good here and working, light, focus, color and mood. What is not working is the perspective view of the bowl....not enough cherries. If the camera was elevated or the bowl was full this would of been a 8-9 from me.</td>', 'Everything is good here and working, light, focus, color and mood. What is not working is the perspective view of the bowl....not enough cherries. If the camera was elevated or the bowl was full this would of been a 8-9 from me.', '2003-11-05 22:08:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(474712, 45375, 10634, '<td valign="top">A better background color would have made this better to me. If feels washed out. Also, maybe putting the pie in the upper part of the image and spreading the pecans around it would have been more attractive?</td>', 'A better background color would have made this better to me. If feels washed out. Also, maybe putting the pie in the upper part of the image and spreading the pecans around it would have been more attractive?', '2003-11-05 22:09:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(474713, 45627, 11508, '<td valign="top">I really like where you chose to place the little bowls. The lighting is very simple and clear, and the focus is very good. The balance of colors is great.  Good choice of border. I like this image very much, 8.</td>', 'I really like where you chose to place the little bowls. The lighting is very simple and clear, and the focus is very good. The balance of colors is great.  Good choice of border. I like this image very much, 8.', '2003-11-05 22:10:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(474715, 44916, 11508, '<td valign="top">Wish this had a better focus. Nice concept, and colors. I like the shadows on the rippling green cloth. Lighting is interesting, and pleasing, very soft.</td>', 'Wish this had a better focus. Nice concept, and colors. I like the shadows on the rippling green cloth. Lighting is interesting, and pleasing, very soft.', '2003-11-05 22:11:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(474716, 45037, 10634, '<td valign="top">the title leads me to believe that the paw is one of the subjects, therefore I think it needs to be more in focus and aligned with the figurines. Otherwise a great concept.</td>', 'the title leads me to believe that the paw is one of the subjects, therefore I think it needs to be more in focus and aligned with the figurines. Otherwise a great concept.', '2003-11-05 22:12:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(474717, 45537, 10634, '<td valign="top">Great idea, but the incomplete subjects make this more abstract for me. If the title didn''t tell me what these were I woudl really have to guess. technically a superb shot.</td>', 'Great idea, but the incomplete subjects make this more abstract for me. If the title didn''t tell me what these were I woudl really have to guess. technically a superb shot.', '2003-11-05 22:13:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(474718, 45060, 9581, '<td valign="top">I had the same thought run through my mind! I guess I didnt because I figured everyone would be doing photographs with fruits and such.... Good picture! Great angle on it too! Great minds think alike!</td>', 'I had the same thought run through my mind! I guess I didnt because I figured everyone would be doing photographs with fruits and such.... Good picture! Great angle on it too! Great minds think alike!', '2003-11-05 22:14:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(474720, 45112, 10634, '<td valign="top">Great idea. The bowl holding the baseballs detracts from the shot as does the hutch and chair in the background. Perhaps a baseball mitt instead of the bowl?</td>', 'Great idea. The bowl holding the baseballs detracts from the shot as does the hutch and chair in the background. Perhaps a baseball mitt instead of the bowl?', '2003-11-05 22:16:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(474721, 45319, 10634, '<td valign="top">A little more light on the crown to draw out the detail. Otherwise, a nice shot.</td>', 'A little more light on the crown to draw out the detail. Otherwise, a nice shot.', '2003-11-05 22:17:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(474724, 45289, 10634, '<td valign="top">I like the idea, but the eye doesn''t seem to have anyplace to rest. There doesn''t seem to be any flow... I wasn''t drawn into the shot, just thrown there.</td>', 'I like the idea, but the eye doesn''t seem to have anyplace to rest. There doesn''t seem to be any flow... I wasn''t drawn into the shot, just thrown there.', '2003-11-05 22:18:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(474725, 45603, 92, '<td valign="top">Wonderful !!!! The compostion, lighting and rich color tones and textures add up to a perfect 10</td>', 'Wonderful !!!! The compostion, lighting and rich color tones and textures add up to a perfect 10', '2003-11-05 22:19:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(474727, 44949, 10634, '<td valign="top">Very nice shot. Only thing I can say is that the loss of the top of the bottle doesn''t allow the eye to finish the journey up the photo. A little light thrown on the top would have completed this.</td>', 'Very nice shot. Only thing I can say is that the loss of the top of the bottle doesn''t allow the eye to finish the journey up the photo. A little light thrown on the top would have completed this.', '2003-11-05 22:20:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(474733, 45619, 10263, '<td valign="top">Nice composition. The tomatoes and bananas seem a little dark on the bottom, probably from the dark surface they are sitting on. I do like the reflection on the table though. And the lighting above is very nice.</td>', 'Nice composition. The tomatoes and bananas seem a little dark on the bottom, probably from the dark surface they are sitting on. I do like the reflection on the table though. And the lighting above is very nice.', '2003-11-05 22:26:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(474736, 45313, 10263, '<td valign="top">This is creative. I like it from both challenges. One of those things that make ya go hmmmm. Simple and thought provoking :)</td>', 'This is creative. I like it from both challenges. One of those things that make ya go hmmmm. Simple and thought provoking :)', '2003-11-05 22:29:26.000000', NULL, 1),
