(474740, 45070, 11817, '<td valign="top">Nice.</td>', 'Nice.', '2003-11-05 22:32:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(474742, 45611, 9906, '<td valign="top">Nice items for a theme for a still life shot.  It''s not very well organized though.  I would love to see for example the three dogs in a nice little arrangement with the same background a tighter crop and better lighting to eliminate the harsh shadows and give texure and depth!<br/>TC</td>', 'Nice items for a theme for a still life shot.  It''s not very well organized though.  I would love to see for example the three dogs in a nice little arrangement with the same background a tighter crop and better lighting to eliminate the harsh shadows and give texure and depth!TC', '2003-11-05 22:33:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(474743, 45074, 11817, '<td valign="top">Nice shot.</td>', 'Nice shot.', '2003-11-05 22:34:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(474746, 45208, 9462, '<td valign="top">lovely</td>', 'lovely', '2003-11-05 22:36:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(474748, 45552, 9906, '<td valign="top">Wonderfully original subjects for a still life!!!  Bonus for that!  The lighting however kind of lets you down a little.  I would also try pulling back a touch to get more background to frame the subject or tighter crop to eliminate it.  As is it makes the image lopsided.<br/>TC</td>', 'Wonderfully original subjects for a still life!!!  Bonus for that!  The lighting however kind of lets you down a little.  I would also try pulling back a touch to get more background to frame the subject or tighter crop to eliminate it.  As is it makes the image lopsided.TC', '2003-11-05 22:36:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(474750, 45046, 13342, '<td valign="top">I like your lighting, colors, tone. Very Nice. I think if the rings slightly overlapped on the petals, with diamonds in ring caught with some light, it would be perfect (personal preference.) I  give it a 9.</td>', 'I like your lighting, colors, tone. Very Nice. I think if the rings slightly overlapped on the petals, with diamonds in ring caught with some light, it would be perfect (personal preference.) I  give it a 9.', '2003-11-05 22:38:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(474756, 45079, 9462, '<td valign="top">On top of this pic being blurry it''s no where near still life.</td>', 'On top of this pic being blurry it''s no where near still life.', '2003-11-05 22:42:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(474762, 45318, 12448, '<td valign="top">Apples to Budda, interesting.  I like the idea, combining something traditional with something unique. :)  As for the shot, the soft light from the right is just a tad to soft for my taste personally and the left is just a little to dark, I would have liked to at least be able to see an outline of the left shoulder.  Also the focus is just a tad to soft for me.  I started this at a 4 but am raising it to a 6</td>', 'Apples to Budda, interesting.  I like the idea, combining something traditional with something unique. :)  As for the shot, the soft light from the right is just a tad to soft for my taste personally and the left is just a little to dark, I would have liked to at least be able to see an outline of the left shoulder.  Also the focus is just a tad to soft for me.  I started this at a 4 but am raising it to a 6', '2003-11-05 22:46:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(474763, 45642, 9906, '<td valign="top">Bonus for originality on this shot!  And the title helps to make it as it is.  Personally I would rather see the same shot without the pill bottle and with negative space instead, but always appreciate originality!<br/> What are the specks on the apple?  They are kind of distracting...<br/>You DID do a dang good job lighting up both subjects!<br/>TC</td>', 'Bonus for originality on this shot!  And the title helps to make it as it is.  Personally I would rather see the same shot without the pill bottle and with negative space instead, but always appreciate originality! What are the specks on the apple?  They are kind of distracting...You DID do a dang good job lighting up both subjects!TC', '2003-11-05 22:47:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(474764, 45539, 9462, '<td valign="top">Great idea:)</td>', 'Great idea:)', '2003-11-05 22:47:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(474766, 45426, 12448, '<td valign="top">She''s adorable and so deep in thought!  I like the idea you went with but as they would say does it really fit the Still Life challenge?  It''s all in personal preference.  As for the shot, it''s a bit small and the cropping is too tight on the top for me, you cut off those beautiful little curls and the imbalanced frame, the large top and bottom compared to the small sides is very distracting.  A 4</td>', 'She''s adorable and so deep in thought!  I like the idea you went with but as they would say does it really fit the Still Life challenge?  It''s all in personal preference.  As for the shot, it''s a bit small and the cropping is too tight on the top for me, you cut off those beautiful little curls and the imbalanced frame, the large top and bottom compared to the small sides is very distracting.  A 4', '2003-11-05 22:48:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(474767, 45450, 13342, '<td valign="top">I like the picture and the tone of the picture. I think it would be much more effective if the highwire was cropped out of the picture.</td>', 'I like the picture and the tone of the picture. I think it would be much more effective if the highwire was cropped out of the picture.', '2003-11-05 22:50:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(474769, 44723, 12448, '<td valign="top">My sister used to make these dolls.  I think I had about 4 of them when I was growing up.  She is still life without a doubt.  The cropping is a bit tight on the top, her bow got cut off and the bottom part, what is that on her hair?  It looks so ragged compared to the smoothness of the rest of the doll.  The focus needs to be sharpened up a bit.  A 4</td>', 'My sister used to make these dolls.  I think I had about 4 of them when I was growing up.  She is still life without a doubt.  The cropping is a bit tight on the top, her bow got cut off and the bottom part, what is that on her hair?  It looks so ragged compared to the smoothness of the rest of the doll.  The focus needs to be sharpened up a bit.  A 4', '2003-11-05 22:50:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(474771, 45243, 12922, '<td valign="top">The light is too harsh, it washes out the ants and blurs the edge of the cherry.  Otherwise a great shot!</td>', 'The light is too harsh, it washes out the ants and blurs the edge of the cherry.  Otherwise a great shot!', '2003-11-05 22:52:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(474772, 45421, 12448, '<td valign="top">OMG, what is that??????  Not sure I even want to know, eek! :)  Okay, how this fits the challenge I''m not quite sure but we''ll stretch the rules, a lot!  As for the shot, the lighting is uneven and really hurts this shot for me.  Also the white line down the right is very distracting and the tape on under his nose holding whatever that is coming around must have hurt like heck when you pulled it off!  OUCH! ;)  A 4</td>', 'OMG, what is that??????  Not sure I even want to know, eek! :)  Okay, how this fits the challenge I''m not quite sure but we''ll stretch the rules, a lot!  As for the shot, the lighting is uneven and really hurts this shot for me.  Also the white line down the right is very distracting and the tape on under his nose holding whatever that is coming around must have hurt like heck when you pulled it off!  OUCH! ;)  A 4', '2003-11-05 22:52:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(474774, 44493, 12448, '<td valign="top">I bet he didn''t!   He''s cute, I have a friend who loves Moose and he would make a great addition to her collection.  Anyway, you met the challenge requirement but the shot leaves me wanting.  The use of negative space is overdone for this one and the white blow-out in the middle is really distracting.   A 4</td>', 'I bet he didn''t!   He''s cute, I have a friend who loves Moose and he would make a great addition to her collection.  Anyway, you met the challenge requirement but the shot leaves me wanting.  The use of negative space is overdone for this one and the white blow-out in the middle is really distracting.   A 4', '2003-11-05 22:54:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(474777, 44902, 12448, '<td valign="top">yes they are.  This shot has a lot of potential and I hope you don''t mind my suggestions on it.  I would have scrubbed the sink and faucet clean first, got a real shine on them, then placed the pan with plate in there.  The foil on the back is good to help cover the backsplash but maybe if you had put it on some cardboard and really flattened it so either you had an overall crinkle effect or a smoother effect, either would have worked better to me.  The cropping is good, the faucet handle brings you in, maybe just a little looser on the right so the whole plate was included.  The lighting is also very good.  Hope you try this again, if you don''t I just might! ;)  I had started at a 4 but am going to a 6 for a really potentially great shot</td>', 'yes they are.  This shot has a lot of potential and I hope you don''t mind my suggestions on it.  I would have scrubbed the sink and faucet clean first, got a real shine on them, then placed the pan with plate in there.  The foil on the back is good to help cover the backsplash but maybe if you had put it on some cardboard and really flattened it so either you had an overall crinkle effect or a smoother effect, either would have worked better to me.  The cropping is good, the faucet handle brings you in, maybe just a little looser on the right so the whole plate was included.  The lighting is also very good.  Hope you try this again, if you don''t I just might! ;)  I had started at a 4 but am going to a 6 for a really potentially great shot', '2003-11-05 22:58:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(474780, 45323, 10263, '<td valign="top">This is nice but I think I would have prefered color. Or maybe more contrast on the pumpkins. They don''t have much texture.</td>', 'This is nice but I think I would have prefered color. Or maybe more contrast on the pumpkins. They don''t have much texture.', '2003-11-05 23:00:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(474781, 45256, 12448, '<td valign="top">Oooo, what to say, what to say.  This is an interesting shot to say the least.  If you had gone for just the tree I think it might have worked better.  The post processing has made the picture noisy and distracting, the huge trunk in the middle looks totally out of place, maybe if you had cropped it so the tree completely cut the shot in half?  Or came from a different angle?  A 4</td>', 'Oooo, what to say, what to say.  This is an interesting shot to say the least.  If you had gone for just the tree I think it might have worked better.  The post processing has made the picture noisy and distracting, the huge trunk in the middle looks totally out of place, maybe if you had cropped it so the tree completely cut the shot in half?  Or came from a different angle?  A 4', '2003-11-05 23:01:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(474782, 44814, 11817, '<td valign="top">Beautiful.</td>', 'Beautiful.', '2003-11-05 23:03:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(474783, 45107, 8437, '<td valign="top">Cute :)</td>', 'Cute :)', '2003-11-05 23:03:21.000000', NULL, 1),
