(474785, 44510, 12448, '<td valign="top">I"m betting this was taken in California near the fires.  I hope all is well with yours during this difficult time.  As for this shot, the size throws me off and the tree poking in on the right is very distracting.  The effect of the border is also distracting.  a 4</td>', 'I"m betting this was taken in California near the fires.  I hope all is well with yours during this difficult time.  As for this shot, the size throws me off and the tree poking in on the right is very distracting.  The effect of the border is also distracting.  a 4', '2003-11-05 23:05:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(474786, 45286, 10263, '<td valign="top">No idea what it is but it is a beautiful photograph. Kinda looks like a door knob with an antique urinal leaning against it lol..  Unique, creative and well done.</td>', 'No idea what it is but it is a beautiful photograph. Kinda looks like a door knob with an antique urinal leaning against it lol..  Unique, creative and well done.', '2003-11-05 23:05:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(474788, 44903, 12448, '<td valign="top">You have a nice looking dad.  Say hello back to him for us!  As for the shot, the cropping is too tight  and the shape fo the shot, maybe if it was more squared.  The frame is too big and is distracting in this shot.  A 4</td>', 'You have a nice looking dad.  Say hello back to him for us!  As for the shot, the cropping is too tight  and the shape fo the shot, maybe if it was more squared.  The frame is too big and is distracting in this shot.  A 4', '2003-11-05 23:07:49.000000', NULL, 1),
