(474844, 44694, 12253, '<td valign="top">Good idea!  I think it might have worked better with a touch more space around  and a sharper feel.  (I know it''s hard when reducing to 640 by x.)  Also, while I like the two color theme, I wonder how a slightly different tone light might have looked?</td>', 'Good idea!  I think it might have worked better with a touch more space around  and a sharper feel.  (I know it''s hard when reducing to 640 by x.)  Also, while I like the two color theme, I wonder how a slightly different tone light might have looked?', '2003-11-06 00:21:26.000000', NULL, 1),
