(474846, 45376, 13305, '<td valign="top">I don''t get it.  What''s it all mean, or is this just an image.  There doesn''t seem to be any interaction, the colors are bright, but green seems to predominate.  What is there to really interest me in this picture?</td>', 'I don''t get it.  What''s it all mean, or is this just an image.  There doesn''t seem to be any interaction, the colors are bright, but green seems to predominate.  What is there to really interest me in this picture?', '2003-11-06 00:23:09.000000', NULL, 1),
