(474868, 45462, 9906, '<td valign="top">This is an awesome shot with some terrible lighting and a distracting background!  If you darken the room, light the keyboard, keep the same angle, drop a cloth in front of the background stuff and you''ll be right on the money.  I''d like to see it if you can reshoot it!  Oh big bonus because I love the originality and the shot in general!<br/>TC</td>', 'This is an awesome shot with some terrible lighting and a distracting background!  If you darken the room, light the keyboard, keep the same angle, drop a cloth in front of the background stuff and you''ll be right on the money.  I''d like to see it if you can reshoot it!  Oh big bonus because I love the originality and the shot in general!TC', '2003-11-06 00:39:33.000000', NULL, 1),
