(475358, 44713, 9168, '<td valign="top">I like this.  The lighting and grainy look works for me.</td>', 'I like this.  The lighting and grainy look works for me.', '2003-11-06 11:34:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(475361, 45643, 12061, '<td valign="top">ligthing good<br/>the empty space on the left side of the photo could be cut off right at the end of the first book<br/>black and white works well here</td>', 'ligthing goodthe empty space on the left side of the photo could be cut off right at the end of the first bookblack and white works well here', '2003-11-06 11:35:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(475362, 45236, 12061, '<td valign="top">nice DOF and subject is nice and sharp<br/>would probably look nice with a different background than the checkered type material that is there now .. perhaps a brigther material<br/>7</td>', 'nice DOF and subject is nice and sharpwould probably look nice with a different background than the checkered type material that is there now .. perhaps a brigther material7', '2003-11-06 11:37:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(475365, 45526, 9168, '<td valign="top">Nice and simple.  I think simple subjects make great a still life.  Was this going to be your infinity shot?</td>', 'Nice and simple.  I think simple subjects make great a still life.  Was this going to be your infinity shot?', '2003-11-06 11:38:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(475367, 44510, 12061, '<td valign="top">the lens flare (or whatever it is) in there looks bad<br/>The contrast seems to be a little low, could be boosted<br/>the object cut off to the bottom right is a distraction and doesn''t need to be there<br/>the plant would look better centered in the oval light</td>', 'the lens flare (or whatever it is) in there looks badThe contrast seems to be a little low, could be boostedthe object cut off to the bottom right is a distraction and doesn''t need to be therethe plant would look better centered in the oval light', '2003-11-06 11:38:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(475372, 45539, 6130, '<td valign="top">Great and I like it.</td>', 'Great and I like it.', '2003-11-06 11:39:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(475373, 45293, 12061, '<td valign="top">nice lighting, i like how there is bright light coming out the back of it .. almost makes it look like a cave or something .. :)<br/>Nice focus and colors<br/>7</td>', 'nice lighting, i like how there is bright light coming out the back of it .. almost makes it look like a cave or something .. :)Nice focus and colors7', '2003-11-06 11:39:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(475375, 45333, 1344, '<td valign="top">Would have liked this more if it looked more like the hand was actually thrown down by a player and not laid down so neatly</td>', 'Would have liked this more if it looked more like the hand was actually thrown down by a player and not laid down so neatly', '2003-11-06 11:41:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(475376, 45248, 6130, '<td valign="top">This is very good and I like it a lot.</td>', 'This is very good and I like it a lot.', '2003-11-06 11:41:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(475377, 44713, 12061, '<td valign="top">Nice!! IF it were up to me, this would be my choice for winner so far. I just love the colors and focus. The lighting is brilliant .. this one really makes you think. :) I do with the black on the left side was a tad bit lighter, but its not a big thing. Excellent job! 9</td>', 'Nice!! IF it were up to me, this would be my choice for winner so far. I just love the colors and focus. The lighting is brilliant .. this one really makes you think. :) I do with the black on the left side was a tad bit lighter, but its not a big thing. Excellent job! 9', '2003-11-06 11:42:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(475378, 45421, 12061, '<td valign="top">I don''t like the white surface on the right side ...could have been cropped out.<br/>This isn''t what I would call still life, but I give you techical merit because the picture is not all that bad. <br/></td>', 'I don''t like the white surface on the right side ...could have been cropped out.This isn''t what I would call still life, but I give you techical merit because the picture is not all that bad. ', '2003-11-06 11:43:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(475379, 44505, 9906, '<td valign="top">Very nice shot!  Good soft focus (I''m assuming you did this on purpose here!!!) works well.  Like the simple white background and the angle of the shot works well also!  Only thing I don''t like compositionaly is the shoulder pad part of the strap in the front bottom of the shot...  Personally I don''t really like the soft focus but it DOES work here!</td>', 'Very nice shot!  Good soft focus (I''m assuming you did this on purpose here!!!) works well.  Like the simple white background and the angle of the shot works well also!  Only thing I don''t like compositionaly is the shoulder pad part of the strap in the front bottom of the shot...  Personally I don''t really like the soft focus but it DOES work here!', '2003-11-06 11:44:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(475380, 45642, 12061, '<td valign="top">Interesting composition. The pill bottle is on a slight angle, photo could have been rotated more effectively. The apple looks nice and crisp, although I wish the stem was more in focus. Nice colors. 7</td>', 'Interesting composition. The pill bottle is on a slight angle, photo could have been rotated more effectively. The apple looks nice and crisp, although I wish the stem was more in focus. Nice colors. 7', '2003-11-06 11:45:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(475381, 45628, 12448, '<td valign="top">Different idea, unique.  I like that but it really doesn''t grab my attention and hold it there.  You say name in light which made me look if you had spelled something out with the matchsticks.  But I couldn''t find anything, you tease! ;)  The lighting is well done and the DOF is also well doen.  I started this at a 4 but am moving it to the 8</td>', 'Different idea, unique.  I like that but it really doesn''t grab my attention and hold it there.  You say name in light which made me look if you had spelled something out with the matchsticks.  But I couldn''t find anything, you tease! ;)  The lighting is well done and the DOF is also well doen.  I started this at a 4 but am moving it to the 8', '2003-11-06 11:45:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(475382, 45405, 9906, '<td valign="top">Nice composition from textures and lines points of view....the color is kind of dull though.  I think you need more lighting and you should try playing around with boosting the saturation a little (20-30% maybe?)<br/>TC</td>', 'Nice composition from textures and lines points of view....the color is kind of dull though.  I think you need more lighting and you should try playing around with boosting the saturation a little (20-30% maybe?)TC', '2003-11-06 11:46:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(475386, 44633, 12448, '<td valign="top">Looks like she stayed put for you.  A nice idea and not a bad overall shot but the trees in the front are more of a distraction to me than a fram, there is no top per say, if the branch had come all the way across the top.........  The shadows on the goose are nice but the focus is a bit soft for me.  A 4</td>', 'Looks like she stayed put for you.  A nice idea and not a bad overall shot but the trees in the front are more of a distraction to me than a fram, there is no top per say, if the branch had come all the way across the top.........  The shadows on the goose are nice but the focus is a bit soft for me.  A 4', '2003-11-06 11:51:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(475387, 44986, 13158, '<td valign="top">BEAUTIFUL!!!  I can feel the cold and it''s still 85 degrees here!  10 from me.</td>', 'BEAUTIFUL!!!  I can feel the cold and it''s still 85 degrees here!  10 from me.', '2003-11-06 11:51:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(475392, 45213, 12448, '<td valign="top">A very nice idea but it seems the staging seems off.   The space between the different types of leaves and the way they go out on the edges is really distracting to me.  I like the berries in the middle but they are so small you almost miss them.  Maybe if the leaves were closer together?  A 4</td>', 'A very nice idea but it seems the staging seems off.   The space between the different types of leaves and the way they go out on the edges is really distracting to me.  I like the berries in the middle but they are so small you almost miss them.  Maybe if the leaves were closer together?  A 4', '2003-11-06 11:55:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(475397, 45328, 3317, '<td valign="top">it''d almost be a portrait, except those things move so darn slow...</td>', 'it''d almost be a portrait, except those things move so darn slow...', '2003-11-06 12:01:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(475398, 45309, 12448, '<td valign="top">Interesting shot the two faces with different expressions.  To bad the eagle is there ruining the shot, it''s distracting from the faces, maybe a slightly tighter crop on the bottom?  The lighting seems a bit dark and nothing in the shot really pops out at me.  A 4</td>', 'Interesting shot the two faces with different expressions.  To bad the eagle is there ruining the shot, it''s distracting from the faces, maybe a slightly tighter crop on the bottom?  The lighting seems a bit dark and nothing in the shot really pops out at me.  A 4', '2003-11-06 12:01:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(475401, 45539, 13158, '<td valign="top">Very creative!!</td>', 'Very creative!!', '2003-11-06 12:03:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(475402, 44713, 13158, '<td valign="top">Aww, poor teddy.  Love the color and the texture!</td>', 'Aww, poor teddy.  Love the color and the texture!', '2003-11-06 12:04:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(475403, 45317, 12448, '<td valign="top">A different idea for still life.  The shot''s DOF is a bit backwards to me, if there were more focus on the bird and less on the leaves this would work so much better.  The light is dark and there isn''t anything that really holds my attention in this.  a 4</td>', 'A different idea for still life.  The shot''s DOF is a bit backwards to me, if there were more focus on the bird and less on the leaves this would work so much better.  The light is dark and there isn''t anything that really holds my attention in this.  a 4', '2003-11-06 12:05:37.000000', NULL, 1),
