(475472, 45622, 772, '<td valign="top">When you decided that this subject would be your choice for the Still Life challenge, how many different photos did you make to try to find the best perspective?  How many different lighting options did you try to see how light changes could change the mood of the photo?  I believe that some considerations of these elements could have helped you create a higher impact photo.</td>', 'When you decided that this subject would be your choice for the Still Life challenge, how many different photos did you make to try to find the best perspective?  How many different lighting options did you try to see how light changes could change the mood of the photo?  I believe that some considerations of these elements could have helped you create a higher impact photo.', '2003-11-06 13:09:28.000000', NULL, 1),
