(475476, 44470, 9906, '<td valign="top">This is a very nice composition!  I like the way you captured the sweat on the outside of the glass.  Gives the shot a little bit of atmosphere.  The crop is a little too tight on the sides for my taste and the grid on the bottom right corner of the shot is distracting.  Nice job overall!<br/>TC</td>', 'This is a very nice composition!  I like the way you captured the sweat on the outside of the glass.  Gives the shot a little bit of atmosphere.  The crop is a little too tight on the sides for my taste and the grid on the bottom right corner of the shot is distracting.  Nice job overall!TC', '2003-11-06 13:10:28.000000', NULL, 1),
