(475509, 45526, 13390, '<td valign="top">I love the simplicity of this particular shot. The composition is gorgeous and the clarity is staggering. Visually aesthetic! Fits challenge very well. I think you well deserve a "Ribbon" indeed. My highest scored picture. Good luck!</td>', 'I love the simplicity of this particular shot. The composition is gorgeous and the clarity is staggering. Visually aesthetic! Fits challenge very well. I think you well deserve a "Ribbon" indeed. My highest scored picture. Good luck!', '2003-11-06 14:02:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(475512, 44584, 13390, '<td valign="top">It''s shots like this that make this site unique. For me, personally, I think this shot fits the challenge extremely well, mostly because of the simplicity of it, and you captured simplicity quite well here. I do feel though, that the lighting is a tad weak, other than that, it is a gorgeous shot. I also enjoy how you composed th shot as well, will all the different sizes lined, looks very pleasing to the eye. Good luck!</td>', 'It''s shots like this that make this site unique. For me, personally, I think this shot fits the challenge extremely well, mostly because of the simplicity of it, and you captured simplicity quite well here. I do feel though, that the lighting is a tad weak, other than that, it is a gorgeous shot. I also enjoy how you composed th shot as well, will all the different sizes lined, looks very pleasing to the eye. Good luck!', '2003-11-06 14:05:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(475513, 45530, 13390, '<td valign="top">This is an absolutely gorgeous shot, very beautiful. The lighting, colors, and clarity are absolutely staggering! Good luck!</td>', 'This is an absolutely gorgeous shot, very beautiful. The lighting, colors, and clarity are absolutely staggering! Good luck!', '2003-11-06 14:06:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(475514, 45539, 13390, '<td valign="top">The colors here are simply satggering. The lighting and composition are perfect and the clarity is exemplary. Good luck!</td>', 'The colors here are simply satggering. The lighting and composition are perfect and the clarity is exemplary. Good luck!', '2003-11-06 14:07:51.000000', NULL, 1),
