(475519, 44874, 6845, '<td valign="top">Good idea and nice capture. I like the composition and the light coming from within was exposed well.</td>', 'Good idea and nice capture. I like the composition and the light coming from within was exposed well.', '2003-11-06 14:15:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(475521, 45557, 6845, '<td valign="top">Very nice white on white image. Good light and composition.</td>', 'Very nice white on white image. Good light and composition.', '2003-11-06 14:16:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(475523, 45620, 8891, '<td valign="top">AHHHHHH....this is just almost perfect.....the lighting is exquiste as is the shot but the little piece of the robe(?) sticking out on its own behind the doll on the right is distracting....perhaps a better angle on the right side doll might have helped? Excellent otherwise.</td>', 'AHHHHHH....this is just almost perfect.....the lighting is exquiste as is the shot but the little piece of the robe(?) sticking out on its own behind the doll on the right is distracting....perhaps a better angle on the right side doll might have helped? Excellent otherwise.', '2003-11-06 14:17:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(475525, 45291, 6845, '<td valign="top">What is supposed to be still about this image. I know that some have pushed the boundries by shooting someone just sitting still, but this shot is all about action. What were yout thoughts when you created the image? It would help me better understand where you are coming from.</td>', 'What is supposed to be still about this image. I know that some have pushed the boundries by shooting someone just sitting still, but this shot is all about action. What were yout thoughts when you created the image? It would help me better understand where you are coming from.', '2003-11-06 14:18:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(475528, 45609, 6845, '<td valign="top">I don''t like that it is out of focus. Probably got too close for your cameras limits. I really like how you tried to light the subjects and I like the color.</td>', 'I don''t like that it is out of focus. Probably got too close for your cameras limits. I really like how you tried to light the subjects and I like the color.', '2003-11-06 14:19:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(475529, 45612, 8891, '<td valign="top">Like the strength the diagonal movement the bark and moss provides as well as the texture contrasts....but perhaps there is one leaf too many....the overall composition might have been better with only one leaf or if the second leaf was more towards the bottom left corner.</td>', 'Like the strength the diagonal movement the bark and moss provides as well as the texture contrasts....but perhaps there is one leaf too many....the overall composition might have been better with only one leaf or if the second leaf was more towards the bottom left corner.', '2003-11-06 14:21:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(475531, 45635, 6845, '<td valign="top">I like the lighting used and I like that you tried a tilted angle, but this image and or subject still come across to me as no pop value. Maybe with the ame lighting get really close to one edge of the board and shoot the perspective that way. Of course depending on your equipment you might not be able to focus that close.</td>', 'I like the lighting used and I like that you tried a tilted angle, but this image and or subject still come across to me as no pop value. Maybe with the ame lighting get really close to one edge of the board and shoot the perspective that way. Of course depending on your equipment you might not be able to focus that close.', '2003-11-06 14:22:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(475532, 44955, 8891, '<td valign="top">your framing of this accentuates the negative.....it''s just not even and is very distracting....the focus on the shell appears to be a bit soft as well.</td>', 'your framing of this accentuates the negative.....it''s just not even and is very distracting....the focus on the shell appears to be a bit soft as well.', '2003-11-06 14:23:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(475533, 45421, 8891, '<td valign="top">still life....not maniacal portraiture</td>', 'still life....not maniacal portraiture', '2003-11-06 14:24:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(475536, 45603, 8891, '<td valign="top">the coloring is a bit dark, I guess for mood, but I cannot grasp what the colors should have been because of it....also the slinky looking item in the foreground might have been re-thought. don''t know or care what it is cause it just doesn''t seem to belong there...</td>', 'the coloring is a bit dark, I guess for mood, but I cannot grasp what the colors should have been because of it....also the slinky looking item in the foreground might have been re-thought. don''t know or care what it is cause it just doesn''t seem to belong there...', '2003-11-06 14:27:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(475540, 45400, 8891, '<td valign="top">nice composition and excellent texture contrasts. for my feeling, the colors appear bit desaturated and feel if they were richer the overall image would be better.</td>', 'nice composition and excellent texture contrasts. for my feeling, the colors appear bit desaturated and feel if they were richer the overall image would be better.', '2003-11-06 14:28:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(475543, 45072, 8891, '<td valign="top">the barrell roll on the shed roof might have been avoid with a judicious crop....offset by croping the SUV off the left....a closer POV on the bus and the art and not the entire bus might have helped....it is apparent that the art is on a bus and showing the entire vehicle may not have been necessary.</td>', 'the barrell roll on the shed roof might have been avoid with a judicious crop....offset by croping the SUV off the left....a closer POV on the bus and the art and not the entire bus might have helped....it is apparent that the art is on a bus and showing the entire vehicle may not have been necessary.', '2003-11-06 14:31:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(475544, 45426, 13722, '<td valign="top">very nice portrait, but I don''t feel it''s a still life.</td>', 'very nice portrait, but I don''t feel it''s a still life.', '2003-11-06 14:32:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(475545, 44945, 8891, '<td valign="top">overkill....one of them in a better composition might have been better....these are too centered.</td>', 'overkill....one of them in a better composition might have been better....these are too centered.', '2003-11-06 14:32:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(475546, 45471, 13722, '<td valign="top">Would make a good advertising shot.</td>', 'Would make a good advertising shot.', '2003-11-06 14:35:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(475547, 45401, 8891, '<td valign="top">Ahh....i know the problems of this shot all too well: where do I meter to get the best overall brightness with out blowout and if there will enough of it be in focus....it''s really tough to do....Very much like how the tree shadow almost blends into the reflected trees, but the reflected trees are too out of focus and the overall image does not quite work....really needed to use a tripod....nice attempt at the challenge this image affords.</td>', 'Ahh....i know the problems of this shot all too well: where do I meter to get the best overall brightness with out blowout and if there will enough of it be in focus....it''s really tough to do....Very much like how the tree shadow almost blends into the reflected trees, but the reflected trees are too out of focus and the overall image does not quite work....really needed to use a tripod....nice attempt at the challenge this image affords.', '2003-11-06 14:37:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(475549, 44986, 8891, '<td valign="top">This is very interetesting and I almost really like it....I think that if you had angled more to the right of the leaf and got more of the ice ladened branches in the shot below the leaf the compostion might have been improved.  I can see where this might not have been possible but could the leaf have been turned to help?  Very much like the textures in this.</td>', 'This is very interetesting and I almost really like it....I think that if you had angled more to the right of the leaf and got more of the ice ladened branches in the shot below the leaf the compostion might have been improved.  I can see where this might not have been possible but could the leaf have been turned to help?  Very much like the textures in this.', '2003-11-06 14:41:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(475550, 44526, 8891, '<td valign="top">The colors are nice as is this lighting....the vastness of the vase, however, overwhelms the flowers and the entire image....something smaller and would have been better, perhaps, although its color is fine.</td>', 'The colors are nice as is this lighting....the vastness of the vase, however, overwhelms the flowers and the entire image....something smaller and would have been better, perhaps, although its color is fine.', '2003-11-06 14:43:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(475554, 45315, 8891, '<td valign="top">the glare of the light in this sort of does it in....shooting of from above would have lessened the glare and also given some better or different shadows to help this out....also the framing of the image at the bottom is too tight.</td>', 'the glare of the light in this sort of does it in....shooting of from above would have lessened the glare and also given some better or different shadows to help this out....also the framing of the image at the bottom is too tight.', '2003-11-06 14:46:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(475555, 44694, 8891, '<td valign="top">the frame in this is too filled for my tastes....the composition would have been improved with more above the subjects....the lighting and shot are very good otherwise.</td>', 'the frame in this is too filled for my tastes....the composition would have been improved with more above the subjects....the lighting and shot are very good otherwise.', '2003-11-06 14:47:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(475558, 45631, 8891, '<td valign="top">like the main subject very much, nice lighting and detail....Iike the idea of the colors of the leaves in the doorway to break up the white BG but do not feel that they might have been the best item to have used.  the long stem at the bottom from the one leaf is very distracting and feel it should have been cut prior to taking the shot. May be more leaves would have helpe, maybe less? him it just does''t seem to jell.</td>', 'like the main subject very much, nice lighting and detail....Iike the idea of the colors of the leaves in the doorway to break up the white BG but do not feel that they might have been the best item to have used.  the long stem at the bottom from the one leaf is very distracting and feel it should have been cut prior to taking the shot. May be more leaves would have helpe, maybe less? him it just does''t seem to jell.', '2003-11-06 14:51:29.000000', NULL, 1),
