(475633, 44713, 7889, '<td valign="top">Great shadow and tone, 8</td>', 'Great shadow and tone, 8', '2003-11-06 15:55:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(475635, 45059, 9906, '<td valign="top">This composition is a little ''flat'' for lack of a better term.  The lighting is good but you are over exposed in the highlights!  I think that if you moved the camera up from the table some you would get a little more depth and more impact!  I do really like the reflections on the table top itself!<br/>TC</td>', 'This composition is a little ''flat'' for lack of a better term.  The lighting is good but you are over exposed in the highlights!  I think that if you moved the camera up from the table some you would get a little more depth and more impact!  I do really like the reflections on the table top itself!TC', '2003-11-06 15:59:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(475636, 45086, 9906, '<td valign="top">LOL...very original!!!  Bonus for that!  However, it''s not a really interesting shot compositionally.<br/>TC</td>', 'LOL...very original!!!  Bonus for that!  However, it''s not a really interesting shot compositionally.TC', '2003-11-06 16:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(475637, 45622, 9906, '<td valign="top">Nice idea and choice of background.  The browns of the horses go well with the browns of the paneling.  The cloths on the table detract from this simple color scheme.  You also have too much going on here.  If you took a couple of horses (maybe the same size or color) and got closer with MORE LIGHT, you would get much more detail and a better over all effect!<br/>TC</td>', 'Nice idea and choice of background.  The browns of the horses go well with the browns of the paneling.  The cloths on the table detract from this simple color scheme.  You also have too much going on here.  If you took a couple of horses (maybe the same size or color) and got closer with MORE LIGHT, you would get much more detail and a better over all effect!TC', '2003-11-06 16:03:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(475638, 45468, 13390, '<td valign="top">The lighting here is marvelous. I love the blue colors here, very nicely done. I alos enjoy the overall balance, looks very professional and clean. Good luck!</td>', 'The lighting here is marvelous. I love the blue colors here, very nicely done. I alos enjoy the overall balance, looks very professional and clean. Good luck!', '2003-11-06 16:03:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(475640, 45409, 9906, '<td valign="top">Not a bad composition, but you lose all your detail because there is not enough light.  For example, you can not tell where the camera ends and the flash unit starts...<br/>TC</td>', 'Not a bad composition, but you lose all your detail because there is not enough light.  For example, you can not tell where the camera ends and the flash unit starts...TC', '2003-11-06 16:06:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(475641, 45491, 13390, '<td valign="top">Really enjoyting the DOF here, used very well and apporopriately. One thing I personally like about this shot is the color of the background, sure that sounds silly, but the way you exucuted it really brings out your subject. This is a very nice shot and I hope you do well. Good luck!</td>', 'Really enjoyting the DOF here, used very well and apporopriately. One thing I personally like about this shot is the color of the background, sure that sounds silly, but the way you exucuted it really brings out your subject. This is a very nice shot and I hope you do well. Good luck!', '2003-11-06 16:06:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(475645, 44986, 13390, '<td valign="top">I absolutely love the detail on the frost and the leaf. What I enjoy most here is the contrast (extreme contrast) between the leaf and the frost. I love the lighting! One thing I would suggest though, is just cropping off a little bit of the bottom, there seems to be a tad bit too much and it doesn''t really serve the picture justice, because it is an absolutely beautiful picture. Good luck!</td>', 'I absolutely love the detail on the frost and the leaf. What I enjoy most here is the contrast (extreme contrast) between the leaf and the frost. I love the lighting! One thing I would suggest though, is just cropping off a little bit of the bottom, there seems to be a tad bit too much and it doesn''t really serve the picture justice, because it is an absolutely beautiful picture. Good luck!', '2003-11-06 16:09:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(475647, 45243, 13390, '<td valign="top">What marvelously beautiful shot! I love the intricate detail, lighting, composition, and colors. Very dynamic! What I find most amazing is the marvelous detail of the ants and especially their shadows, nicely done. One of my hihgest scored, good luck, hope to see this ribbon personally!</td>', 'What marvelously beautiful shot! I love the intricate detail, lighting, composition, and colors. Very dynamic! What I find most amazing is the marvelous detail of the ants and especially their shadows, nicely done. One of my hihgest scored, good luck, hope to see this ribbon personally!', '2003-11-06 16:11:34.000000', NULL, 1),
