(475752, 45317, 6845, '<td valign="top">I would guess that this is one of the images that people are complaining about as far as it is not a "still life". All of that aside, I like the way you framed the bird with the leaves, but the subject is so far away and out of focus. You are probably restricted by your equipment so I am assuming that you did what you could. Also if you move the subject out of the center and off to one side it will help make the composition more appealing. Just my feelings, and no I did not take off points for "not meeting the challenge."</td>', 'I would guess that this is one of the images that people are complaining about as far as it is not a "still life". All of that aside, I like the way you framed the bird with the leaves, but the subject is so far away and out of focus. You are probably restricted by your equipment so I am assuming that you did what you could. Also if you move the subject out of the center and off to one side it will help make the composition more appealing. Just my feelings, and no I did not take off points for "not meeting the challenge."', '2003-11-06 17:19:22.000000', NULL, 1),
