(476138, 44936, 9906, '<td valign="top">For a flower shot, this is almost perfect!  If the background was darkened to get rid of the distractions it would be a great shot!  Love the arrangement!<br/>TC</td>', 'For a flower shot, this is almost perfect!  If the background was darkened to get rid of the distractions it would be a great shot!  Love the arrangement!TC', '2003-11-06 23:02:44.000000', NULL, 1),
