(476356, 44637, 8522, '<td valign="top">Nice macro... I prefer the top-left to bottom-right diagonal though. I think most people find it more pleasing to follow that line, as it is the way we are accustomed to read. Bit too much noise in the bottom-right corner... did you try NeatImage? Other than that I like your lighting. 6</td>', 'Nice macro... I prefer the top-left to bottom-right diagonal though. I think most people find it more pleasing to follow that line, as it is the way we are accustomed to read. Bit too much noise in the bottom-right corner... did you try NeatImage? Other than that I like your lighting. 6', '2003-11-07 06:40:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(476357, 44964, 8522, '<td valign="top">Wonderful composition... this picture could almost be a blue ribbon winner, but the burnt out highlights (on the pear and pineapple) spoil it. There''s a bit too much glare on the apple. I love your black and white background, very imaginative and striking. 8</td>', 'Wonderful composition... this picture could almost be a blue ribbon winner, but the burnt out highlights (on the pear and pineapple) spoil it. There''s a bit too much glare on the apple. I love your black and white background, very imaginative and striking. 8', '2003-11-07 06:45:17.000000', NULL, 1),
