(476482, 44884, 8891, '<td valign="top">The angle and is perhaps not the best, focus is too soft on the front of the plate and the frame is so filled that what attempt there might have been at composition is negated....the background is too close in color to the plate and the subject matter is only mildly amusing.... a green colored squash or other vergetable/fruit mighjt have been a better color choice for the victim.</td>', 'The angle and is perhaps not the best, focus is too soft on the front of the plate and the frame is so filled that what attempt there might have been at composition is negated....the background is too close in color to the plate and the subject matter is only mildly amusing.... a green colored squash or other vergetable/fruit mighjt have been a better color choice for the victim.', '2003-11-07 10:44:02.000000', NULL, 1),
