(476505, 44726, 8891, '<td valign="top">The hutch is such a great piece and I really like the colors and textures of it.....think you might have lost the smaller red vase and flowers as it seems lost and in the way causing a distracting shadow on the hat.  I like the hat as well. I am a BIG fan of shadows and I like these shadows as shadows but not as part of this image.  Losing the red vase and its shadows would also help this. Placing the blue vase flowers closer to the hat and shoting just slightly more to your left might have helped too....The BG color does not work for this, though I realize there may not have been much you could do about that.</td>', 'The hutch is such a great piece and I really like the colors and textures of it.....think you might have lost the smaller red vase and flowers as it seems lost and in the way causing a distracting shadow on the hat.  I like the hat as well. I am a BIG fan of shadows and I like these shadows as shadows but not as part of this image.  Losing the red vase and its shadows would also help this. Placing the blue vase flowers closer to the hat and shoting just slightly more to your left might have helped too....The BG color does not work for this, though I realize there may not have been much you could do about that.', '2003-11-07 10:59:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(476511, 45387, 8891, '<td valign="top">Do like the effect of the backlighting on the main subject....would very much like to see this edited without all the intervening dark flowers that add nothing and are a distraction in this.....ahhh the joys of the DPC rules.   Where''s my migraine pills. BTW if you do edit this I would like it with the bit of blue and the trees in the upper right corner.  7</td>', 'Do like the effect of the backlighting on the main subject....would very much like to see this edited without all the intervening dark flowers that add nothing and are a distraction in this.....ahhh the joys of the DPC rules.   Where''s my migraine pills. BTW if you do edit this I would like it with the bit of blue and the trees in the upper right corner.  7', '2003-11-07 11:05:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(476514, 44692, 8891, '<td valign="top">Like this frame fill and frame, also the subject........the foucs is a bit soft ont he bottom figure and I do not know what all the little spots are but I sure wish they could have been edited away....ahh those rules.</td>', 'Like this frame fill and frame, also the subject........the foucs is a bit soft ont he bottom figure and I do not know what all the little spots are but I sure wish they could have been edited away....ahh those rules.', '2003-11-07 11:08:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(476518, 45053, 8891, '<td valign="top">nice lighting and shot....lose the plate or perhaps a plain plate....the little pattern on the left is distracting....and if yu were to lose the plate, also lose the frame. 7</td>', 'nice lighting and shot....lose the plate or perhaps a plain plate....the little pattern on the left is distracting....and if yu were to lose the plate, also lose the frame. 7', '2003-11-07 11:11:29.000000', NULL, 1),
