(476591, 45472, 6845, '<td valign="top">Interesting angle of view. But with the bright light there is almost too much loss of detail. Some more contrast or at least some more darkening with your levels could have helped.</td>', 'Interesting angle of view. But with the bright light there is almost too much loss of detail. Some more contrast or at least some more darkening with your levels could have helped.', '2003-11-07 12:16:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(476592, 45577, 6845, '<td valign="top">Nice copmositio and dof. The red/orange color really jumps out at you. The light is also nice.</td>', 'Nice copmositio and dof. The red/orange color really jumps out at you. The light is also nice.', '2003-11-07 12:17:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(476594, 45259, 6845, '<td valign="top">The light seems to harsh. I like the set up, and composition. I personally would have liked it a little more if you shot the image from a more straight on angle, instead of a slightly elevated point of view.</td>', 'The light seems to harsh. I like the set up, and composition. I personally would have liked it a little more if you shot the image from a more straight on angle, instead of a slightly elevated point of view.', '2003-11-07 12:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(476596, 45107, 6845, '<td valign="top">Cute idea. Made me laugh a little. Good composition but the whites are a little too blown out resulting in loss of detail in the crib.</td>', 'Cute idea. Made me laugh a little. Good composition but the whites are a little too blown out resulting in loss of detail in the crib.', '2003-11-07 12:20:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(476598, 45550, 6845, '<td valign="top">Ah, a star filter in use. Good idea. Adds a little something extra to the shot.I personally would have like to have seen a few more elements used on the set up. Possibly some stawberries out in front of the bowl, and maybe some more roses, just some things to help take up more of the empty space in the foreground. The lighting is pretty good except for the hot spot on the side of the bottle neck.</td>', 'Ah, a star filter in use. Good idea. Adds a little something extra to the shot.I personally would have like to have seen a few more elements used on the set up. Possibly some stawberries out in front of the bowl, and maybe some more roses, just some things to help take up more of the empty space in the foreground. The lighting is pretty good except for the hot spot on the side of the bottle neck.', '2003-11-07 12:24:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(476600, 45619, 6845, '<td valign="top">I would have liked to have seen a tighter crop and a slightly different setup. The crop to be moved in from the right and the left. For the set up, maybe put the pineapple and the wine bottle closer together in the back and bring out the bannanas and tomatoes. That way not everything is in a straight line and if will add some depth. I like the light though.</td>', 'I would have liked to have seen a tighter crop and a slightly different setup. The crop to be moved in from the right and the left. For the set up, maybe put the pineapple and the wine bottle closer together in the back and bring out the bannanas and tomatoes. That way not everything is in a straight line and if will add some depth. I like the light though.', '2003-11-07 12:28:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(476602, 45640, 6845, '<td valign="top">This is a nice, simple composition. I like the use of just a little bit of color. The light looks good as well.</td>', 'This is a nice, simple composition. I like the use of just a little bit of color. The light looks good as well.', '2003-11-07 12:29:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(476604, 45548, 6845, '<td valign="top">Nice composition. I like that you got in tight and made a pleasing arrangement. The light looks good as well.</td>', 'Nice composition. I like that you got in tight and made a pleasing arrangement. The light looks good as well.', '2003-11-07 12:30:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(476610, 45568, 12602, '<td valign="top">Sorry for the comment yesterday, rack it up to a very bad day. This is a very nice image, good macro work. The background could be a little darker, if you hold something above to cast a shadow behind, and that would make it a stronger image. However as nice as a macro shot as it is, I don''t feel that it meets the topic for still life. I know this is a controversial subject here right now, but that is my opinion.</td>', 'Sorry for the comment yesterday, rack it up to a very bad day. This is a very nice image, good macro work. The background could be a little darker, if you hold something above to cast a shadow behind, and that would make it a stronger image. However as nice as a macro shot as it is, I don''t feel that it meets the topic for still life. I know this is a controversial subject here right now, but that is my opinion.', '2003-11-07 12:37:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(476611, 45348, 13576, '<td valign="top">Very original. I like the use of bold colors. Lighting is good, focus is crisp, no distractions, composition is excellent. 10</td>', 'Very original. I like the use of bold colors. Lighting is good, focus is crisp, no distractions, composition is excellent. 10', '2003-11-07 12:41:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(476613, 45299, 12602, '<td valign="top">I''m sorry for my comment yesterday it was out of line, rack it up to a very bad day. As far as your image goes I feel it''s too dark with bad lighting and little interest. Sorry if that offends. Composition is alright and the idea of the use of dead space is interesting but it definitely needs some work.</td>', 'I''m sorry for my comment yesterday it was out of line, rack it up to a very bad day. As far as your image goes I feel it''s too dark with bad lighting and little interest. Sorry if that offends. Composition is alright and the idea of the use of dead space is interesting but it definitely needs some work.', '2003-11-07 12:43:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(476616, 45428, 12602, '<td valign="top">Sorry for my comment yesterday, it was a very bad day and I kind of took it out on everyone. Your image.... interesting idea for still life but isn''t sweeping a motion? The curled up broom bristles definitly imply motion to me at least. I think you would have beed better off laying it down on it''s side on a pile of leaves or something like that, I would be more willing to call something of that nature a still life. DOF also needs work, very few photos are effective with the blur in the forground unless it is very strong, and even then it works better in the background to imply depth, it''s a visual thing.</td>', 'Sorry for my comment yesterday, it was a very bad day and I kind of took it out on everyone. Your image.... interesting idea for still life but isn''t sweeping a motion? The curled up broom bristles definitly imply motion to me at least. I think you would have beed better off laying it down on it''s side on a pile of leaves or something like that, I would be more willing to call something of that nature a still life. DOF also needs work, very few photos are effective with the blur in the forground unless it is very strong, and even then it works better in the background to imply depth, it''s a visual thing.', '2003-11-07 12:49:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(476617, 45348, 6845, '<td valign="top">Great color and composition. This image really pops out at you. Of of my favorites.</td>', 'Great color and composition. This image really pops out at you. Of of my favorites.', '2003-11-07 12:50:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(476618, 44922, 6845, '<td valign="top">I really like the color of the vase. Nice, simple coposition. Very nice image.</td>', 'I really like the color of the vase. Nice, simple coposition. Very nice image.', '2003-11-07 12:51:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(476619, 45526, 6845, '<td valign="top">I like the simplicity of this image. The color and composition are nice. The light is also done well.</td>', 'I like the simplicity of this image. The color and composition are nice. The light is also done well.', '2003-11-07 12:52:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(476620, 45397, 6845, '<td valign="top">Imo, the best leaf image for this challenge. I like the graphic look. It is pleasing yet not too busy. Nice image.</td>', 'Imo, the best leaf image for this challenge. I like the graphic look. It is pleasing yet not too busy. Nice image.', '2003-11-07 12:53:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(476621, 45293, 6845, '<td valign="top">I really like the lighting used on the shell. Great idea. The composition is also done well and I like the white line on the inside of the border. It really frames the image nicely.</td>', 'I really like the lighting used on the shell. Great idea. The composition is also done well and I like the white line on the inside of the border. It really frames the image nicely.', '2003-11-07 12:54:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(476623, 45450, 12602, '<td valign="top">Sorry for the comment yesterday, bad day. I agree with the title, it is a very nice image of a sunset, when you can I would clone out the power line it''s distracting. However being a nice photo of a sunset does not make it a still life no matter how good it is.</td>', 'Sorry for the comment yesterday, bad day. I agree with the title, it is a very nice image of a sunset, when you can I would clone out the power line it''s distracting. However being a nice photo of a sunset does not make it a still life no matter how good it is.', '2003-11-07 12:55:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(476624, 44964, 6845, '<td valign="top">I see that this image was validated. I don''t know why it would have to be, it looks fine to me. Nice image. I really like the composition and the light used. The one red apple really stands out giving you something to zoom in on. Nice work.</td>', 'I see that this image was validated. I don''t know why it would have to be, it looks fine to me. Nice image. I really like the composition and the light used. The one red apple really stands out giving you something to zoom in on. Nice work.', '2003-11-07 12:55:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(476627, 45405, 6845, '<td valign="top">This is a nice food shot. Looks really yummy. Good composition and the light is nice. It does look a little blurry, but other than that, nice image.</td>', 'This is a nice food shot. Looks really yummy. Good composition and the light is nice. It does look a little blurry, but other than that, nice image.', '2003-11-07 12:57:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(476632, 44856, 12602, '<td valign="top">Sorry for the comment yesterday, bad day.. Technical aspects of your picture are alright. lighting is pretty good. composition is alright however I would like to see something on the left, maybe the cat could be looking at something instead of starring off into space. focus need some help it''s focused in front of the cat, would be better if it was on the eyes themselves. Other than that it is still not a still life, I know this is a controversial subject here right now but in my opinion just because life is still does not make it a still life in the classical sense which is what the assignment was.</td>', 'Sorry for the comment yesterday, bad day.. Technical aspects of your picture are alright. lighting is pretty good. composition is alright however I would like to see something on the left, maybe the cat could be looking at something instead of starring off into space. focus need some help it''s focused in front of the cat, would be better if it was on the eyes themselves. Other than that it is still not a still life, I know this is a controversial subject here right now but in my opinion just because life is still does not make it a still life in the classical sense which is what the assignment was.', '2003-11-07 13:01:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(476637, 45434, 12602, '<td valign="top">Sorry for the comment yesterday, it was a bad day. The clock is too centered in the photo with bad reflection from flourescent lights, also off color from the same. Generally in the photography world hand on a clock are set at 10 and 2 or 4 and 8 not a dead fast rule but if you look at almost any add with a clock or watch in it you''ll notice it. A tighter shot would have been better. Now for the big argument around here, does it meet the topic? Time stands still = life stand still?? If this is what your after then I would have to say no it does not. If you are simply taking a photo of a clock then possibly it does and I will score it under that assumption.</td>', 'Sorry for the comment yesterday, it was a bad day. The clock is too centered in the photo with bad reflection from flourescent lights, also off color from the same. Generally in the photography world hand on a clock are set at 10 and 2 or 4 and 8 not a dead fast rule but if you look at almost any add with a clock or watch in it you''ll notice it. A tighter shot would have been better. Now for the big argument around here, does it meet the topic? Time stands still = life stand still?? If this is what your after then I would have to say no it does not. If you are simply taking a photo of a clock then possibly it does and I will score it under that assumption.', '2003-11-07 13:17:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(476644, 45422, 12602, '<td valign="top">Sorry for the comment yesterday, it was a bad day and I took it out on alot of people. As far as your image I think it would make a fine entry in a shadows or a lighting challenge, I would crop in on it a bit concentrating more on the building and not on what''s around it. However I don''t feel that it''s a still life just because it''s night and life is still.</td>', 'Sorry for the comment yesterday, it was a bad day and I took it out on alot of people. As far as your image I think it would make a fine entry in a shadows or a lighting challenge, I would crop in on it a bit concentrating more on the building and not on what''s around it. However I don''t feel that it''s a still life just because it''s night and life is still.', '2003-11-07 13:22:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(476647, 44898, 13722, '<td valign="top">Nice sharp photo, but I don''t understand the irony.</td>', 'Nice sharp photo, but I don''t understand the irony.', '2003-11-07 13:26:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(476667, 45211, 10702, '<td valign="top">Nice, great job, how did you make her face soo smooth. Well done.<br/></td>', 'Nice, great job, how did you make her face soo smooth. Well done.', '2003-11-07 13:52:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(476670, 45083, 10702, '<td valign="top">One of the best so far, nice work.</td>', 'One of the best so far, nice work.', '2003-11-07 13:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(476679, 45348, 10702, '<td valign="top">Would problibly have gotten a ribbon in the primary colors challenge, nice shot.</td>', 'Would problibly have gotten a ribbon in the primary colors challenge, nice shot.', '2003-11-07 13:58:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(476680, 44964, 10702, '<td valign="top">Liek the black and the white but not the red, otherwise a nice shot.</td>', 'Liek the black and the white but not the red, otherwise a nice shot.', '2003-11-07 14:00:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(476686, 45046, 10702, '<td valign="top">Brilliant use of light and the beutiful red color, awesome shot, my only ten in this challenge.</td>', 'Brilliant use of light and the beutiful red color, awesome shot, my only ten in this challenge.', '2003-11-07 14:05:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(476694, 45266, 11241, '<td valign="top">very nice a sharp...I love the detail</td>', 'very nice a sharp...I love the detail', '2003-11-07 14:18:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(476703, 45318, 11785, '<td valign="top">Good idea, nice colors - 9</td>', 'Good idea, nice colors - 9', '2003-11-07 14:32:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(476704, 45548, 5792, '<td valign="top">High techncal quality. Good composition and lighting.</td>', 'High techncal quality. Good composition and lighting.', '2003-11-07 14:32:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(476705, 44586, 5792, '<td valign="top">Beautiful sepia</td>', 'Beautiful sepia', '2003-11-07 14:33:24.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(476706, 45376, 11785, '<td valign="top">funny. Still life for children, nice colors - 9</td>', 'funny. Still life for children, nice colors - 9', '2003-11-07 14:33:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(476708, 45293, 5792, '<td valign="top">Lighting especially good in this image</td>', 'Lighting especially good in this image', '2003-11-07 14:33:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(476710, 45552, 5792, '<td valign="top">Good color and focus. Very good fall still life.</td>', 'Good color and focus. Very good fall still life.', '2003-11-07 14:34:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(476712, 45114, 5792, '<td valign="top">Very nice flower still life. Good rose color and DOF. Focus sharp where it needs to be. One of my favorites.</td>', 'Very nice flower still life. Good rose color and DOF. Focus sharp where it needs to be. One of my favorites.', '2003-11-07 14:35:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(476713, 45491, 11785, '<td valign="top">bit sad, but i like it (it is always helping in DPC, if you make a flower bit wet ;) ) - 9</td>', 'bit sad, but i like it (it is always helping in DPC, if you make a flower bit wet ;) ) - 9', '2003-11-07 14:35:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(476715, 45557, 5792, '<td valign="top">Nice work!</td>', 'Nice work!', '2003-11-07 14:35:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(476717, 45586, 5792, '<td valign="top">Good contrast with green grass and ball and is good use of DOF, but this image was hurt by overexposure of the ball on the left side.</td>', 'Good contrast with green grass and ball and is good use of DOF, but this image was hurt by overexposure of the ball on the left side.', '2003-11-07 14:37:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(476722, 45348, 11785, '<td valign="top">i love it, healthy colors are always so ... I want to ask, where did you find this faucet, but i canot here - 10<br/></td>', 'i love it, healthy colors are always so ... I want to ask, where did you find this faucet, but i canot here - 10', '2003-11-07 14:39:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(476725, 45324, 12602, '<td valign="top">Sorry for what I said yesterday, I had a bad day and took it out on alot of people. I think your image would be better suited for a weather, lighting, or maybe even a shadows challenge but in my opinion just because it''s an object and still doesn''t make it a still life. You have nice composition and DOF, I would like to see a little more light on the first one, or maybe if all of them were on, but regardless I don''t think it belongs in a still life competition.<br/></td>', 'Sorry for what I said yesterday, I had a bad day and took it out on alot of people. I think your image would be better suited for a weather, lighting, or maybe even a shadows challenge but in my opinion just because it''s an object and still doesn''t make it a still life. You have nice composition and DOF, I would like to see a little more light on the first one, or maybe if all of them were on, but regardless I don''t think it belongs in a still life competition.', '2003-11-07 14:43:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(476726, 44884, 11785, '<td valign="top">do not kill him! he is tooo little!! idea is good, but i would use other Aperture and angle - 5</td>', 'do not kill him! he is tooo little!! idea is good, but i would use other Aperture and angle - 5', '2003-11-07 14:44:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(476727, 45504, 10848, '<td valign="top">What can I say about this shot? Hmmm, well...its imaginative, creative and definitely different, and believe it or not I like it! It is still life for sure, way to go, giving me something "different" to judge.9</td>', 'What can I say about this shot? Hmmm, well...its imaginative, creative and definitely different, and believe it or not I like it! It is still life for sure, way to go, giving me something "different" to judge.9', '2003-11-07 14:44:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(476729, 45312, 5792, '<td valign="top">This would benefit greatly if the background noise were reduced with NeatImage or another process.  Better yet, you would do better to have a more nontraditional arrangement of the awards and a different background. An image like this always is of more personal interest than anything else. Focus on the leftmost trophy is not good. It is more like a snapshot than anything. I entered an award image in a challenge and it did very poorly.</td>', 'This would benefit greatly if the background noise were reduced with NeatImage or another process.  Better yet, you would do better to have a more nontraditional arrangement of the awards and a different background. An image like this always is of more personal interest than anything else. Focus on the leftmost trophy is not good. It is more like a snapshot than anything. I entered an award image in a challenge and it did very poorly.', '2003-11-07 14:45:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(476730, 45053, 11785, '<td valign="top">perfect accomplishment, may be a bit boring - 9,8 ~ 10</td>', 'perfect accomplishment, may be a bit boring - 9,8 ~ 10', '2003-11-07 14:45:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(476733, 44585, 10848, '<td valign="top">Beautiful picture, the colors are striking, I also like the angle of the lighting</td>', 'Beautiful picture, the colors are striking, I also like the angle of the lighting', '2003-11-07 14:47:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(476734, 45089, 11785, '<td valign="top">did you made this composition your self? - very good - 10</td>', 'did you made this composition your self? - very good - 10', '2003-11-07 14:48:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(476735, 45563, 5792, '<td valign="top">The effect you were trying to attain did not work for me. It is good to try different things, but sometimes they just don''t work at all.</td>', 'The effect you were trying to attain did not work for me. It is good to try different things, but sometimes they just don''t work at all.', '2003-11-07 14:48:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(476736, 45308, 5792, '<td valign="top">You picked a nice subject but the focus and overal image quality is not particularly good. Sometimes you have to work within the limits of your particular camera to produce its best results.</td>', 'You picked a nice subject but the focus and overal image quality is not particularly good. Sometimes you have to work within the limits of your particular camera to produce its best results.', '2003-11-07 14:50:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(476737, 45588, 11785, '<td valign="top">what the heck is that - but i like it - 10</td>', 'what the heck is that - but i like it - 10', '2003-11-07 14:51:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(476738, 44922, 11785, '<td valign="top">so delicate, nice colors -10</td>', 'so delicate, nice colors -10', '2003-11-07 14:52:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(476739, 44552, 12602, '<td valign="top">Sorrry for the comment yesterday, had a bad day and took it out on everyone. Not your average still life, they are usually not done on location, but I guess not everyone has access to a studio. Good composition, exposure, and all that. Interesting choice of subject, I''ll re-rate it.</td>', 'Sorrry for the comment yesterday, had a bad day and took it out on everyone. Not your average still life, they are usually not done on location, but I guess not everyone has access to a studio. Good composition, exposure, and all that. Interesting choice of subject, I''ll re-rate it.', '2003-11-07 14:53:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(476740, 44584, 12602, '<td valign="top">looks like it belongs in a catalogue, selling it on ebay??</td>', 'looks like it belongs in a catalogue, selling it on ebay??', '2003-11-07 14:55:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(476743, 45079, 5792, '<td valign="top">You captured a good moment but the focus is very poor. That does not work well. This image also has a down-side quality that occurs frequent with automatic cameras...  the background is in better focus than  the main subject. Unfortunately that is almost impossible to see until you load it on your computer. It is good to take more than one shot of a subject to get a good one.</td>', 'You captured a good moment but the focus is very poor. That does not work well. This image also has a down-side quality that occurs frequent with automatic cameras...  the background is in better focus than  the main subject. Unfortunately that is almost impossible to see until you load it on your computer. It is good to take more than one shot of a subject to get a good one.', '2003-11-07 14:59:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(476748, 45429, 5792, '<td valign="top">There are several things that hurt this image. The sign is crooked in the frame. I has digital flaws like noise and focus hallos around the letters. It needs to have more interest like shadows or lighting on the sign that set a mood to distinguish it from every other stop sign.</td>', 'There are several things that hurt this image. The sign is crooked in the frame. I has digital flaws like noise and focus hallos around the letters. It needs to have more interest like shadows or lighting on the sign that set a mood to distinguish it from every other stop sign.', '2003-11-07 15:03:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(476752, 45384, 5792, '<td valign="top">Coins and money always make good subjects for still life photography. This image is very small and has poor focus. If your camera has macro capability then a closeup would work better and you should make the image closer to the 640 pixel size allowed. You would also want to try lighting from different angles to add interest to the image.</td>', 'Coins and money always make good subjects for still life photography. This image is very small and has poor focus. If your camera has macro capability then a closeup would work better and you should make the image closer to the 640 pixel size allowed. You would also want to try lighting from different angles to add interest to the image.', '2003-11-07 15:07:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(476758, 45256, 5792, '<td valign="top">I can''t speak for others but reversed image, infrared and other radical color changes do not work well for me and that is true in this case. Live Geese are not a traditional still life subjects since they are animate. Cooked and displayed nicely on a platter, unfortunately, would be better a better still life subject.</td>', 'I can''t speak for others but reversed image, infrared and other radical color changes do not work well for me and that is true in this case. Live Geese are not a traditional still life subjects since they are animate. Cooked and displayed nicely on a platter, unfortunately, would be better a better still life subject.', '2003-11-07 15:13:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(476762, 44668, 5792, '<td valign="top">I like your composition but the pickle (which I think is the main subject) is out of focus at its nearest point and distracting to me in this image. The image seems a little stark, perhaps from overshapening a bit.</td>', 'I like your composition but the pickle (which I think is the main subject) is out of focus at its nearest point and distracting to me in this image. The image seems a little stark, perhaps from overshapening a bit.', '2003-11-07 15:17:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(476766, 44711, 5792, '<td valign="top">Unlike many, this is a real still life shot. The background would add more interest to the image if it were colored, like blue or green. and if you had more interesting lighting. Focus seems a little to soft for how it is set up.</td>', 'Unlike many, this is a real still life shot. The background would add more interest to the image if it were colored, like blue or green. and if you had more interesting lighting. Focus seems a little to soft for how it is set up.', '2003-11-07 15:20:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(476770, 44656, 5792, '<td valign="top">A very intersting concept, especially with the crab. There is more red in this image than I would prefer and I would like to see more lighting but you get high marks for creativity and composition.</td>', 'A very intersting concept, especially with the crab. There is more red in this image than I would prefer and I would like to see more lighting but you get high marks for creativity and composition.', '2003-11-07 15:23:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(476782, 45112, 5792, '<td valign="top">A unique and humorous still life. It is a good quality image. It would be perfect without the chair back on the left and a shallower DOF with baseball memorabilia in the background cabinet.</td>', 'A unique and humorous still life. It is a good quality image. It would be perfect without the chair back on the left and a shallower DOF with baseball memorabilia in the background cabinet.', '2003-11-07 15:30:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(476783, 45008, 5792, '<td valign="top">An exceptionally high quality image.</td>', 'An exceptionally high quality image.', '2003-11-07 15:31:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(476785, 45347, 5792, '<td valign="top">Nicely composed shot. Interesting color and a technically superior quality image.</td>', 'Nicely composed shot. Interesting color and a technically superior quality image.', '2003-11-07 15:32:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(476789, 45211, 5792, '<td valign="top">An exceptional image. The only flaws are slight pixelation in the hair in the bottom right and the white area in the upper left. But still, this is one of the best of this challenge.</td>', 'An exceptional image. The only flaws are slight pixelation in the hair in the bottom right and the white area in the upper left. But still, this is one of the best of this challenge.', '2003-11-07 15:34:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(476809, 45357, 12602, '<td valign="top">Sorry for my comments yesterday, I was having a bad day and took it out on a number of people. That being said the graphic element of your image is interesting, I think I would have prefered it if the boards would have been tilted a little more and maybe more evenly spaced. I''m having a hard time deciding whether this one qualifies as a still life.....it does meet many of what I would consider the criteria but I feel somethings missing. Oh well I''ll give it the benefit of the doubt and re-rate it.</td>', 'Sorry for my comments yesterday, I was having a bad day and took it out on a number of people. That being said the graphic element of your image is interesting, I think I would have prefered it if the boards would have been tilted a little more and maybe more evenly spaced. I''m having a hard time deciding whether this one qualifies as a still life.....it does meet many of what I would consider the criteria but I feel somethings missing. Oh well I''ll give it the benefit of the doubt and re-rate it.', '2003-11-07 15:49:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(476814, 44485, 12602, '<td valign="top">Sorry about the comment yesterday, really bad day and I took it out on a bunch of people. I agree that your image is of inanimate objects, I did realize that they were bronze. I guess my major problem with it is the background, it''s very distracting, still lifes almost always have a very plain patterned or neutral background as to not distract from the object of interest, but I guess not everyone has access to a studio so I won''t count that against you. Not to be offensive but it appears a snapshot that was taken with a disposable camera. A much shallower DOF would have helped this image greatly. Exposure problems include blocking up under the throat and burnt out on the snout. I will conceed that this could be construed as a still life and will re-rate it as such.</td>', 'Sorry about the comment yesterday, really bad day and I took it out on a bunch of people. I agree that your image is of inanimate objects, I did realize that they were bronze. I guess my major problem with it is the background, it''s very distracting, still lifes almost always have a very plain patterned or neutral background as to not distract from the object of interest, but I guess not everyone has access to a studio so I won''t count that against you. Not to be offensive but it appears a snapshot that was taken with a disposable camera. A much shallower DOF would have helped this image greatly. Exposure problems include blocking up under the throat and burnt out on the snout. I will conceed that this could be construed as a still life and will re-rate it as such.', '2003-11-07 16:00:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(476821, 44903, 12602, '<td valign="top">Sorry about the comment yesterday, I had a bad day. Interesting portrait, I''m not sure why you decided to chop off the top of the head and bottom of the chin, but it''s your image. As far as still life goes, I have been informed that there is a definition that has to do with movie pr shots and I suppose that this could qualify as one of those. Good lighting focus and all of that I just didn''t think that it qualified at first. I will re-rate it.</td>', 'Sorry about the comment yesterday, I had a bad day. Interesting portrait, I''m not sure why you decided to chop off the top of the head and bottom of the chin, but it''s your image. As far as still life goes, I have been informed that there is a definition that has to do with movie pr shots and I suppose that this could qualify as one of those. Good lighting focus and all of that I just didn''t think that it qualified at first. I will re-rate it.', '2003-11-07 16:06:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(476824, 45070, 12602, '<td valign="top">Sorry about the comment yesterday, had a bad day. I like the image, nice symetry, exposure, use of color, etc. But as nice as it is, it''s not a still life. Would make a nice landscape or lighting entry but not still life.</td>', 'Sorry about the comment yesterday, had a bad day. I like the image, nice symetry, exposure, use of color, etc. But as nice as it is, it''s not a still life. Would make a nice landscape or lighting entry but not still life.', '2003-11-07 16:08:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(476826, 45349, 12602, '<td valign="top">Sorry about the comment yesterday, bad day. Your image does meet many of the qualifications for still life. It does need cropped, I would take it right up to the statue, which is over exposed and blown out. Horizon lines don''t always have to be level but I think it would help in this case. I will re-rate it.</td>', 'Sorry about the comment yesterday, bad day. Your image does meet many of the qualifications for still life. It does need cropped, I would take it right up to the statue, which is over exposed and blown out. Horizon lines don''t always have to be level but I think it would help in this case. I will re-rate it.', '2003-11-07 16:11:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(476829, 44814, 12602, '<td valign="top">Sorry for the comment yesterday, I had a bad day and lashed out at everyone. I like your image, nice use of color, good composition DOF and all that. Would like to see more dramatic clouds but that''s not in your control. However just because it''s a nice picture does not make it a still life. It would go nicely under a lighting, sunset, water, or even a landscape challenge but it''s not a still life.</td>', 'Sorry for the comment yesterday, I had a bad day and lashed out at everyone. I like your image, nice use of color, good composition DOF and all that. Would like to see more dramatic clouds but that''s not in your control. However just because it''s a nice picture does not make it a still life. It would go nicely under a lighting, sunset, water, or even a landscape challenge but it''s not a still life.', '2003-11-07 16:15:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(476838, 45539, 13336, '<td valign="top">neat idea.  nice lighting, vibrant colors.  the top apple could have been a smidge to the right.</td>', 'neat idea.  nice lighting, vibrant colors.  the top apple could have been a smidge to the right.', '2003-11-07 16:27:26.000000', NULL, 1),
