(476888, 45079, 12602, '<td valign="top">Sorry about the comment yesterday, bad day. That being said, what does a cat have to do with still life? I think the essence of yesterdays comment was correct I just went about it very rudely. This was one of the images that was most frustrating to me. Every week I see this, people totally ignoring the topic and posting pictures of their pets and kids. Please stay on topic, if you have nothing to post on topic, then you have nothing to post, it''s not the end of the world.</td>', 'Sorry about the comment yesterday, bad day. That being said, what does a cat have to do with still life? I think the essence of yesterdays comment was correct I just went about it very rudely. This was one of the images that was most frustrating to me. Every week I see this, people totally ignoring the topic and posting pictures of their pets and kids. Please stay on topic, if you have nothing to post on topic, then you have nothing to post, it''s not the end of the world.', '2003-11-07 17:24:30.000000', NULL, 1),
