(477182, 44985, 8865, '<td valign="top">I like the neutral colors in the image, and how the 3 yellow bottles stand out. The right side seems a tad dark. But works well in the picture. I also like how it''s totally filling the frame. Good stuff =)</td>', 'I like the neutral colors in the image, and how the 3 yellow bottles stand out. The right side seems a tad dark. But works well in the picture. I also like how it''s totally filling the frame. Good stuff =)', '2003-11-08 05:56:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(477184, 45296, 8865, '<td valign="top">Love the softness this photo sets off. The pink is fab. I usually see roses (flowers) in vases for "still life" stuff, but I''m glad you choose to do a close up. Very nice. 10 from me =)</td>', 'Love the softness this photo sets off. The pink is fab. I usually see roses (flowers) in vases for "still life" stuff, but I''m glad you choose to do a close up. Very nice. 10 from me =)', '2003-11-08 06:00:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(477187, 45491, 8865, '<td valign="top">What a creative image. I absolutely love the colors. I especially like how the background goes from dark to light. You picked the perfect flower to go in this image. Love the touch of water on it as well, it adds a little something =) Good stuff! (10)</td>', 'What a creative image. I absolutely love the colors. I especially like how the background goes from dark to light. You picked the perfect flower to go in this image. Love the touch of water on it as well, it adds a little something =) Good stuff! (10)', '2003-11-08 06:02:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(477189, 45351, 8865, '<td valign="top">I was going to say the pink is a little harsh, but I actually like it very vibrant like that. Makes it really stand out against the black background. Did you use some sort of effect on it? I would have liked it a little sharper. But it still looks good.  =)</td>', 'I was going to say the pink is a little harsh, but I actually like it very vibrant like that. Makes it really stand out against the black background. Did you use some sort of effect on it? I would have liked it a little sharper. But it still looks good.  =)', '2003-11-08 06:10:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(477190, 44962, 8865, '<td valign="top">omg, that is beautiful. It definetly looks still out there. =) I love how the cloud looks soft &amp; wispy up there. The reflection, and thebranches in the water is superb. What an excellent photo. Perfect timing to get it. Good one!</td>', 'omg, that is beautiful. It definetly looks still out there. =) I love how the cloud looks soft & wispy up there. The reflection, and thebranches in the water is superb. What an excellent photo. Perfect timing to get it. Good one!', '2003-11-08 06:13:45.000000', NULL, 1),
