(477262, 45086, 6008, '<td valign="top">This is humorous, which can be good. The inside of the orange is a little too bright, but the reflections on the glass seem minimum, although it also seems a little tilted. I''m not sure if you were going for the browned apple look, but I know they can do that after a while and usually lemon juice can help it stop browning up as quick if you werent. There are a few white specks on the background too, but in the ''normal'' world those would have been easy to clean up with spot editing. It''s not technically the best, but the unusual subject makes it stand out more.</td>', 'This is humorous, which can be good. The inside of the orange is a little too bright, but the reflections on the glass seem minimum, although it also seems a little tilted. I''m not sure if you were going for the browned apple look, but I know they can do that after a while and usually lemon juice can help it stop browning up as quick if you werent. There are a few white specks on the background too, but in the ''normal'' world those would have been easy to clean up with spot editing. It''s not technically the best, but the unusual subject makes it stand out more.', '2003-11-08 10:45:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(477263, 45291, 6008, '<td valign="top">This isnt the usual definition of still life, nor does it really say ''still'' at all, it has obvious movement. Having the date stamped on the picture also makes it look a lot like a snapshot.</td>', 'This isnt the usual definition of still life, nor does it really say ''still'' at all, it has obvious movement. Having the date stamped on the picture also makes it look a lot like a snapshot.', '2003-11-08 10:46:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(477278, 45335, 6008, '<td valign="top">The image is sharp, composition is good, the lighting reflections arent too overly distracting. The top white looks like it has a little noise, but nothing too drastic, and there is a dark place that looks like it could have once been a shadow. Overall it''s a good shot.</td>', 'The image is sharp, composition is good, the lighting reflections arent too overly distracting. The top white looks like it has a little noise, but nothing too drastic, and there is a dark place that looks like it could have once been a shadow. Overall it''s a good shot.', '2003-11-08 10:56:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(477285, 44714, 13440, '<td valign="top">Do you think it''s too bright in the middle? reduce a little of brightness would be nice.</td>', 'Do you think it''s too bright in the middle? reduce a little of brightness would be nice.', '2003-11-08 11:00:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(477292, 45546, 13440, '<td valign="top">a little underexposure? Did you increse a stop by half or 1.0 when focus on a white subject? ummm....Looks like it was taken at night with flash?</td>', 'a little underexposure? Did you increse a stop by half or 1.0 when focus on a white subject? ummm....Looks like it was taken at night with flash?', '2003-11-08 11:03:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(477295, 45539, 6008, '<td valign="top">Wow, those fruit are shiny! I really like the idea, it''s very neat. Visually it''s good, and clever. Technically it could be corrected with spot editing after the challenge. A few of the things I see that could, ideally, be changed are the light reflections on the apples and the light on the background near them. I assume the lighting for this was an overheard with a maglite (or similar) aimed at each of them? I hard similar problems when I was shooting an apple too! They can be very tough, esp the really shiny kind. I like this, bonus points for creativity!</td>', 'Wow, those fruit are shiny! I really like the idea, it''s very neat. Visually it''s good, and clever. Technically it could be corrected with spot editing after the challenge. A few of the things I see that could, ideally, be changed are the light reflections on the apples and the light on the background near them. I assume the lighting for this was an overheard with a maglite (or similar) aimed at each of them? I hard similar problems when I was shooting an apple too! They can be very tough, esp the really shiny kind. I like this, bonus points for creativity!', '2003-11-08 11:04:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(477312, 45107, 13440, '<td valign="top">Nice work. I reckon, wouldn''t it better if you capture the whole capsicum and the white subject? (just my opinion)</td>', 'Nice work. I reckon, wouldn''t it better if you capture the whole capsicum and the white subject? (just my opinion)', '2003-11-08 11:17:49.000000', NULL, 1),
