(477360, 44653, 13826, '<td valign="top">wow. I absolutely love this!! the cold blue makes me feel like I''m 6 inches tall stood under that tap (sorry, faucet!!). Definately one of my favourites! It''s all down to statistics now !! 10</td>', 'wow. I absolutely love this!! the cold blue makes me feel like I''m 6 inches tall stood under that tap (sorry, faucet!!). Definately one of my favourites! It''s all down to statistics now !! 10', '2003-11-08 12:42:36.000000', NULL, 1),
