(477364, 44924, 13826, '<td valign="top">I''d have given this a 10 if the sharpest focus had been in the top left - the main area of the water running from the tap. The focus seems to be on the area where the running water hits the body of water - an area that is so turbulent that its hard to tell whether it actually is pin sharp. I think selective DOF would have shown pin sharp water running into a (blurrish) maelstrom of water. Then again, I''m hardly a professional - just my own opinion!!! I do like it though - 8</td>', 'I''d have given this a 10 if the sharpest focus had been in the top left - the main area of the water running from the tap. The focus seems to be on the area where the running water hits the body of water - an area that is so turbulent that its hard to tell whether it actually is pin sharp. I think selective DOF would have shown pin sharp water running into a (blurrish) maelstrom of water. Then again, I''m hardly a professional - just my own opinion!!! I do like it though - 8', '2003-11-08 12:45:45.000000', NULL, 1),
