(477459, 44586, 12902, '<td valign="top">Nice collection you have there. Is this the natural colour or you desaturated it? Excellent anyway. 10 from me.</td>', 'Nice collection you have there. Is this the natural colour or you desaturated it? Excellent anyway. 10 from me.', '2003-11-08 14:58:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(477460, 45631, 12902, '<td valign="top">Nice little door.</td>', 'Nice little door.', '2003-11-08 14:58:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(477461, 45638, 8891, '<td valign="top">Whilte you made some attempt at composition, I do not feel that what you came up with is the best you might have done.  The background is a bit dark but that''s OK as it provides some contrast to your subjects and the grain of the wood makes it less static thana plain BG. Feel it could have been lit better , maybe lose the plate as it seems like ''which one does not belong, class'' and repositioned the remaing subjects for better comp.  5</td>', 'Whilte you made some attempt at composition, I do not feel that what you came up with is the best you might have done.  The background is a bit dark but that''s OK as it provides some contrast to your subjects and the grain of the wood makes it less static thana plain BG. Feel it could have been lit better , maybe lose the plate as it seems like ''which one does not belong, class'' and repositioned the remaing subjects for better comp.  5', '2003-11-08 14:59:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(477462, 45539, 12902, '<td valign="top">Excellent. Ribbon probably. Got my 10 anyway. Congratulations!</td>', 'Excellent. Ribbon probably. Got my 10 anyway. Congratulations!', '2003-11-08 14:59:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(477463, 45318, 8891, '<td valign="top">the line fram is a suitabble color but works to distract me as it melds with the rim of the bowl.  I like the composition and perspective very much and the super lighting and overall shot.</td>', 'the line fram is a suitabble color but works to distract me as it melds with the rim of the bowl.  I like the composition and perspective very much and the super lighting and overall shot.', '2003-11-08 15:00:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(477464, 44854, 12902, '<td valign="top">Nice looking flower. Picture too. 8</td>', 'Nice looking flower. Picture too. 8', '2003-11-08 15:00:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(477465, 45260, 12902, '<td valign="top">Very good. I am sure it has a nice average. 8</td>', 'Very good. I am sure it has a nice average. 8', '2003-11-08 15:02:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(477467, 45311, 8891, '<td valign="top">Just didn''t feel up to it, did you?  After it''s just stlll life, how boring.  You must forgive my presumption but that''s the feeling I get from this. The lighting is uneven and what composition you might have had left with the crop.  Oh well, on to the next.  Pity....product shots do pay, you know.</td>', 'Just didn''t feel up to it, did you?  After it''s just stlll life, how boring.  You must forgive my presumption but that''s the feeling I get from this. The lighting is uneven and what composition you might have had left with the crop.  Oh well, on to the next.  Pity....product shots do pay, you know.', '2003-11-08 15:05:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(477468, 45491, 8891, '<td valign="top">Like the composition very much as well as the lighting. the ''suitor'' appears a bit soft in the head, focus wise. other wise very nice. 7</td>', 'Like the composition very much as well as the lighting. the ''suitor'' appears a bit soft in the head, focus wise. other wise very nice. 7', '2003-11-08 15:06:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(477469, 45111, 5436, '<td valign="top">focus is off in the back kettle</td>', 'focus is off in the back kettle', '2003-11-08 15:08:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(477470, 44985, 8891, '<td valign="top">Just a bit much, ....too much to look at an I do not understand the focal point. I do like the near monotone look of the shot and the texture contrast....just feel you might have composed btter and picked less here.  One suggestion would have been to shoot from the window opoen leftand include the table just underd the top. You would not lose and the antiquity and the shot would just as filled with equipment and still provide some area in which to breath, so to speak. Just a thought.  Good overall shot. 6</td>', 'Just a bit much, ....too much to look at an I do not understand the focal point. I do like the near monotone look of the shot and the texture contrast....just feel you might have composed btter and picked less here.  One suggestion would have been to shoot from the window opoen leftand include the table just underd the top. You would not lose and the antiquity and the shot would just as filled with equipment and still provide some area in which to breath, so to speak. Just a thought.  Good overall shot. 6', '2003-11-08 15:11:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(477472, 45550, 8891, '<td valign="top">very nice, love the lense flares.  The composition is  a bit static and the roll of ribbon looks out of place. You might have left the ribbon our all together and moved the berry bowl fron a bit the right glass back a bit which might have improved it or move the right glas back a bit switched the flowers and the berry bowl and move the left glas forward, behind the flowers..  Just a thought.  Very good over all shot...and I do hoped you enyoyed the champagne. 7</td>', 'very nice, love the lense flares.  The composition is  a bit static and the roll of ribbon looks out of place. You might have left the ribbon our all together and moved the berry bowl fron a bit the right glass back a bit which might have improved it or move the right glas back a bit switched the flowers and the berry bowl and move the left glas forward, behind the flowers..  Just a thought.  Very good over all shot...and I do hoped you enyoyed the champagne. 7', '2003-11-08 15:16:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(477473, 44726, 12421, '<td valign="top">I like the lighting and the colors, but find the shadows a bit distracting.  Maybe they are too long?</td>', 'I like the lighting and the colors, but find the shadows a bit distracting.  Maybe they are too long?', '2003-11-08 15:17:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(477474, 45631, 12421, '<td valign="top">The lighting looks a little washed out and the stem at the bottom is distracting.</td>', 'The lighting looks a little washed out and the stem at the bottom is distracting.', '2003-11-08 15:19:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(477475, 44553, 8891, '<td valign="top">Excellent shot, like the select de-sat look of this and my only wish was the leaf was better placed or a better angle chosed to improve the composition.  You might have turned the leaf CCW with the point of the leaf more towards the bottm left corner.  Like it very much but I think it could have been better.  8</td>', 'Excellent shot, like the select de-sat look of this and my only wish was the leaf was better placed or a better angle chosed to improve the composition.  You might have turned the leaf CCW with the point of the leaf more towards the bottm left corner.  Like it very much but I think it could have been better.  8', '2003-11-08 15:19:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(477476, 45603, 12421, '<td valign="top">Nice warm colors</td>', 'Nice warm colors', '2003-11-08 15:19:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(477477, 45619, 12421, '<td valign="top">I would like to see more light on subject</td>', 'I would like to see more light on subject', '2003-11-08 15:21:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(477478, 45609, 12421, '<td valign="top">Could be better focused</td>', 'Could be better focused', '2003-11-08 15:22:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(477479, 44867, 12421, '<td valign="top">great humor!  I really like this</td>', 'great humor!  I really like this', '2003-11-08 15:23:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(477480, 45213, 8891, '<td valign="top">Too much fall brick a brack in this....less is more, oft times.  The background provides a nice texture contrast but it is not pleasingly shot in this straght up/down, left/right.  you might have chose.  It looks like "My Fall Leaf and Seed Collection on Brick'' and all that is missing is the little captions stating the name of each item.</td>', 'Too much fall brick a brack in this....less is more, oft times.  The background provides a nice texture contrast but it is not pleasingly shot in this straght up/down, left/right.  you might have chose.  It looks like "My Fall Leaf and Seed Collection on Brick'' and all that is missing is the little captions stating the name of each item.', '2003-11-08 15:23:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(477481, 45255, 12421, '<td valign="top">I like the colors a lot.  But I think it''s cropped a tad too small.</td>', 'I like the colors a lot.  But I think it''s cropped a tad too small.', '2003-11-08 15:24:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(477482, 45347, 8891, '<td valign="top">Well since it has been validated, you must let me know how you did this; Unless the music is actually on the recorder, please do. Great comp and colors.  The framing is the color color but you could have done with out it.  Great overall shot.</td>', 'Well since it has been validated, you must let me know how you did this; Unless the music is actually on the recorder, please do. Great comp and colors.  The framing is the color color but you could have done with out it.  Great overall shot.', '2003-11-08 15:26:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(477483, 45313, 8891, '<td valign="top">pretty darn cool effect, like the BW and composition.  almost mind boggling.  Very good.</td>', 'pretty darn cool effect, like the BW and composition.  almost mind boggling.  Very good.', '2003-11-08 15:27:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(477484, 45550, 12421, '<td valign="top">This is a great photo.  I can''t help but be reminded of some "love guide" - a little cheesy, but that''s not a bad thing!  :-)   The only thing I think could be improved was to have spread that ribbon out through the scene.  It looks almost unfinished laying coiled up.</td>', 'This is a great photo.  I can''t help but be reminded of some "love guide" - a little cheesy, but that''s not a bad thing!  :-)   The only thing I think could be improved was to have spread that ribbon out through the scene.  It looks almost unfinished laying coiled up.', '2003-11-08 15:30:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(477485, 44506, 12421, '<td valign="top">Love the tonal quality of this!</td>', 'Love the tonal quality of this!', '2003-11-08 15:32:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(477489, 45321, 12421, '<td valign="top">A taller vase could improve the composition.  As it is, the whole scene is very flat.  But I like the color and textures.</td>', 'A taller vase could improve the composition.  As it is, the whole scene is very flat.  But I like the color and textures.', '2003-11-08 15:39:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(477491, 44635, 12421, '<td valign="top">Clean your stove, please!  Sorry, the grime is distracting to me.</td>', 'Clean your stove, please!  Sorry, the grime is distracting to me.', '2003-11-08 15:44:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(477493, 45349, 6405, '<td valign="top">Photo is noisy and tilted to the right,5 from me!</td>', 'Photo is noisy and tilted to the right,5 from me!', '2003-11-08 15:51:03.000000', NULL, 1),
