(477799, 45621, 9906, '<td valign="top">Very interesting shot!  Great focus and capture of the color.  It doesn\''t seem to have much holding power though.  I\''m not sure what exactly is lacking, but I would start by playing around with shooting the broom at different angles.  See what lines you come up with...<br/>TC</td>', 'Very interesting shot!  Great focus and capture of the color.  It doesn\''t seem to have much holding power though.  I\''m not sure what exactly is lacking, but I would start by playing around with shooting the broom at different angles.  See what lines you come up with...TC', '2003-11-09 02:11:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(477800, 44553, 9906, '<td valign="top">Cool surface!  It''s your car I''m assuming.  Great focus and contrast in colors.  I don''t like the funny shaped reflection though.  Draws you away from the leaf too much.<br/>TC</td>', 'Cool surface!  It''s your car I''m assuming.  Great focus and contrast in colors.  I don''t like the funny shaped reflection though.  Draws you away from the leaf too much.TC', '2003-11-09 02:14:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(477802, 45320, 9906, '<td valign="top">Great composition here!  It needs a big boost in the lighting though.  If you had a reflector on the right hand side to bounce back some of the light from the left this would come out much nicer!!!  I would love to see it reshot eventually!.<br/>TC</td>', 'Great composition here!  It needs a big boost in the lighting though.  If you had a reflector on the right hand side to bounce back some of the light from the left this would come out much nicer!!!  I would love to see it reshot eventually!.TC', '2003-11-09 02:17:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(477803, 44909, 9906, '<td valign="top">What an odd combination of toys here.  Like the colors but theres not much to keep my attention.<br/>TC</td>', 'What an odd combination of toys here.  Like the colors but theres not much to keep my attention.TC', '2003-11-09 02:19:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(477804, 45471, 9906, '<td valign="top">I like the composition here, but it''s a little dark and soft on focus.<br/>TC</td>', 'I like the composition here, but it''s a little dark and soft on focus.TC', '2003-11-09 02:20:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(477825, 44562, 10084, '<td valign="top">Interesting concept. Very good closeup of the potato skin. You can almost feel the texture of the skin. Lighting is very good. It helps highlight the pins. "10"</td>', 'Interesting concept. Very good closeup of the potato skin. You can almost feel the texture of the skin. Lighting is very good. It helps highlight the pins. "10"', '2003-11-09 03:53:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(477826, 45053, 10084, '<td valign="top">The black background really helps the white plate stand out. Lighting is good. Great hightlights bouncing off the plate. Contrast is really good. "10"</td>', 'The black background really helps the white plate stand out. Lighting is good. Great hightlights bouncing off the plate. Contrast is really good. "10"', '2003-11-09 03:55:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(477827, 44856, 10084, '<td valign="top">Good monochrome. Love how the cat looks extremely relaxed. Great expression on it''s face. The soft focus on the cat gives it a calming feeling. "10"</td>', 'Good monochrome. Love how the cat looks extremely relaxed. Great expression on it''s face. The soft focus on the cat gives it a calming feeling. "10"', '2003-11-09 03:57:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(477829, 44814, 10084, '<td valign="top">Very nice composition. Beautiful sunset. Very unique colors. Love how the boats are arranged. The depth of field is also very nice. Enjoy the mountains in the background. "10"</td>', 'Very nice composition. Beautiful sunset. Very unique colors. Love how the boats are arranged. The depth of field is also very nice. Enjoy the mountains in the background. "10"', '2003-11-09 03:59:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(477830, 45347, 10084, '<td valign="top">Very interesting subject. Like the compostion, it leads your eyes from top to bottom. The colors on the instrument is very nice. I like how the subject looks with the unique musical notes on it. Almost looks like tattoos. The black background really helps to make the subject stand out. "10"</td>', 'Very interesting subject. Like the compostion, it leads your eyes from top to bottom. The colors on the instrument is very nice. I like how the subject looks with the unique musical notes on it. Almost looks like tattoos. The black background really helps to make the subject stand out. "10"', '2003-11-09 04:01:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(477832, 45208, 10084, '<td valign="top">Beautiful vibrant colors. The great autumn colors give it a very warm feeling. Good closeup focus shows the veins or texture of each leaf. Excellent compostion. "10"</td>', 'Beautiful vibrant colors. The great autumn colors give it a very warm feeling. Good closeup focus shows the veins or texture of each leaf. Excellent compostion. "10"', '2003-11-09 04:07:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(477833, 45643, 10084, '<td valign="top">Lighting is excellent. I like how the open book is highlighted. Also like that the light coming from the top left leads your eyes toward the books on the shelf. It helps to hightlight the titles of some of the books. "10"</td>', 'Lighting is excellent. I like how the open book is highlighted. Also like that the light coming from the top left leads your eyes toward the books on the shelf. It helps to hightlight the titles of some of the books. "10"', '2003-11-09 04:11:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(477835, 44491, 10084, '<td valign="top">Great composition. Depth of field helps to make this shot interesting. Lighting is really nice. Helps to show the softness of the fur. You can almost feel the fur. I like that this shot was done at the level of the cat. "9"</td>', 'Great composition. Depth of field helps to make this shot interesting. Lighting is really nice. Helps to show the softness of the fur. You can almost feel the fur. I like that this shot was done at the level of the cat. "9"', '2003-11-09 05:43:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(477838, 44936, 10084, '<td valign="top">The strange shadow in the back is distracting. If it was complete black the subject would stand out more. The composition if very good. Tweaking the color satuaration should help the petals really pop out of the shot.</td>', 'The strange shadow in the back is distracting. If it was complete black the subject would stand out more. The composition if very good. Tweaking the color satuaration should help the petals really pop out of the shot.', '2003-11-09 05:48:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(477839, 45401, 13735, '<td valign="top">Splendid motif capture - I wonder if it could be composed a little bit better</td>', 'Splendid motif capture - I wonder if it could be composed a little bit better', '2003-11-09 06:05:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(477840, 45058, 13735, '<td valign="top">Splendid raster!</td>', 'Splendid raster!', '2003-11-09 06:12:13.000000', NULL, 1),
