(478204, 45083, 2437, '<td valign="top">nicely done... perfect</td>', 'nicely done... perfect', '2003-11-09 21:21:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(478205, 45018, 10402, '<td valign="top">The arrangement of the fruit is nicely done and I like their mottled coloring. The diagonal striped background is too much when viewed close-up, but fortunately my wife distracted me while making this comment so I saw the photo from further away; then the lines blend together and somehow gives the image a lot of depth.</td>', 'The arrangement of the fruit is nicely done and I like their mottled coloring. The diagonal striped background is too much when viewed close-up, but fortunately my wife distracted me while making this comment so I saw the photo from further away; then the lines blend together and somehow gives the image a lot of depth.', '2003-11-09 21:21:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(478208, 45565, 3295, '<td valign="top">like the lighting, odd placement of the spoon.</td>', 'like the lighting, odd placement of the spoon.', '2003-11-09 21:24:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(478212, 45444, 3295, '<td valign="top">guitar could have been better light with a softer, mor interesting light</td>', 'guitar could have been better light with a softer, mor interesting light', '2003-11-09 21:27:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(478213, 44870, 3295, '<td valign="top">Nice photo, not a still life.</td>', 'Nice photo, not a still life.', '2003-11-09 21:28:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(478214, 45314, 3295, '<td valign="top">nice photo, interesting, not a still life.</td>', 'nice photo, interesting, not a still life.', '2003-11-09 21:28:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(478220, 45638, 10402, '<td valign="top">I like the selection of objects and the way you''ve arranged them. The lighting is good too. But I don''t care for the composition; the negative space detracts from the feeling of the image. It also needs to be a little sharper.</td>', 'I like the selection of objects and the way you''ve arranged them. The lighting is good too. But I don''t care for the composition; the negative space detracts from the feeling of the image. It also needs to be a little sharper.', '2003-11-09 21:36:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(478222, 45243, 13047, '<td valign="top">......wow!</td>', '......wow!', '2003-11-09 21:39:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(478230, 44504, 13047, '<td valign="top">Potential for a really good photo. However; It looks like a spur of the moment kind of thing. I really admire the energy and intensity in the the subject though. Perhaps a different angle that would''ve excluded the disstractions in the upper right hand corner?</td>', 'Potential for a really good photo. However; It looks like a spur of the moment kind of thing. I really admire the energy and intensity in the the subject though. Perhaps a different angle that would''ve excluded the disstractions in the upper right hand corner?', '2003-11-09 21:45:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(478235, 45233, 12131, '<td valign="top">I like this shot but the head light is distracting.  I think I would have liked it more if it was just the leaves on the shiny black background or if you showed the grill instead of the light to let on what the background is. Still beautiful. 7</td>', 'I like this shot but the head light is distracting.  I think I would have liked it more if it was just the leaves on the shiny black background or if you showed the grill instead of the light to let on what the background is. Still beautiful. 7', '2003-11-09 21:47:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(478239, 45633, 12131, '<td valign="top">If I scroll fast enough the flames look like they''re moving.  It''s cool. Lovely hughes.</td>', 'If I scroll fast enough the flames look like they''re moving.  It''s cool. Lovely hughes.', '2003-11-09 21:48:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(478244, 45060, 12131, '<td valign="top">I''d almost call you a cheat but this is too clever.  Nice clear screen too.</td>', 'I''d almost call you a cheat but this is too clever.  Nice clear screen too.', '2003-11-09 21:50:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(478246, 45630, 12131, '<td valign="top">I like the subject but the blurring is distracting.</td>', 'I like the subject but the blurring is distracting.', '2003-11-09 21:52:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(478248, 44692, 12131, '<td valign="top">Is that all carved out of one piece?  Its gorgeous work, whatever the material.</td>', 'Is that all carved out of one piece?  Its gorgeous work, whatever the material.', '2003-11-09 21:53:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(478250, 45595, 12131, '<td valign="top">There''s a way to turn off an alarm clock.</td>', 'There''s a way to turn off an alarm clock.', '2003-11-09 21:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(478251, 45429, 13047, '<td valign="top">I''m giving you a 7 just for the sheer creativity of this photo. what''s preventing a 10 is that it isn''t centered and your depth of field is a little too long.(background isn''t blurry enough</td>', 'I''m giving you a 7 just for the sheer creativity of this photo. what''s preventing a 10 is that it isn''t centered and your depth of field is a little too long.(background isn''t blurry enough', '2003-11-09 21:55:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(478254, 44949, 12922, '<td valign="top">I really like the use of negative space, and how the glass looks like it''s filled with the blackness behind it.  Only the glint of red (and the title!) lets you know it''s wine.  Very good job--top 10 if not a ribbon</td>', 'I really like the use of negative space, and how the glass looks like it''s filled with the blackness behind it.  Only the glint of red (and the title!) lets you know it''s wine.  Very good job--top 10 if not a ribbon', '2003-11-09 21:57:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(478257, 45385, 12922, '<td valign="top">Great shot!  Though it looks to me like you need to *use* those wrenches =)</td>', 'Great shot!  Though it looks to me like you need to *use* those wrenches =)', '2003-11-09 21:59:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(478259, 45639, 13047, '<td valign="top">great photo! i would''ve liked to have seen a little more detail on the grapes though.</td>', 'great photo! i would''ve liked to have seen a little more detail on the grapes though.', '2003-11-09 22:00:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(478263, 45267, 13047, '<td valign="top">Unique idea.I really dig the southwestern Thanksgiving center piece theme. I do think however, that a lower angle and an offset a little to the right, would have greatly improved the over all presentation.</td>', 'Unique idea.I really dig the southwestern Thanksgiving center piece theme. I do think however, that a lower angle and an offset a little to the right, would have greatly improved the over all presentation.', '2003-11-09 22:12:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(478265, 45479, 13091, '<td valign="top">Good shot. I like that one.</td>', 'Good shot. I like that one.', '2003-11-09 22:16:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(478266, 45327, 13047, '<td valign="top">Cool! Maybe a little wider shot next time to include the rest of the tuning knob and sound hole?</td>', 'Cool! Maybe a little wider shot next time to include the rest of the tuning knob and sound hole?', '2003-11-09 22:16:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(478270, 44949, 13047, '<td valign="top">I''d be really interested in seeing if anybody can actually find something to critique in this photo.The use of negative space and color contrast&amp; rhyme is just awesome. Amazing work!</td>', 'I''d be really interested in seeing if anybody can actually find something to critique in this photo.The use of negative space and color contrast& rhyme is just awesome. Amazing work!', '2003-11-09 22:22:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(478280, 45504, 7778, '<td valign="top">I''m rating this image -slightly- higher than originally impulsed. I do value it as a raw capture which would lend itself to an interesting photo, if processed advantageously. What I see in it is  a textural and relief quality unique to pottery, tapestry or antique prints, which, IMO, could have been taken further than it has been here via careful post-processing (inversion, desaturation, contrast and brightness adjustments?).<br/> <br/>The fact that the source for such semblances is an ordinary tire track, is likely as interesting to me as it was to the author of this image. The -pressed- leaf  could relate paper as a medium...</td>', 'I''m rating this image -slightly- higher than originally impulsed. I do value it as a raw capture which would lend itself to an interesting photo, if processed advantageously. What I see in it is  a textural and relief quality unique to pottery, tapestry or antique prints, which, IMO, could have been taken further than it has been here via careful post-processing (inversion, desaturation, contrast and brightness adjustments?). The fact that the source for such semblances is an ordinary tire track, is likely as interesting to me as it was to the author of this image. The -pressed- leaf  could relate paper as a medium...', '2003-11-09 22:38:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(478281, 44630, 13047, '<td valign="top">I''m so overwhelmed by the idea of this photo that I could''nt even begin to critique the technicals. I hope to see a ribbon on this next week. An utterly astounding 10</td>', 'I''m so overwhelmed by the idea of this photo that I could''nt even begin to critique the technicals. I hope to see a ribbon on this next week. An utterly astounding 10', '2003-11-09 22:38:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(478287, 45292, 13047, '<td valign="top">Cool photo. I find the harsh shadows a little distracting though</td>', 'Cool photo. I find the harsh shadows a little distracting though', '2003-11-09 22:44:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(478301, 45089, 10402, '<td valign="top">A very harmonious and pleasing arrangement. The colors and texture work very well together. The soft lighting and focus almost make it look like a painting. Wonderful image.</td>', 'A very harmonious and pleasing arrangement. The colors and texture work very well together. The soft lighting and focus almost make it look like a painting. Wonderful image.', '2003-11-09 22:56:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(478304, 44919, 13047, '<td valign="top">Cool idea! Maybe a longer depth of field?</td>', 'Cool idea! Maybe a longer depth of field?', '2003-11-09 22:59:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(478308, 45260, 13047, '<td valign="top">I find the background a little too contrasty. Excellent approach though!</td>', 'I find the background a little too contrasty. Excellent approach though!', '2003-11-09 23:01:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(478315, 45296, 13047, '<td valign="top">Depth of field is perfect. i would have like to have seen a little more of the rose to the left, and the dark pink rose blurred in the background is a little distracting.</td>', 'Depth of field is perfect. i would have like to have seen a little more of the rose to the left, and the dark pink rose blurred in the background is a little distracting.', '2003-11-09 23:07:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(478317, 45294, 10402, '<td valign="top">I like the pun and the arrangement of the items. Good lighting. A bit soft, but the contrasting textures are evident even without sharpening.</td>', 'I like the pun and the arrangement of the items. Good lighting. A bit soft, but the contrasting textures are evident even without sharpening.', '2003-11-09 23:09:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(478318, 44833, 13047, '<td valign="top">I find the whole scene just a little too busy. Perhaps elimenating the top 1/3 of the photo might improve it significantly?</td>', 'I find the whole scene just a little too busy. Perhaps elimenating the top 1/3 of the photo might improve it significantly?', '2003-11-09 23:10:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(478320, 45353, 10402, '<td valign="top">The painting makes a great background. I like the distinct groups of objects.</td>', 'The painting makes a great background. I like the distinct groups of objects.', '2003-11-09 23:12:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(478336, 45083, 10402, '<td valign="top">Simple effective arrangement, though showing the removed cork would have been a nice touch. The reflection of the photographer in the glass is a bit distracting.</td>', 'Simple effective arrangement, though showing the removed cork would have been a nice touch. The reflection of the photographer in the glass is a bit distracting.', '2003-11-09 23:29:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(478350, 45318, 10402, '<td valign="top">The soft warm lighting works with the subject to give a nice meditative effect. The neon border distracts from the feeling.</td>', 'The soft warm lighting works with the subject to give a nice meditative effect. The neon border distracts from the feeling.', '2003-11-09 23:42:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(478356, 45550, 10402, '<td valign="top">Nice choice of objects artfully arranged. The starlight effect adds a nice modern twist to this classic art form.</td>', 'Nice choice of objects artfully arranged. The starlight effect adds a nice modern twist to this classic art form.', '2003-11-09 23:48:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(478477, 45312, 12253, '<td valign="top">Nice arrangement and someone is very good at baseball.  Next time try to diffuse the light through a sheet or something, to minimize reflections.  Maybe would have stood out more with a black background; with velvet you would not have had the light reflecting back either; .  Lastly, needs a bit more sharpness IMHO.  Perhaps just a matter of doing more USM wihen resizing if the original was sharp.</td>', 'Nice arrangement and someone is very good at baseball.  Next time try to diffuse the light through a sheet or something, to minimize reflections.  Maybe would have stood out more with a black background; with velvet you would not have had the light reflecting back either; .  Lastly, needs a bit more sharpness IMHO.  Perhaps just a matter of doing more USM wihen resizing if the original was sharp.', '2003-11-10 01:34:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(478478, 45046, 12253, '<td valign="top">Nice light and tones.</td>', 'Nice light and tones.', '2003-11-10 01:35:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(478479, 45086, 12253, '<td valign="top">Good idea and a good backdrop setup.  Would have been good to avoid the reflection of the lights in the cup, and perhaps a lower exposure as the orange rind looks hot.</td>', 'Good idea and a good backdrop setup.  Would have been good to avoid the reflection of the lights in the cup, and perhaps a lower exposure as the orange rind looks hot.', '2003-11-10 01:36:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(478480, 45636, 12253, '<td valign="top">Nice material and setup for a still life.  I think the whole neck of the mandolin should have  been in it.  Perhaps this might have looked more professional with a better home studio setup (backdrop over background and table.)</td>', 'Nice material and setup for a still life.  I think the whole neck of the mandolin should have  been in it.  Perhaps this might have looked more professional with a better home studio setup (backdrop over background and table.)', '2003-11-10 01:38:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(478482, 45260, 12253, '<td valign="top">I like the setup here; one issue: the light on the lemons and on the table in places is hot.</td>', 'I like the setup here; one issue: the light on the lemons and on the table in places is hot.', '2003-11-10 01:39:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(478486, 44475, 12253, '<td valign="top">Not sure I would classify this as still life, but it''s definitely creative and different.</td>', 'Not sure I would classify this as still life, but it''s definitely creative and different.', '2003-11-10 01:41:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(478487, 44923, 12253, '<td valign="top">Very nicely laid out.</td>', 'Very nicely laid out.', '2003-11-10 01:41:49.000000', NULL, 1),
