(478687, 45621, 13440, '<td valign="top">Nice color and contrst. I like the details on the picture... Well done.</td>', 'Nice color and contrst. I like the details on the picture... Well done.', '2003-11-10 09:07:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(478726, 44964, 6008, '<td valign="top">There has been a lot of desat with one color photos recently, and I think that has made those type of images not have the usually high impact they can normally have. However, this is certainly more than just a desat with one color photo. The black/white background and square dish is certainly what makes this stand out. The leaves of the pineapple going off into the black is good too. The fruit arrangement is good, but I dont know, just something doesnt feel right about it. It''s sharp, clear, clean, clever. I like it!</td>', 'There has been a lot of desat with one color photos recently, and I think that has made those type of images not have the usually high impact they can normally have. However, this is certainly more than just a desat with one color photo. The black/white background and square dish is certainly what makes this stand out. The leaves of the pineapple going off into the black is good too. The fruit arrangement is good, but I dont know, just something doesnt feel right about it. It''s sharp, clear, clean, clever. I like it!', '2003-11-10 10:24:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(478729, 45053, 6008, '<td valign="top">I love the simplicity of this! And what an unusual item to see on a plate too. It''s so off the wall and different I think it stands out the most. Who would have thought a chicken bone on a plate would look so ''pretty''. Great photo!</td>', 'I love the simplicity of this! And what an unusual item to see on a plate too. It''s so off the wall and different I think it stands out the most. Who would have thought a chicken bone on a plate would look so ''pretty''. Great photo!', '2003-11-10 10:25:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(478731, 45211, 13440, '<td valign="top">Nice work, color and conntrast are nice. Well done!</td>', 'Nice work, color and conntrast are nice. Well done!', '2003-11-10 10:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(478753, 44856, 11467, '<td valign="top">Nice, but I''m not sure if the soft focus is a little overdone for my likeing</td>', 'Nice, but I''m not sure if the soft focus is a little overdone for my likeing', '2003-11-10 11:10:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(478763, 44949, 8139, '<td valign="top">subtle dark tones.almost abstract. I like it.</td>', 'subtle dark tones.almost abstract. I like it.', '2003-11-10 11:29:08.000000', NULL, 1),
