(478837, 45643, 6008, '<td valign="top">I can see where you are trying for dramatic lighting, but the shadows on the right are just a little too dark and as such distract from the overall mood. Perhaps a soft light on the right could have lightened up that area just a little. As a still life goes, this is something different for me, but it works well. The contrasts on the book is good, it''s just the background that could have done with a ltitle more tweaking. Overall it''s a good shot.</td>', 'I can see where you are trying for dramatic lighting, but the shadows on the right are just a little too dark and as such distract from the overall mood. Perhaps a soft light on the right could have lightened up that area just a little. As a still life goes, this is something different for me, but it works well. The contrasts on the book is good, it''s just the background that could have done with a ltitle more tweaking. Overall it''s a good shot.', '2003-11-10 12:21:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(478841, 44584, 4090, '<td valign="top">good focus, would like to see more reflesion in the chrome of the tools but good compostion , like the blue light 9/10</td>', 'good focus, would like to see more reflesion in the chrome of the tools but good compostion , like the blue light 9/10', '2003-11-10 12:22:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(478843, 45083, 7291, '<td valign="top">It''s so hard to compete against you guys with your fancy set ups, studios and lighting.  Great picture, looks like something right out of a procut catalog.</td>', 'It''s so hard to compete against you guys with your fancy set ups, studios and lighting.  Great picture, looks like something right out of a procut catalog.', '2003-11-10 12:23:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(478845, 44653, 11467, '<td valign="top">Nice, but over sharpened!</td>', 'Nice, but over sharpened!', '2003-11-10 12:24:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(478846, 44526, 7190, '<td valign="top">This pix has me going since not too crazy about florals ,  but the lightnings is ok, the vase could be further away from the background, the colors work, and  the texture of the vase come through. it is the I don''t give a "flying" how you jammed in the flowers that takes away from the picture</td>', 'This pix has me going since not too crazy about florals ,  but the lightnings is ok, the vase could be further away from the background, the colors work, and  the texture of the vase come through. it is the I don''t give a "flying" how you jammed in the flowers that takes away from the picture', '2003-11-10 12:24:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(478848, 44585, 7291, '<td valign="top">Great colors.  Looks a little over sharpened  but it still has a nice effect.</td>', 'Great colors.  Looks a little over sharpened  but it still has a nice effect.', '2003-11-10 12:25:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(478850, 45339, 11467, '<td valign="top">The shadow is a little harsh on the left egg.</td>', 'The shadow is a little harsh on the left egg.', '2003-11-10 12:26:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(478851, 45493, 6008, '<td valign="top">This is cute! First thing I noticed was the background - I liked the mix of black/white and how the line is not harsh but blurred/faded nicely. The shadows beneath the statue/eggs are also cute, much better there than falling off to the side, front, or back. The lighting is excellent, not overexposing the whites at all (that I can see) and yet still being bright enough to be very clear and sharp. The light highlights on his shoes are also good! Of course the fact that the subject you have chosen is also humorous, clever, and original (to me) helps, but your photographic treatment of them is great.</td>', 'This is cute! First thing I noticed was the background - I liked the mix of black/white and how the line is not harsh but blurred/faded nicely. The shadows beneath the statue/eggs are also cute, much better there than falling off to the side, front, or back. The lighting is excellent, not overexposing the whites at all (that I can see) and yet still being bright enough to be very clear and sharp. The light highlights on his shoes are also good! Of course the fact that the subject you have chosen is also humorous, clever, and original (to me) helps, but your photographic treatment of them is great.', '2003-11-10 12:26:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(478853, 45314, 12526, '<td valign="top">Interesting but maybe better focus could bring this photo alive</td>', 'Interesting but maybe better focus could bring this photo alive', '2003-11-10 12:27:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(478858, 45450, 12526, '<td valign="top">Good vison, problem is that there are too many great sunset or sunrise photos so for them to win they have to be perfect. This could be close to perfect if the telephone cord wasn''t in the picture</td>', 'Good vison, problem is that there are too many great sunset or sunrise photos so for them to win they have to be perfect. This could be close to perfect if the telephone cord wasn''t in the picture', '2003-11-10 12:29:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(478860, 45621, 12526, '<td valign="top">Interesting depiction</td>', 'Interesting depiction', '2003-11-10 12:29:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(478862, 44701, 4090, '<td valign="top">how cute ....</td>', 'how cute ....', '2003-11-10 12:29:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(478863, 44467, 12526, '<td valign="top">I swear I used to live there</td>', 'I swear I used to live there', '2003-11-10 12:29:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(478864, 45347, 6008, '<td valign="top">Not sure how this was done but I like it. The wood tones on the recorder (I''m not a musical instrument expert) are nice and warm and very appealing to me. The diagonal composition is great. The overlayed musical notes adds a nice dimension and completes the ''package'' the image presents. The matching border is good, although I''m almost tempted to say a little too bright - a duller yellow picked from the darker yellow area of the recorder may have been better.</td>', 'Not sure how this was done but I like it. The wood tones on the recorder (I''m not a musical instrument expert) are nice and warm and very appealing to me. The diagonal composition is great. The overlayed musical notes adds a nice dimension and completes the ''package'' the image presents. The matching border is good, although I''m almost tempted to say a little too bright - a duller yellow picked from the darker yellow area of the recorder may have been better.', '2003-11-10 12:29:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(478866, 45487, 12526, '<td valign="top">interesting capture. nice</td>', 'interesting capture. nice', '2003-11-10 12:30:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(478868, 44949, 12526, '<td valign="top">Great depiction, creates an interesting story</td>', 'Great depiction, creates an interesting story', '2003-11-10 12:31:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(478869, 45299, 12526, '<td valign="top">Interesting story along with this?</td>', 'Interesting story along with this?', '2003-11-10 12:31:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(478870, 45629, 12526, '<td valign="top">I love the story being told</td>', 'I love the story being told', '2003-11-10 12:32:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(478872, 45347, 4090, '<td valign="top">stunning ... light, focus  ... cool 10/10</td>', 'stunning ... light, focus  ... cool 10/10', '2003-11-10 12:32:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(478873, 45348, 6008, '<td valign="top">What great colors! I''m curious if this was painted specially for the challenge or you normally have a painted water tap. Either way, I think it really stands out, especially against the black background. Lighting is good, although there is a slight yellow reflection on the green. I also like the addition of the water droplet. The sunflower continues the theme of bright summer colors. The petals seem a touch on the soft side, but in a way that compliments the flower more and makes it stand out more against the tap. Very colorful and great image!</td>', 'What great colors! I''m curious if this was painted specially for the challenge or you normally have a painted water tap. Either way, I think it really stands out, especially against the black background. Lighting is good, although there is a slight yellow reflection on the green. I also like the addition of the water droplet. The sunflower continues the theme of bright summer colors. The petals seem a touch on the soft side, but in a way that compliments the flower more and makes it stand out more against the tap. Very colorful and great image!', '2003-11-10 12:34:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(478877, 45629, 9441, '<td valign="top">what a wonderful photo!  Good, rich color....terrific clarity, and the background adds so much interest to the foreground...overall, it''s a fantastic shot...a 10 in my opinion</td>', 'what a wonderful photo!  Good, rich color....terrific clarity, and the background adds so much interest to the foreground...overall, it''s a fantastic shot...a 10 in my opinion', '2003-11-10 12:43:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(478881, 45208, 9441, '<td valign="top">fantastic composition and cropping.  The colors are wonderful, and the texture and detail captured here are excellent.  The closeup up is wonderfully clear...congrats on a great photo!  I''m giving this one a 10.</td>', 'fantastic composition and cropping.  The colors are wonderful, and the texture and detail captured here are excellent.  The closeup up is wonderfully clear...congrats on a great photo!  I''m giving this one a 10.', '2003-11-10 12:47:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(478883, 45507, 9441, '<td valign="top">I love this photo!  It is such a clean, clear, and wonderful shot.  I really like the black and white you chose for this.  Such a nice subject choice, I can''t find anything about this photo that I don''t like..good job!  10 from me for this...congrats!</td>', 'I love this photo!  It is such a clean, clear, and wonderful shot.  I really like the black and white you chose for this.  Such a nice subject choice, I can''t find anything about this photo that I don''t like..good job!  10 from me for this...congrats!', '2003-11-10 12:48:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(478886, 45454, 9441, '<td valign="top">Beautiful, vivid color....wonderfully clear and crisp!  Nice job!!  10</td>', 'Beautiful, vivid color....wonderfully clear and crisp!  Nice job!!  10', '2003-11-10 12:49:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(478895, 44562, 9441, '<td valign="top">nice macro and lighting...shows good detail</td>', 'nice macro and lighting...shows good detail', '2003-11-10 12:52:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(478897, 45265, 9441, '<td valign="top">what an interesting shot....very nice color and lighting</td>', 'what an interesting shot....very nice color and lighting', '2003-11-10 12:53:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(478901, 44713, 9441, '<td valign="top">nicely done..the graininess, lighting and color choice add to the feeling of desolation and abandonment...good job!</td>', 'nicely done..the graininess, lighting and color choice add to the feeling of desolation and abandonment...good job!', '2003-11-10 12:54:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(478902, 45537, 9441, '<td valign="top">terrific composition...wonderful clarity.  The choice of colors is fabulous.  The wonderful curves make this a very interesting shot...good job!  10</td>', 'terrific composition...wonderful clarity.  The choice of colors is fabulous.  The wonderful curves make this a very interesting shot...good job!  10', '2003-11-10 12:55:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(478903, 45568, 9441, '<td valign="top">great macro!  I love the detail of his wings and face, really stands out against the blurred background.</td>', 'great macro!  I love the detail of his wings and face, really stands out against the blurred background.', '2003-11-10 12:55:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(478906, 45329, 9441, '<td valign="top">I like the lighting and softness of this photo...good job</td>', 'I like the lighting and softness of this photo...good job', '2003-11-10 12:58:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(478909, 45433, 9441, '<td valign="top">good composition and nice lighting...good clarity and color</td>', 'good composition and nice lighting...good clarity and color', '2003-11-10 12:59:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(478990, 45353, 4008, '<td valign="top">A fine setup with wonderful elements. I find the lighting a bit lifeless. Also composition might have been stronger by getting closer, showing less of the tablecloth and more of the silver.</td>', 'A fine setup with wonderful elements. I find the lighting a bit lifeless. Also composition might have been stronger by getting closer, showing less of the tablecloth and more of the silver.', '2003-11-10 14:06:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(478994, 45472, 4008, '<td valign="top">Love the light in this one. Strong composition and use of Depth of field as well.</td>', 'Love the light in this one. Strong composition and use of Depth of field as well.', '2003-11-10 14:08:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(478996, 45397, 4008, '<td valign="top">Just gorgeous. pinsharp, good use of colors and different structures. Maybe not a classical still life, but still fitting in my opinion.</td>', 'Just gorgeous. pinsharp, good use of colors and different structures. Maybe not a classical still life, but still fitting in my opinion.', '2003-11-10 14:10:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(479002, 45426, 4008, '<td valign="top">nice picture, but not a still life</td>', 'nice picture, but not a still life', '2003-11-10 14:13:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(479005, 45627, 4008, '<td valign="top">beautiful composed, well lit, attractive picture, all in all a great image</td>', 'beautiful composed, well lit, attractive picture, all in all a great image', '2003-11-10 14:25:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(479006, 44973, 7364, '<td valign="top">why is it backwards?</td>', 'why is it backwards?', '2003-11-10 14:25:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(479007, 45389, 7364, '<td valign="top">This is excellent, thank you for your submission!</td>', 'This is excellent, thank you for your submission!', '2003-11-10 14:26:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(479020, 44922, 4008, '<td valign="top">Great color, lovely simple setup, great leaves selected. Image does not look totally sharp and I don''t like the one branch going out of the image in the corner.</td>', 'Great color, lovely simple setup, great leaves selected. Image does not look totally sharp and I don''t like the one branch going out of the image in the corner.', '2003-11-10 14:35:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(479030, 44903, 6130, '<td valign="top">I like this and the frame is very good.</td>', 'I like this and the frame is very good.', '2003-11-10 14:42:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(479032, 45317, 6130, '<td valign="top">Very nice.</td>', 'Very nice.', '2003-11-10 14:43:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(479033, 45263, 6130, '<td valign="top">Funny.</td>', 'Funny.', '2003-11-10 14:43:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(479034, 44553, 6130, '<td valign="top">Unusual and good.</td>', 'Unusual and good.', '2003-11-10 14:45:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(479036, 45530, 5391, '<td valign="top">Beautiful lighting - I love how it fades to black at the bottom of the apples!</td>', 'Beautiful lighting - I love how it fades to black at the bottom of the apples!', '2003-11-10 14:47:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(479039, 45083, 4090, '<td valign="top">this is a great photo only one wee thing is the corkstrew being cut off and a touch sharper 8/10 - just copied this a using microsoft photo editor and sharpered it by 1 makes it a better photo</td>', 'this is a great photo only one wee thing is the corkstrew being cut off and a touch sharper 8/10 - just copied this a using microsoft photo editor and sharpered it by 1 makes it a better photo', '2003-11-10 14:50:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(479040, 45603, 5391, '<td valign="top">Beautiful lighting, very traditional.  Really is reminiscent of a painting.</td>', 'Beautiful lighting, very traditional.  Really is reminiscent of a painting.', '2003-11-10 14:51:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(479042, 45638, 5391, '<td valign="top">Good use of composition and getting in close to not have background elements distracting.  A soft warm-colored side light would really make this pop and give it "mood".</td>', 'Good use of composition and getting in close to not have background elements distracting.  A soft warm-colored side light would really make this pop and give it "mood".', '2003-11-10 14:54:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(479043, 45586, 7364, '<td valign="top">You lucky duck, We''ve got people submitting pictures of frost covered trees, snow on the ground, Autumn leaves, and you give us a picture of a fairway and a golf ball.  This sucks!  (good for you though).</td>', 'You lucky duck, We''ve got people submitting pictures of frost covered trees, snow on the ground, Autumn leaves, and you give us a picture of a fairway and a golf ball.  This sucks!  (good for you though).', '2003-11-10 14:54:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(479045, 44898, 5391, '<td valign="top">Good shot, clever composition - really "art" worthy.  Don''t worry too much if many here don''t appreciate it for not having an immediate "wow" factor.  It''s a great shot.  9</td>', 'Good shot, clever composition - really "art" worthy.  Don''t worry too much if many here don''t appreciate it for not having an immediate "wow" factor.  It''s a great shot.  9', '2003-11-10 14:56:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(479048, 44902, 5391, '<td valign="top">One of the better kinds of these shots that I''ve ever seen.  Good composition, nice dynamics that lead the eye around the image, and the blue tones make it feel "clean".  8</td>', 'One of the better kinds of these shots that I''ve ever seen.  Good composition, nice dynamics that lead the eye around the image, and the blue tones make it feel "clean".  8', '2003-11-10 14:58:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(479050, 44498, 6130, '<td valign="top">Very beautiful and good.</td>', 'Very beautiful and good.', '2003-11-10 15:00:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(479052, 45642, 5391, '<td valign="top">Beautiful work.  (Much nicer lighting than mine!)  10</td>', 'Beautiful work.  (Much nicer lighting than mine!)  10', '2003-11-10 15:03:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(479054, 45458, 6130, '<td valign="top">I like this very much and I always fond of pic with shoes on.</td>', 'I like this very much and I always fond of pic with shoes on.', '2003-11-10 15:06:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(479057, 45434, 5391, '<td valign="top">A polarizing filter would cut those glares out that are over the numbers 9 and 3.  That would be a big help to the photograph.</td>', 'A polarizing filter would cut those glares out that are over the numbers 9 and 3.  That would be a big help to the photograph.', '2003-11-10 15:06:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(479058, 45387, 6130, '<td valign="top">Beautiful and I like it.</td>', 'Beautiful and I like it.', '2003-11-10 15:07:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(479059, 45233, 5391, '<td valign="top">I''d have never guessed that something like this could look so beautiful.  Fantastic work.  10</td>', 'I''d have never guessed that something like this could look so beautiful.  Fantastic work.  10', '2003-11-10 15:07:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(479060, 45304, 6130, '<td valign="top">Is this ironic or ?</td>', 'Is this ironic or ?', '2003-11-10 15:09:02.000000', NULL, 1),
