(479478, 45642, 14042, '<td valign="top">This picture makes no sense. I guess I know that "an apple a day keeps the doctor away," but there are no prescriptions in nature. This had potential.</td>', 'This picture makes no sense. I guess I know that "an apple a day keeps the doctor away," but there are no prescriptions in nature. This had potential.', '2003-11-10 20:24:35.000000', NULL, 1),
