(479481, 44573, 14042, '<td valign="top">I don''t know, it''s great to take pictures of everything and anything you can, but this looks like it was taken as photographic evidence of property damage for you insurance company. Get down and dirty with you photography...go up close and make you subject speak out for you.</td>', 'I don''t know, it''s great to take pictures of everything and anything you can, but this looks like it was taken as photographic evidence of property damage for you insurance company. Get down and dirty with you photography...go up close and make you subject speak out for you.', '2003-11-10 20:26:13.000000', NULL, 1),
