(479484, 44916, 10402, '<td valign="top">The blue plate is a nice contrast with the green and I like its refracted image on the tablecloth. But the overall image is too soft and I find the noise distracting.</td>', 'The blue plate is a nice contrast with the green and I like its refracted image on the tablecloth. But the overall image is too soft and I find the noise distracting.', '2003-11-10 20:27:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(479485, 45114, 14042, '<td valign="top">Ooooo... this is good. But why is the rose green? The delicacy of a rosebud is accentuated by it''s warm, delicate colors. If you wanted to give off a feeling of desolation, why not place the rose in snow instead of just a plain white backround?</td>', 'Ooooo... this is good. But why is the rose green? The delicacy of a rosebud is accentuated by it''s warm, delicate colors. If you wanted to give off a feeling of desolation, why not place the rose in snow instead of just a plain white backround?', '2003-11-10 20:27:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(479487, 45452, 14042, '<td valign="top">Make this photograph more mystical by spreading that hazy light thoughout the picture.</td>', 'Make this photograph more mystical by spreading that hazy light thoughout the picture.', '2003-11-10 20:28:29.000000', NULL, 1),
