(479497, 45058, 14044, '<td valign="top">I love the texture captured on the door.  It is such a contrast to the very regular brick pattern.  The depth is great -- I want to step out into the room to see what lies around the corner.  Nice touch with having the lower door just slightly ahead of the top -- not sure if you planned that!</td>', 'I love the texture captured on the door.  It is such a contrast to the very regular brick pattern.  The depth is great -- I want to step out into the room to see what lies around the corner.  Nice touch with having the lower door just slightly ahead of the top -- not sure if you planned that!', '2003-11-10 20:32:36.000000', NULL, 1),
