(479512, 45375, 10402, '<td valign="top">The pie has great color and texture; it would make a great center of interest. But the bowl holding the pecans, being larger and darker, steals it away. Having them spread on the table beside the pie would make them a vital but non-distracting element. Add a few more elements (perhaps some eggs and a pie server) and choose a more interesting background and you''d have the makings of a great still life.</td>', 'The pie has great color and texture; it would make a great center of interest. But the bowl holding the pecans, being larger and darker, steals it away. Having them spread on the table beside the pie would make them a vital but non-distracting element. Add a few more elements (perhaps some eggs and a pie server) and choose a more interesting background and you''d have the makings of a great still life.', '2003-11-10 20:37:45.000000', NULL, 1),
