(479517, 45348, 14044, '<td valign="top">Fun Shot -- loads of color. Can''t help but smile when I see a sun flower.  I expect it to reach up and turn the water on.  But, when the water comes out - it comes out in  colors!  Nice!</td>', 'Fun Shot -- loads of color. Can''t help but smile when I see a sun flower.  I expect it to reach up and turn the water on.  But, when the water comes out - it comes out in  colors!  Nice!', '2003-11-10 20:39:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(479518, 45550, 14042, '<td valign="top">Jesus...go work for a f*cking dinnerware catalog.<br/> <br/>Well you definitely deserve my apologies, and i definitely deserve a swift kick in the ass. Shouldn''t have been so mean. It''s not for me to say your work sucks, only to judge honestly what I like and don''t like. Honestly, I don''t like this picture, but I would be be remiss if I didn''t say this: your photo "It''s a journey, not a destination" is, to me, the embodiment of beauty. Had you entered it in this contest, I would have given you an 11, if that were possible; it''s a photo for which you should get some serious recognition. So don''t take me personally.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2003-11-12 01:31:36.</i></td>', 'Jesus...go work for a f*cking dinnerware catalog. Well you definitely deserve my apologies, and i definitely deserve a swift kick in the ass. Shouldn''t have been so mean. It''s not for me to say your work sucks, only to judge honestly what I like and don''t like. Honestly, I don''t like this picture, but I would be be remiss if I didn''t say this: your photo "It''s a journey, not a destination" is, to me, the embodiment of beauty. Had you entered it in this contest, I would have given you an 11, if that were possible; it''s a photo for which you should get some serious recognition. So don''t take me personally.', '2003-11-10 20:39:55.000000', '2003-11-12 01:31:36.000000', 1),
