(480050, 44498, 8522, '<td valign="top">Wonderful subtle colours and tones captured here. I feel that the composition lets it down though... the ratio of negative space to subject seems haphazard and not thought out. Perhaps a tighter crop? 8</td>', 'Wonderful subtle colours and tones captured here. I feel that the composition lets it down though... the ratio of negative space to subject seems haphazard and not thought out. Perhaps a tighter crop? 8', '2003-11-11 08:49:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(480055, 44973, 8522, '<td valign="top">I''m sure it is within the rules to do a horizontal flip so the writing would be the right way round. The shadows and corners in the background seem accidental rather than deliberate, and take away from the 4 subjects. The photo is crying out for unsharp mask. I think the photo could do with a curves adjustment to increase the contrast without losing the shadow detail. 4</td>', 'I''m sure it is within the rules to do a horizontal flip so the writing would be the right way round. The shadows and corners in the background seem accidental rather than deliberate, and take away from the 4 subjects. The photo is crying out for unsharp mask. I think the photo could do with a curves adjustment to increase the contrast without losing the shadow detail. 4', '2003-11-11 08:53:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(480060, 45347, 8522, '<td valign="top">Bravo! I''m guessing you used a projector... now I want one for all my instrument shots! I really would have prefered the top-left to bottom-right diagonal though, the one you chose always seems to jar with me. I think the border needs to be a bit more subtle... a good border never draws attention away from what it''s framing IMO.The hue is just a little too yellow-orange for my taste, and looks just a little like the wrong white balance was used. However, I love this photo... and now desperately want to copy it! 9</td>', 'Bravo! I''m guessing you used a projector... now I want one for all my instrument shots! I really would have prefered the top-left to bottom-right diagonal though, the one you chose always seems to jar with me. I think the border needs to be a bit more subtle... a good border never draws attention away from what it''s framing IMO.The hue is just a little too yellow-orange for my taste, and looks just a little like the wrong white balance was used. However, I love this photo... and now desperately want to copy it! 9', '2003-11-11 09:00:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(480087, 45640, 13438, '<td valign="top">Essential; but i miss humanity. Probably my character, but it''s just a feeling. In "still life" there is "still" and there is "life". Gave you an 8 but won''t hang it above the bed</td>', 'Essential; but i miss humanity. Probably my character, but it''s just a feeling. In "still life" there is "still" and there is "life". Gave you an 8 but won''t hang it above the bed', '2003-11-11 09:43:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(480089, 45442, 13438, '<td valign="top">Love the contruction, colour contrasts, highlights seem blown-out on my monitor.</td>', 'Love the contruction, colour contrasts, highlights seem blown-out on my monitor.', '2003-11-11 09:45:31.000000', NULL, 1),
