(480094, 45539, 6668, '<td valign="top">Great idea, love the shinyness of the apples, only thing is that the red apple seems to be placed a little further to the left then the other apples so they aren''t lined up quite right which takes away from the allignment of the shot, but still very nice shot.</td>', 'Great idea, love the shinyness of the apples, only thing is that the red apple seems to be placed a little further to the left then the other apples so they aren''t lined up quite right which takes away from the allignment of the shot, but still very nice shot.', '2003-11-11 09:49:25.000000', NULL, 1),
