(480100, 45471, 6668, '<td valign="top">nice shot...love the fire in the background, certainly adds another element to the shot, gives it a warm cozy feeling if that makes sense. :-) 8</td>', 'nice shot...love the fire in the background, certainly adds another element to the shot, gives it a warm cozy feeling if that makes sense. :-) 8', '2003-11-11 09:51:50.000000', NULL, 1),
