(480105, 45595, 6668, '<td valign="top">don''t care for the carpet background, also photo seems a little dark.</td>', 'don''t care for the carpet background, also photo seems a little dark.', '2003-11-11 09:54:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(480107, 45016, 13438, '<td valign="top">love the tones, compostion. very Zen</td>', 'love the tones, compostion. very Zen', '2003-11-11 09:54:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(480108, 45537, 13438, '<td valign="top">I love the composition, colours, modernity. I just feel the light/shadows are harsh.</td>', 'I love the composition, colours, modernity. I just feel the light/shadows are harsh.', '2003-11-11 09:55:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(480126, 45399, 8522, '<td valign="top">Intriguing abstract... I don''t ''get'' how the title matches the picture, but I very much like the composition, textures and colours. It''s a little bit of a stretch from ''still life'' in my book for an 8+ score. However, score: 7</td>', 'Intriguing abstract... I don''t ''get'' how the title matches the picture, but I very much like the composition, textures and colours. It''s a little bit of a stretch from ''still life'' in my book for an 8+ score. However, score: 7', '2003-11-11 10:19:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(480134, 45451, 14042, '<td valign="top">You might think of you 7 as a job well done, a great mark. I look at it as a decrease in your potential. What I mean by this is that you are obviously unafraid to get up close to your subject, explore it''s nuances, get specific, find a theme. I just think leaves with raindrops are overused. Good job with the pic. Try some unconventional subject matter in the future.</td>', 'You might think of you 7 as a job well done, a great mark. I look at it as a decrease in your potential. What I mean by this is that you are obviously unafraid to get up close to your subject, explore it''s nuances, get specific, find a theme. I just think leaves with raindrops are overused. Good job with the pic. Try some unconventional subject matter in the future.', '2003-11-11 10:31:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(480136, 45577, 14042, '<td valign="top">I love when the photographer is bold. A lot of people on this website can''t say that; you can. You were unafraid to get up close to your subject and explore. You found an interesting subject, however I think we''d agree that the background isn''t ideal. But because you had the sense to focus wholey on the foreground, the juxtaposition, this photo turned out pretty well. The texture is amazing.</td>', 'I love when the photographer is bold. A lot of people on this website can''t say that; you can. You were unafraid to get up close to your subject and explore. You found an interesting subject, however I think we''d agree that the background isn''t ideal. But because you had the sense to focus wholey on the foreground, the juxtaposition, this photo turned out pretty well. The texture is amazing.', '2003-11-11 10:34:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(480138, 44650, 14042, '<td valign="top">I''ll tell you the only reason I gave this a 7: the lighting. Sure, it''s a bold perspective, it uses good focus techniques, even good design principles. It''s a very cliched perspective though. But the lighting, the personalities of the colors, blend together so that this picture gives you not only a sense of what your subject is, but in what setting your subject might be located.</td>', 'I''ll tell you the only reason I gave this a 7: the lighting. Sure, it''s a bold perspective, it uses good focus techniques, even good design principles. It''s a very cliched perspective though. But the lighting, the personalities of the colors, blend together so that this picture gives you not only a sense of what your subject is, but in what setting your subject might be located.', '2003-11-11 10:36:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(480139, 45594, 14042, '<td valign="top">Very cool concept (yes, it''s still life alright). You filmed the textures very well. You could have used this lighting to your advantage, however. A little patience on your part might have revealed some really complex shadows, with all the ridges of the fossilized skeleton. Good spacing--way to make your subject off-center, it shows you have a good idea of spatial design.</td>', 'Very cool concept (yes, it''s still life alright). You filmed the textures very well. You could have used this lighting to your advantage, however. A little patience on your part might have revealed some really complex shadows, with all the ridges of the fossilized skeleton. Good spacing--way to make your subject off-center, it shows you have a good idea of spatial design.', '2003-11-11 10:38:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(480142, 45639, 14042, '<td valign="top">This picture needs a lot. First, there''s a clash between unpeeled fruit and untouched fruit. You bring this conflict to light because you failed to focus on just one subject. All the fruit tends to have the same focus. The orange and it''s rind have such potential for texture exploration, but you haven''t exploited it.</td>', 'This picture needs a lot. First, there''s a clash between unpeeled fruit and untouched fruit. You bring this conflict to light because you failed to focus on just one subject. All the fruit tends to have the same focus. The orange and it''s rind have such potential for texture exploration, but you haven''t exploited it.', '2003-11-11 10:40:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(480146, 45253, 14042, '<td valign="top">There is one thing that you should change about this, and it''s glaring. Get that regularly stained wood panel on the right side out. Get it out! Zoom in, work more closely with your subject. Don''t be afraid to NOT show the whole scene; it illustrates that you are unafraid as a photographer and willing to take risks in the pursuit of a perfectly crafted composition. You need to exploit the texture, the feeling of the wood grasping these hooks.</td>', 'There is one thing that you should change about this, and it''s glaring. Get that regularly stained wood panel on the right side out. Get it out! Zoom in, work more closely with your subject. Don''t be afraid to NOT show the whole scene; it illustrates that you are unafraid as a photographer and willing to take risks in the pursuit of a perfectly crafted composition. You need to exploit the texture, the feeling of the wood grasping these hooks.', '2003-11-11 10:42:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(480162, 45016, 8522, '<td valign="top">Beautiful, minimalist shot. Great and unusual composition. Nice range of tones. 9</td>', 'Beautiful, minimalist shot. Great and unusual composition. Nice range of tones. 9', '2003-11-11 10:55:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(480168, 45048, 8522, '<td valign="top">My favourite shot this challenge. Wonderful purple, great lighting, effective composition. 10</td>', 'My favourite shot this challenge. Wonderful purple, great lighting, effective composition. 10', '2003-11-11 10:57:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(480177, 45640, 8522, '<td valign="top">Creative shot, very imaginative high-key picture. Refracted light always seems to do well here at DPC, so I expect to see this score highly. Interesting juxtaposition of straight lines and curves. The splash of blue works nicely. 9</td>', 'Creative shot, very imaginative high-key picture. Refracted light always seems to do well here at DPC, so I expect to see this score highly. Interesting juxtaposition of straight lines and curves. The splash of blue works nicely. 9', '2003-11-11 10:59:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(480179, 45053, 8522, '<td valign="top">A seemingly simple shot, captured perfectly. The reflections in the plate work well. The range of tones and exposure are perfect. The lighting is just right. The only thing I would criticise is the amount of negative space, which doesn''t quite work for me. 9</td>', 'A seemingly simple shot, captured perfectly. The reflections in the plate work well. The range of tones and exposure are perfect. The lighting is just right. The only thing I would criticise is the amount of negative space, which doesn''t quite work for me. 9', '2003-11-11 11:02:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(480183, 45083, 12733, '<td valign="top">It''s a nice arrangement and a pretty wood-grain table. I would have liked to have seen the translucence of the wine in the bottle and glass - that''s one of the beautiful things about colored liquid. Perhaps a second light behind the setup would have brought this out.</td>', 'It''s a nice arrangement and a pretty wood-grain table. I would have liked to have seen the translucence of the wine in the bottle and glass - that''s one of the beautiful things about colored liquid. Perhaps a second light behind the setup would have brought this out.', '2003-11-11 11:04:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(480184, 44922, 8522, '<td valign="top">Wonderful shot, everything is so right in this photo. Gorgeous green, great composition, nice use of negative space. I love the round leaves. The white background works brilliantly. 10</td>', 'Wonderful shot, everything is so right in this photo. Gorgeous green, great composition, nice use of negative space. I love the round leaves. The white background works brilliantly. 10', '2003-11-11 11:04:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(480190, 45456, 6130, '<td valign="top">Funny.</td>', 'Funny.', '2003-11-11 11:06:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(480192, 45558, 12733, '<td valign="top">A very nice study in the various surfaces glass can provide, along with a beautiful variety of colors and shapes. But watch out that the law doesn''t track you back and charge you with possession of drug paraphernalia.</td>', 'A very nice study in the various surfaces glass can provide, along with a beautiful variety of colors and shapes. But watch out that the law doesn''t track you back and charge you with possession of drug paraphernalia.', '2003-11-11 11:07:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(480195, 44562, 6130, '<td valign="top">How did You get this idea ? Funny.</td>', 'How did You get this idea ? Funny.', '2003-11-11 11:08:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(480196, 44955, 12733, '<td valign="top">Nice idea and a nice shape. The lighting seems a bit flat, however.</td>', 'Nice idea and a nice shape. The lighting seems a bit flat, however.', '2003-11-11 11:08:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(480200, 44562, 12733, '<td valign="top">Interesting idea and an interesting combination of shapes, texture and angles. Other than to take a picture, why would anyone want to reconstitute a potato?</td>', 'Interesting idea and an interesting combination of shapes, texture and angles. Other than to take a picture, why would anyone want to reconstitute a potato?', '2003-11-11 11:12:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(480201, 44491, 12733, '<td valign="top">The in-focus cat is very cute, but the foreground is so far out of focus that it spoile the effect.</td>', 'The in-focus cat is very cute, but the foreground is so far out of focus that it spoile the effect.', '2003-11-11 11:14:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(480203, 45236, 12733, '<td valign="top">Nice handling of the glass and metal textures. I think I''d like it better if the depth of field were great enough to sharpen the sugar server.</td>', 'Nice handling of the glass and metal textures. I think I''d like it better if the depth of field were great enough to sharpen the sugar server.', '2003-11-11 11:16:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(480206, 45247, 12733, '<td valign="top">Nice colors and shapes. I think the out of focus leaves at the left tend to detract from the main subject.</td>', 'Nice colors and shapes. I think the out of focus leaves at the left tend to detract from the main subject.', '2003-11-11 11:18:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(480223, 45588, 3084, '<td valign="top">Wisconsin, USA<br/>Lac du Flambeau on the Lac du Flambeau Indian Reservation<br/>West of Arbor Vitae<br/>North of Reservation Highway 5<br/>on the east side of the point<br/>just off Sunrise Camp Road<br/>give or take 30 metres for your GPS SA error<br/> <br/>Is this a recent photograph?</td>', 'Wisconsin, USALac du Flambeau on the Lac du Flambeau Indian ReservationWest of Arbor VitaeNorth of Reservation Highway 5on the east side of the pointjust off Sunrise Camp Roadgive or take 30 metres for your GPS SA error Is this a recent photograph?', '2003-11-11 11:32:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(480230, 45354, 12733, '<td valign="top">Interesting arrangement and lighting. I like the shadows of the fork on the wall (shelf?)</td>', 'Interesting arrangement and lighting. I like the shadows of the fork on the wall (shelf?)', '2003-11-11 11:38:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(480235, 45324, 12733, '<td valign="top">The lampposts are interesting shapes in the fog. I think this would be a spectacular shot if the lamps were lit!</td>', 'The lampposts are interesting shapes in the fog. I think this would be a spectacular shot if the lamps were lit!', '2003-11-11 11:39:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(480241, 45431, 12733, '<td valign="top">Is the shadow of the drummer thrown on the surface of the drum, or is there another statue behind the drum head? This is a thought-provoking image, with interesting lighting and composition.</td>', 'Is the shadow of the drummer thrown on the surface of the drum, or is there another statue behind the drum head? This is a thought-provoking image, with interesting lighting and composition.', '2003-11-11 11:43:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(480243, 44483, 12733, '<td valign="top">The black-and-white treatment of metallic textures is great. So is the contrast between the metal and the cloth.</td>', 'The black-and-white treatment of metallic textures is great. So is the contrast between the metal and the cloth.', '2003-11-11 11:45:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(480245, 45016, 12733, '<td valign="top">Send light through a leaf and you''ve got a great picture - that''s practically a cliche. But the way you have it arranged with the grasses really makes this picture stand out.</td>', 'Send light through a leaf and you''ve got a great picture - that''s practically a cliche. But the way you have it arranged with the grasses really makes this picture stand out.', '2003-11-11 11:46:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(480246, 45635, 5822, '<td valign="top">Interesting contrast of colors but I think your lighting could be improved so that you don''t get that hot spot on the back plate and I also wish the blue was more saturated and green wasn''t so dull. The most vivid color is the background and I think it should be the green of the circuit board.</td>', 'Interesting contrast of colors but I think your lighting could be improved so that you don''t get that hot spot on the back plate and I also wish the blue was more saturated and green wasn''t so dull. The most vivid color is the background and I think it should be the green of the circuit board.', '2003-11-11 11:47:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(480253, 45333, 12733, '<td valign="top">Nice composition, great glass texture contrasts well with the chips and cards.</td>', 'Nice composition, great glass texture contrasts well with the chips and cards.', '2003-11-11 11:49:56.000000', NULL, 1),
