(480299, 44898, 13772, '<td valign="top">Makes you think.</td>', 'Makes you think.', '2003-11-11 12:20:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(480304, 45296, 5822, '<td valign="top">I love the soft pastels but while I like the backlighting, I find it to be too strong so that the background roses are too washed out and merge and detract from the main rose. I also think some fill light could have been used to illuminate the bottom of the photo more to show the greens of the stems better. Good DOF.</td>', 'I love the soft pastels but while I like the backlighting, I find it to be too strong so that the background roses are too washed out and merge and detract from the main rose. I also think some fill light could have been used to illuminate the bottom of the photo more to show the greens of the stems better. Good DOF.', '2003-11-11 12:23:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(480325, 45357, 12937, '<td valign="top">Nioce!</td>', 'Nioce!', '2003-11-11 12:35:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(480334, 45401, 14042, '<td valign="top">Keep trying, NYU boy. I think this photo would be better if you''d left out all the reflections except for the tree. Get rid of the brick on the bottom too, there''s too much going on. Keep your photos true to their meaning. You want to show a reflection, so focus on the reflection.</td>', 'Keep trying, NYU boy. I think this photo would be better if you''d left out all the reflections except for the tree. Get rid of the brick on the bottom too, there''s too much going on. Keep your photos true to their meaning. You want to show a reflection, so focus on the reflection.', '2003-11-11 12:39:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(480335, 44510, 13578, '<td valign="top">Not still life</td>', 'Not still life', '2003-11-11 12:39:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(480339, 44722, 13578, '<td valign="top">Vever nice and colorfull picture but not really still life</td>', 'Vever nice and colorfull picture but not really still life', '2003-11-11 12:42:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(480343, 45288, 14042, '<td valign="top">Looking back at this photo, I don''t know why I didn''t give you a 7 at first. This really took some skill on your party. I have a problem with it being in color, however. You''ve gone to great lengths to craft the shadows in this photograph, contrasting light and dark, black and white. The wood fretboard only serves to break up this otherwise picturesque example of juxtaposition. Your title is very wistful; b&amp;w photography captures wistfullness best.</td>', 'Looking back at this photo, I don''t know why I didn''t give you a 7 at first. This really took some skill on your party. I have a problem with it being in color, however. You''ve gone to great lengths to craft the shadows in this photograph, contrasting light and dark, black and white. The wood fretboard only serves to break up this otherwise picturesque example of juxtaposition. Your title is very wistful; b&w photography captures wistfullness best.', '2003-11-11 12:45:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(480344, 44830, 14044, '<td valign="top">Good shot -- would like to see more of the background. Nice!</td>', 'Good shot -- would like to see more of the background. Nice!', '2003-11-11 12:46:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(480347, 45233, 14042, '<td valign="top">A cool concept, a clean shot, but you need to recognize the perspective flaws that your photograph contains. This is a shot that is contingent upon clarity. The black car, the exquisite detail of the headlamps, the general opacity of the leaves...they add to the clarity. The reflections on the hood of the car, though, detract...majorly detract. I like how you were bold enough to zoom in, though...many people aren''t confident that the viewer will be able to recognize their subjects if they were to zoom in. Keep trying.</td>', 'A cool concept, a clean shot, but you need to recognize the perspective flaws that your photograph contains. This is a shot that is contingent upon clarity. The black car, the exquisite detail of the headlamps, the general opacity of the leaves...they add to the clarity. The reflections on the hood of the car, though, detract...majorly detract. I like how you were bold enough to zoom in, though...many people aren''t confident that the viewer will be able to recognize their subjects if they were to zoom in. Keep trying.', '2003-11-11 12:48:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(480349, 45474, 14044, '<td valign="top">I am not a chess player --- but this shot is interesting.   Is the position significant?  Sorry for being clueless on chess.  <br/> <br/></td>', 'I am not a chess player --- but this shot is interesting.   Is the position significant?  Sorry for being clueless on chess.   ', '2003-11-11 12:48:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(480350, 45397, 14042, '<td valign="top">The reason I gave you a 6 was because of your subject matter. Your design elements--spacing, clarity, perspective, even cropping--are perfect. It''s just a very cliched, overused subject. Now that I look at it again, I''ll add an extra point, because this really is good photography. But it''s never good to hop on the bandwagon as a photographer.</td>', 'The reason I gave you a 6 was because of your subject matter. Your design elements--spacing, clarity, perspective, even cropping--are perfect. It''s just a very cliched, overused subject. Now that I look at it again, I''ll add an extra point, because this really is good photography. But it''s never good to hop on the bandwagon as a photographer.', '2003-11-11 12:50:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(480351, 45112, 14044, '<td valign="top">Good concept - background distracts my eye!  Can''t help notice the little character in the background.  He looks like he really wants to escape from his glass prison.</td>', 'Good concept - background distracts my eye!  Can''t help notice the little character in the background.  He looks like he really wants to escape from his glass prison.', '2003-11-11 12:50:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(480352, 45213, 13578, '<td valign="top">Love the idea one of the best I have seen. In my eye the berries take away from the natural still look and to much yellow contrast pulls the eyes to the right not allowing for a natural centered look.</td>', 'Love the idea one of the best I have seen. In my eye the berries take away from the natural still look and to much yellow contrast pulls the eyes to the right not allowing for a natural centered look.', '2003-11-11 12:51:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(480353, 45621, 14042, '<td valign="top">Very cool, but I don''t like the black space. You should have totally zoomed in on the broom, focused the viewer''s attention fully on the textures and color. Maybe even get rid of the red clamp at the end and just have the bristles and red twine.</td>', 'Very cool, but I don''t like the black space. You should have totally zoomed in on the broom, focused the viewer''s attention fully on the textures and color. Maybe even get rid of the red clamp at the end and just have the bristles and red twine.', '2003-11-11 12:51:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(480354, 45253, 14044, '<td valign="top">For whatever reason this is cool -- I think it is the slant.  After all , where would we be without coat hooks?</td>', 'For whatever reason this is cool -- I think it is the slant.  After all , where would we be without coat hooks?', '2003-11-11 12:51:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(480355, 44923, 14042, '<td valign="top">Nice, but on second glance, you need to work on increasing you photo''s resolution. And watch out for those shadows, too. They detract from your overall design immensely.</td>', 'Nice, but on second glance, you need to work on increasing you photo''s resolution. And watch out for those shadows, too. They detract from your overall design immensely.', '2003-11-11 12:52:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(480358, 45449, 14044, '<td valign="top">Not sure the flouro bulb helps.</td>', 'Not sure the flouro bulb helps.', '2003-11-11 12:53:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(480361, 44630, 6130, '<td valign="top">I like this.</td>', 'I like this.', '2003-11-11 12:54:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(480362, 45640, 14042, '<td valign="top">A really cool concept. I think you might have wasted your excellent magnifying glass technique on too boring a subject. Use the magnifying glass to uncover a message, a meaning. Magnify a sweater to show that it''s only made up of delicate threads. Magnify a silvery fish to illustrate that it''s incandescence is a function of hundreds of shiny scales. This is just a distortion of an otherwise boring glass.</td>', 'A really cool concept. I think you might have wasted your excellent magnifying glass technique on too boring a subject. Use the magnifying glass to uncover a message, a meaning. Magnify a sweater to show that it''s only made up of delicate threads. Magnify a silvery fish to illustrate that it''s incandescence is a function of hundreds of shiny scales. This is just a distortion of an otherwise boring glass.', '2003-11-11 12:56:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(480365, 45450, 14042, '<td valign="top">Alright, I guess I was tired last night and failed to see the power line across the top. You very well may have been going for some sort of ironic "nature obscured by technology" message, but in that case you should have shown more technology, like a telephone poll or a transformer box. Sorry, you go down.</td>', 'Alright, I guess I was tired last night and failed to see the power line across the top. You very well may have been going for some sort of ironic "nature obscured by technology" message, but in that case you should have shown more technology, like a telephone poll or a transformer box. Sorry, you go down.', '2003-11-11 12:57:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(480367, 44830, 14042, '<td valign="top">Leaves are inherently cliched...everyone uses them. When I saw this picture as a thumbnail, I actually became (mildly) excited, because I thought you had captured this leaf falling in mid-air. Alas, I was disappointed. Very detailed, but in the end, very boring.</td>', 'Leaves are inherently cliched...everyone uses them. When I saw this picture as a thumbnail, I actually became (mildly) excited, because I thought you had captured this leaf falling in mid-air. Alas, I was disappointed. Very detailed, but in the end, very boring.', '2003-11-11 12:59:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(480370, 45636, 14042, '<td valign="top">Get that blue lamp out! You''ve got such nice earth tones--browns, yellows, soft pinks, greens--contrasted delicately by white lace...and then you introduce blue. Too much! Keep in mind the roles that color plays in your photos.</td>', 'Get that blue lamp out! You''ve got such nice earth tones--browns, yellows, soft pinks, greens--contrasted delicately by white lace...and then you introduce blue. Too much! Keep in mind the roles that color plays in your photos.', '2003-11-11 13:01:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(480372, 44791, 14042, '<td valign="top">It looks so moldy...a good capture, but also: it''s just floating there. What''s it''s meaning, where''s it going, what''s beautiful about it? You have to think about these things if you''re seriously vying for a win.</td>', 'It looks so moldy...a good capture, but also: it''s just floating there. What''s it''s meaning, where''s it going, what''s beautiful about it? You have to think about these things if you''re seriously vying for a win.', '2003-11-11 13:02:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(480376, 45323, 14042, '<td valign="top">Kudos for using black and white...it so classicly captures this picture; it gives it it''s own story. This picture is very good, but it could stand to gain from changes in contrast. All the objects (and there''s a lot of them) have very similar color patterns, except for this urn. Exploit that. Make the blacks blacker and the greys lighter, without washing out the whole picture. You''d get more gnarly pumpkins, more delicate cornstalks, and a more weathered urn.</td>', 'Kudos for using black and white...it so classicly captures this picture; it gives it it''s own story. This picture is very good, but it could stand to gain from changes in contrast. All the objects (and there''s a lot of them) have very similar color patterns, except for this urn. Exploit that. Make the blacks blacker and the greys lighter, without washing out the whole picture. You''d get more gnarly pumpkins, more delicate cornstalks, and a more weathered urn.', '2003-11-11 13:09:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(480377, 44723, 5728, '<td valign="top">At first I thought the face was too grainy but on closer inspection I see it is just the texture. Good lighting, the harsh glares on her hair at the front don''t bother me at all. This is one of the few color desaturated photos Ihave seen that I like.</td>', 'At first I thought the face was too grainy but on closer inspection I see it is just the texture. Good lighting, the harsh glares on her hair at the front don''t bother me at all. This is one of the few color desaturated photos Ihave seen that I like.', '2003-11-11 13:09:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(480380, 45409, 5728, '<td valign="top">Ah a Russian camera! Nice set up, the lighting is pretty good, although I am missing some details on the camera being lost to darkness. That and the tape on the side of the camera is all I can really comment on, otherwise it''s good.</td>', 'Ah a Russian camera! Nice set up, the lighting is pretty good, although I am missing some details on the camera being lost to darkness. That and the tape on the side of the camera is all I can really comment on, otherwise it''s good.', '2003-11-11 13:11:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(480384, 45572, 14042, '<td valign="top">The leaf on the apple...it''s just bad. In fact, the whole front apple is out of focus. This shot has ultimate potential because of its rustic nature, but you''ve got to concentrate more on detail and clarity.<br/> <br/>...and get rid of that leaf.</td>', 'The leaf on the apple...it''s just bad. In fact, the whole front apple is out of focus. This shot has ultimate potential because of its rustic nature, but you''ve got to concentrate more on detail and clarity. ...and get rid of that leaf.', '2003-11-11 13:18:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(480385, 45606, 5728, '<td valign="top">You''re pretty brave letting the world look into your bathroom cabinet :-)  From the looks of it you are a single guy living alone, right? Good idea, and definitely a different take on still life, like it.</td>', 'You''re pretty brave letting the world look into your bathroom cabinet :-)  From the looks of it you are a single guy living alone, right? Good idea, and definitely a different take on still life, like it.', '2003-11-11 13:20:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(480386, 44553, 5728, '<td valign="top">All I can say is beautiful! Such detail and saturation, even the perspective is amazing. I want this one to get a ribbon!</td>', 'All I can say is beautiful! Such detail and saturation, even the perspective is amazing. I want this one to get a ribbon!', '2003-11-11 13:21:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(480388, 44987, 13957, '<td valign="top">Great concept, but needs more light</td>', 'Great concept, but needs more light', '2003-11-11 13:22:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(480389, 45262, 14042, '<td valign="top">good filter. i''m not too crazy about the whole dinnerware setup (centerpieces aren''t meant to be photographed), but you''ve got a good sense of design. This photo needs more clarity, better resolution. Textures go a long way when applying monotone filters. Texture goes a long way regardless, actually.</td>', 'good filter. i''m not too crazy about the whole dinnerware setup (centerpieces aren''t meant to be photographed), but you''ve got a good sense of design. This photo needs more clarity, better resolution. Textures go a long way when applying monotone filters. Texture goes a long way regardless, actually.', '2003-11-11 13:23:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(480390, 45058, 13957, '<td valign="top">Very nice... Thise would be great in B&amp;W...</td>', 'Very nice... Thise would be great in B&W...', '2003-11-11 13:24:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(480391, 45576, 13957, '<td valign="top">Excelent Light...</td>', 'Excelent Light...', '2003-11-11 13:25:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(480392, 45565, 14042, '<td valign="top">Upon further dissection, I''m gonna give you a 7. This really does feel like sunrise in the country. I think that, after spending so much time making comments to this challenge, I though your apples were tomatos, and that made no sense whatsoever to me. Keep trying; the submissions to this challenge were excellent, and this isn''t on par with the 10s, 9s, or 8s. But you''ve definitely got it in you.</td>', 'Upon further dissection, I''m gonna give you a 7. This really does feel like sunrise in the country. I think that, after spending so much time making comments to this challenge, I though your apples were tomatos, and that made no sense whatsoever to me. Keep trying; the submissions to this challenge were excellent, and this isn''t on par with the 10s, 9s, or 8s. But you''ve definitely got it in you.', '2003-11-11 13:25:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(480393, 45016, 5728, '<td valign="top">I new this would be a 10 from me even just by looking at the thumbnail. It is wonderful, so detailed and focused. The composition and color mix is spot on! Good one Jean (guess how I knew this was yours?) A fine piece of work from you as usual!</td>', 'I new this would be a 10 from me even just by looking at the thumbnail. It is wonderful, so detailed and focused. The composition and color mix is spot on! Good one Jean (guess how I knew this was yours?) A fine piece of work from you as usual!', '2003-11-11 13:26:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(480395, 44482, 13957, '<td valign="top">Very nice... Feels a little flat... I like to see just a hint brigher on the green of the candies...</td>', 'Very nice... Feels a little flat... I like to see just a hint brigher on the green of the candies...', '2003-11-11 13:27:16.000000', NULL, 1),
