(481481, 45558, 2677, '<td valign="top">Sorry, I know this wasn''t the best workl from me, I had just taken it for a friend and thought I would submit.  About the ebay.com comment, I don''t get it.  Sorry.  What are you talking about?!</td>', 'Sorry, I know this wasn''t the best workl from me, I had just taken it for a friend and thought I would submit.  About the ebay.com comment, I don''t get it.  Sorry.  What are you talking about?!', '2003-11-12 02:13:45.000000', NULL, 0),
(481483, 44562, 6999, '<td valign="top">Thanks for all the comments, as ever - all much appreciated. Unusually, I''ll go so far as to say the comments about the light are plain wrong - with a more even light the depth, texture and mood of the image would be ruined. Anyhow, it IS an even light, it''s just from one direction only - or one area only, perhaps.</td>', 'Thanks for all the comments, as ever - all much appreciated. Unusually, I''ll go so far as to say the comments about the light are plain wrong - with a more even light the depth, texture and mood of the image would be ruined. Anyhow, it IS an even light, it''s just from one direction only - or one area only, perhaps.', '2003-11-12 02:17:02.000000', NULL, 0),
(481490, 45389, 8759, '<td valign="top">Thank you for all your comments! The pic is not cropped and not rotated. I''ve just adjusted a little the levels and a little USM.</td>', 'Thank you for all your comments! The pic is not cropped and not rotated. I''ve just adjusted a little the levels and a little USM.', '2003-11-12 02:23:53.000000', NULL, 0),
(481491, 44493, 8987, '<td valign="top">Just a little comment: The overexposure of the background was intentional. Although I agree that perhaps it would have been better, if there were less.</td>', 'Just a little comment: The overexposure of the background was intentional. Although I agree that perhaps it would have been better, if there were less.', '2003-11-12 02:24:03.000000', NULL, 0),
