(481843, 44909, 13722, '<td valign="top">comment from the photographer :<br/> <br/>To begin with, no I''m not a kid, and any comment that is sarcastic and demeaning does not help me learn anything either. <br/> <br/>No, the shot did not take a second to set up. I set up many different variations of the scene and finally decided to submit this one. If you would read the threads under "current challenge" about still life you will find that many people found this a difficult subject. <br/> <br/>I feel I did well for my first entry. At least I did a classic definition of "still life" and didn''t submit a nature or pet shot. <br/> <br/></td>', 'comment from the photographer : To begin with, no I''m not a kid, and any comment that is sarcastic and demeaning does not help me learn anything either.  No, the shot did not take a second to set up. I set up many different variations of the scene and finally decided to submit this one. If you would read the threads under "current challenge" about still life you will find that many people found this a difficult subject.  I feel I did well for my first entry. At least I did a classic definition of "still life" and didn''t submit a nature or pet shot.  ', '2003-11-12 08:45:43.000000', NULL, 0),
(481854, 45552, 5112, '<td valign="top">Hi there, congratulations on a very good picture and finish!  And you almost beat your mom :))  This is a very mature picture, the composition and the colours are beautiful.  Take care,<br/> <br/>Ursula</td>', 'Hi there, congratulations on a very good picture and finish!  And you almost beat your mom :))  This is a very mature picture, the composition and the colours are beautiful.  Take care, Ursula', '2003-11-12 08:52:30.000000', NULL, 0),
(481892, 44713, 5318, '<td valign="top">Nice photo of feeling there.Great mood shot, wanna go hug him.</td>', 'Nice photo of feeling there.Great mood shot, wanna go hug him.', '2003-11-12 09:10:53.000000', NULL, 0),
(481943, 45330, 6008, '<td valign="top">The first thing I notice that I do not really care for are the red streaks. The composition is a little haphazard with the black areas. As the whole thing has a blue theme going I think it would have been beneficial to keep a consistent (or slightly gradient) blue background. I get the feeling of low light focus problems, probably not helped much by the reflective surface of what I assume is a CD. Along with the red streaks, the light flares on the right are a little distracting. I do like the way the glass beads handle the light, although the front left bead/chip is a little dark and could probably have done with being moved a little so the light could shine through it like the others. I gave this a 5 while voting. Clearly thought and time was put into the image, but I felt like there were some technical aspects that needed improving.</td>', 'The first thing I notice that I do not really care for are the red streaks. The composition is a little haphazard with the black areas. As the whole thing has a blue theme going I think it would have been beneficial to keep a consistent (or slightly gradient) blue background. I get the feeling of low light focus problems, probably not helped much by the reflective surface of what I assume is a CD. Along with the red streaks, the light flares on the right are a little distracting. I do like the way the glass beads handle the light, although the front left bead/chip is a little dark and could probably have done with being moved a little so the light could shine through it like the others. I gave this a 5 while voting. Clearly thought and time was put into the image, but I felt like there were some technical aspects that needed improving.', '2003-11-12 09:46:53.000000', NULL, 0),
(481965, 45550, 9504, '<td valign="top">Congrats!  Fabulous photo...</td>', 'Congrats!  Fabulous photo...', '2003-11-12 09:59:12.000000', NULL, 0),
(481966, 45330, 13381, '<td valign="top">I gave your shot an 8 when I voted on it. I love your use of color and light, and I don''t mind the red streak off to the right, but the yellowish reflections were a bit distracting.  Good job, overall. :)</td>', 'I gave your shot an 8 when I voted on it. I love your use of color and light, and I don''t mind the red streak off to the right, but the yellowish reflections were a bit distracting.  Good job, overall. :)', '2003-11-12 10:00:27.000000', NULL, 0),
