(482903, 44505, 13580, '<td valign="top">Thank you to all that commented on my photo of my old Canon A-1. I tend to agree with all that spoke of the strap coming back into the photo. I thought of ''taking it out'' with software, but I didn''t want to cheat! Had I had the chance to take it again, I would have followed all of your advice. Thanks so much for taking the time to comment!<br/> <br/>John.</td>', 'Thank you to all that commented on my photo of my old Canon A-1. I tend to agree with all that spoke of the strap coming back into the photo. I thought of ''taking it out'' with software, but I didn''t want to cheat! Had I had the chance to take it again, I would have followed all of your advice. Thanks so much for taking the time to comment! John.', '2003-11-12 17:13:18.000000', NULL, 0),
