(485633, 44814, 8597, '<td valign="top">Many of the comments here say that this image didn''t meet the criteria for a ''Still Life''.  And while agree with them if using the most traditional arts definition of the term, I was going for a stretch on the theme -- that the scene was still.  Anyway, I tried.  Thanks to those who liked my image anyway!!<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2003-11-14 16:35:58.</i></td>', 'Many of the comments here say that this image didn''t meet the criteria for a ''Still Life''.  And while agree with them if using the most traditional arts definition of the term, I was going for a stretch on the theme -- that the scene was still.  Anyway, I tried.  Thanks to those who liked my image anyway!!', '2003-11-14 16:34:39.000000', '2003-11-14 16:35:58.000000', 0),
