(498206, 45353, 13438, '<td valign="top">Thanks a lot for all these comments and suggestions. I just got aware of the fact comments can continue to be posted <b>after</b>voting. Sorry for being such a slow reactor, but THANKS again for your efforts. I feel i''m well surrounde and hope to be up to your efforts in the future.</td>', 'Thanks a lot for all these comments and suggestions. I just got aware of the fact comments can continue to be posted aftervoting. Sorry for being such a slow reactor, but THANKS again for your efforts. I feel i''m well surrounde and hope to be up to your efforts in the future.', '2003-11-29 08:13:51.000000', NULL, 0),
