(504363, 45564, 10084, '<td valign="top">The subjects are place in a nice composition. The flowers are arranged beautifully.<br/> <br/>I would have liked more color. Seems kind of flat. Also the reflective material in the cloth leads your eyes to it instead of the main subject. Maybe a narrower crop would help keep the interest there. I gave you a "7"</td>', 'The subjects are place in a nice composition. The flowers are arranged beautifully. I would have liked more color. Seems kind of flat. Also the reflective material in the cloth leads your eyes to it instead of the main subject. Maybe a narrower crop would help keep the interest there. I gave you a "7"', '2003-12-05 05:55:00.000000', NULL, 0),
