(742795, 45626, 7322, '<td valign="top">This is another shot the illustrates your unique vision. The textures are beautiful. You have a great eye for recognizing how texture can make the photograph in a  composition where there is very little tonal difference. Beautiful.</td>', 'This is another shot the illustrates your unique vision. The textures are beautiful. You have a great eye for recognizing how texture can make the photograph in a  composition where there is very little tonal difference. Beautiful.', '2004-05-30 18:47:58.000000', NULL, 0),
